"The eligible purchaser may select one (1) Brand New iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) or RM 5,500 Touch ’n Go eWallet credit for each qualifying SPA. Each option has a stated value of RM 5,500. This is one Reward per SPA; the options cannot be combined.": "符合资格的买方可为每份合格的 SPA 选择一 (1) 部全新 iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) 或 RM 5,500 Touch ’n Go 电子钱包额度。每项选项的标明价值为 RM 5,500。每份 SPA 仅限一份奖励；各选项不可合并。",
"For fulfilment of the Brand New iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) Reward, the Reward consists of one Brand New iPhone 18 Pro with 256GB storage; colour is subject to availability. iNewProject will confirm the fulfilment arrangements with the eligible purchaser.": "就全新 iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) 奖励的发放而言，该奖励为一部储存容量 256GB 的全新 iPhone 18 Pro；颜色视库存而定。iNewProject 将与符合资格的买方确认发放安排。",
"1 Qualifying SPA = 1 Reward. Choose one: Brand New iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) or Touch ’n Go eWallet credit. Each option is worth RM 5,500.": "1 份合格 SPA = 1 份奖励。二选一：全新 iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) 或 Touch ’n Go 电子钱包额度，每项价值 RM 5,500。",
