"Ancubic PJ Sdn. Bhd. is the developer of Rosedale and part of Ancubic Group, a Malaysian property and investment group whose completed developments include Cubic Botanical in South Bangsar, Kazen in Saujana Puchong and Suria Jaya in Shah Alam.": "Ancubic PJ Sdn. Bhd. 是 Rosedale 的发展商，隶属马来西亚产业与投资集团 Ancubic Group。集团已完工的发展项目包括南孟沙的 Cubic Botanical、Saujana Puchong 的 Kazen，以及莎阿南的 Suria Jaya。",
"Beyond property development, the group is expanding into integrated townships, industrial parks and commercial operations, with current projects including Ancubic Harmoni in Telok Panglima Garang and CG New Town in Bandar Bukit Tinggi. Rosedale is its freehold mixed-use address in Bandar Botanic, Klang.": "除了产业发展，集团也正拓展至综合城镇、工业园和商业营运，目前的项目包括位于 Telok Panglima Garang 的 Ancubic Harmoni，以及位于 Bandar Bukit Tinggi 的 CG New Town。Rosedale 则是集团位于巴生 Bandar Botanic 的永久地契综合发展项目。",
