"Imperial Land Sdn. Bhd. is a property developer and main contractor based in Klang, Selangor. Incorporated on 30 October 2000, the company primarily focuses on developing residential homes, with particular attention to the affordable housing market. Its operations combine property development with in-house construction capabilities, supported by an approach that emphasises practical planning, responsible building practices and continued innovation.": "Imperial Land Sdn. Bhd. 是一家立足雪兰莪巴生的产业发展商兼总承包商，于2000年10月30日注册成立，主要专注于发展住宅，尤其着重可负担房屋市场。公司结合产业发展与自家的建筑能力，秉持务实规划、负责任的施工作业和持续创新的理念。",
"The company’s documented residential portfolio includes completed single-storey housing developments such as Kampung Sungai Pinang in Pulau Indah and Taman Sungai Pinang, as well as Taman Srikandi, which includes single-storey semi-detached homes and a bungalow in Teluk Panglima Garang. Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 extends this experience into a compact landed development in Bukit Changgang, offering both single-storey terrace homes and a limited collection of larger bungalows.": "公司有记录的住宅项目包括已完工的单层房屋发展项目，例如 Pulau Indah 的 Kampung Sungai Pinang 和 Taman Sungai Pinang，以及位于 Teluk Panglima Garang、包括单层半独立式洋房和一间独立式洋房的 Taman Srikandi。Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 将这份经验延伸至 Bukit Changgang 一个精巧的有地住宅项目，提供单层排屋和数量有限的较大型独立式洋房。",
