"TuJu Residences is a mixed-use development set on 4.52 acres of leasehold land along Jalan Kuching, Kuala Lumpur. Its master plan comprises two 41-storey towers of 932 serviced apartments above a car park and facilities podium, with 38 strata retail lots on the ground and first floors. The development brings homes, everyday conveniences and leisure amenities together within one address.<0/> <1/> Designed for multigenerational living, TuJu offers ten configurable layouts from 710 to 1,442 sq ft, including dual-key and interconnectable options. More than 50 lifestyle facilities, including a 50-metre infinity lap pool, a gymnasium, a camping garden and the Level 41 Sky Roof, provide space for recreation, relaxation and community life. Integrated retail adds convenience, while Jalan Kuching and the DUKE connect residents to the wider city.": "TuJu Residences 是坐落于吉隆坡 Jalan Kuching 沿线、占地 4.52 英亩租赁地契土地的综合发展项目。总规划包括两栋 41 层高楼，共 932 个服务式公寓单位，建于停车场及设施裙楼之上，底层和一楼另设 38 个分层零售单位。项目将住家、日常便利与休闲设施汇聚于同一个地址。<0/> <1/> TuJu 专为多代同堂而设计，提供十种可灵活配置的格局，面积由 710 至 1,442 平方尺，包括双钥匙单位和可相通单位。超过 50 项生活设施，包括 50 米无边际泳道池、健身房、露营花园和第 41 层的 Sky Roof，为休闲、放松和社区生活提供空间。综合零售带来便利，Jalan Kuching 和杜克大道 (DUKE) 则将住户与整个城市连接起来。",
