"<0>Distinctive World Sdn Bhd</0>, the developer of TuJu Residences &amp; Retail at KL Duta North, is a joint venture between Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd, a member of Distinctive Group, and Eccaz Sdn Bhd.": "<0>Distinctive World Sdn Bhd</0> 是 KL Duta North 的 TuJu Residences &amp; Retail 的发展商，由 Distinctive Group 旗下的 Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd 与 Eccaz Sdn Bhd 合资组成。",
"<0>Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd</0> was founded by Dato’ Dr. David Koh and Mr. Lim Ech Chan in 2012 to tap into the property market in Johor, where the Group has successfully completed two projects, namely 1Tebrau and Iskandar Residences. Dato’ Dr. David Koh, through KLS Property Sdn Bhd, is also an active participant in the Klang Valley property market, with projects including Klang Utama Township in Klang, Bukit Kiara Residence and Eden Jalil, two luxurious landed residential projects in Bukit Jalil; and Vista Damai Residences, a high-rise residential development in KL City.": "<0>Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd</0> 由 Dato’ Dr. David Koh 与 Lim Ech Chan 先生于 2012 年创立，旨在进军柔佛产业市场，集团已在当地成功完成两个项目，即 1Tebrau 和 Iskandar Residences。Dato’ Dr. David Koh 也通过 KLS Property Sdn Bhd 活跃于巴生谷产业市场，项目包括巴生的 Klang Utama Township、位于武吉加里尔的两个豪华有地住宅项目 Bukit Kiara Residence 和 Eden Jalil，以及吉隆坡市区的高楼住宅项目 Vista Damai Residences。",
"Distinctive Group has also ventured into the Australian property market, with completed and ongoing projects in Perth, Australia, including its latest developments, Ora @ Sorrento and Serai @ Fremantle.": "Distinctive Group 也已进军澳洲产业市场，在澳洲珀斯拥有已完工及进行中的项目，包括最新的发展项目 Ora @ Sorrento 和 Serai @ Fremantle。",
"<0>Eccaz Sdn Bhd</0> was founded to venture into the property development and urban transportation businesses.": "<0>Eccaz Sdn Bhd</0> 的成立旨在进军产业发展和城市交通业务。",
"Eccaz is helmed by Ms. Monica Lai and Mr. Chan Chee Kian, who were respectively the Group Deputy Managing Director, and Executive Director of Ireka Corporation Berhad (ICB). Both are instrumental in development of ICB’s property arm and the development of its many notable high-end residential, commercial and hospitality projects in Kuala Lumpur. Among them are Seni Mont Kiara, KiaraVille, One Mont Kiara, The RuMa Hotel &amp; Residences and the Aloft Hotel at KL Sentral.": "Eccaz 由 Monica Lai 女士和 Chan Chee Kian 先生掌舵，两人曾分别担任 Ireka Corporation Berhad (ICB) 的集团副董事经理和执行董事。两人在 ICB 产业部门的发展，以及该公司在吉隆坡多个知名高端住宅、商业和酒店项目的发展中，都扮演了关键角色，其中包括 Seni Mont Kiara、KiaraVille、One Mont Kiara、The RuMa Hotel &amp; Residences 以及 KL Sentral 的 Aloft Hotel。",
"Level 31, Menara 1MK, Kompleks 1 Mont' Kiara, Premier Suite, No. 1, Jalan Kiara, Mont' Kiara, 50480 Kuala Lumpur.": "Level 31, Menara 1MK, Kompleks 1 Mont' Kiara, Premier Suite, No. 1, Jalan Kiara, Mont' Kiara, 50480 Kuala Lumpur.",
