"Disclaimer <0/>": "免责声明 <0/>",
"Last updated: 25 September 2026": "最后更新日期：2026年9月25日",
"1. General information only": "1. 仅属一般资料",
"The information on www.inewproject.com (the “Website”), operated by iNewProject Sdn. Bhd. (1695021-V) (“iNewProject”), is general information about new property launches. It is not an offer to sell, an invitation to buy, or legal, financial, tax or investment advice. Please get independent professional advice before making any property decision.": "www.inewproject.com（“本网站”）由 iNewProject Sdn. Bhd. (1695021-V)（“iNewProject”）运营，网站上的资料为有关新楼盘推介的一般资料。这些资料并不构成出售要约或购买邀约，亦不构成法律、财务、税务或投资建议。在作出任何产业决定前，请寻求独立的专业意见。",
"2. Developer information": "2. 发展商资料",
"Project details, including prices, availability, layouts, sizes, facilities, specifications, completion dates, licence and permit details and promotions, are provided by developers or taken from their materials and other sources. They may change without notice and may contain errors. Please confirm all details with the developer's sales representative, and check a developer's licence and advertising permit on the Ministry of Housing and Local Government's TEDUH portal, before you decide.": "项目详情，包括价格、供应情况、格局、面积、设施、规格、竣工日期、执照与准证详情以及优惠，均由发展商提供，或取自其资料及其他来源。这些详情可能未经通知而更改，也可能含有错误。在您作出决定前，请向发展商的销售代表确认所有详情，并在地方政府发展部的 TEDUH 门户网站查核发展商的执照及广告准证。",
"3. Images, plans and maps": "3. 图片、图则及地图",
"Images, videos, renderings, floor plans, site plans and maps may be artist's impressions or for illustration only. They are not to scale and may differ from the finished property.": "图片、视频、渲染图、平面图、地盘平面图及地图可能为效果图或仅供说明之用。这些资料并非按比例绘制，并可能与竣工后的产业有所不同。",
"4. Prices, availability and promotions": "4. 价格、供应情况及优惠",
"Prices, unit availability and promotions shown are indicative and can change until an SPA is signed. The developer confirms the final price, availability and sale terms.": "所显示的价格、单位供应情况及优惠仅供参考，在签署 SPA 之前均可能变动。最终价格、供应情况及销售条款由发展商确认。",
"5. e-Enquiries": "5. e-⁠Enquiry",
"An e-Enquiry is an enquiry only. It is not a booking, reservation or purchase, and it does not secure a unit or a price.": "e-⁠Enquiry 仅属询问。它并非预订、预留或购买，也不会为您锁定任何单位或价格。",
"6. Rewards": "6. 奖励",
"Rewards shown on the Website are offered and funded by iNewProject, not by developers, and are subject to our <0>e-Enquiry Rewards Terms &amp; Conditions</0>.": "本网站上显示的奖励由 iNewProject 提供及出资，而非由发展商提供，并须遵守我们的 <0>e-⁠Enquiry 奖励条款与条件</0>。",
"7. Estimates and tools": "7. 估算与工具",
"Calculators, travel times, distances and other estimates, such as loan instalments, are approximate and for guidance only. Actual figures depend on your lender, the developer and your circumstances.": "计算器、交通时间、距离及其他估算（例如贷款供款）均为约数，仅供参考。实际数字取决于您的贷款机构、发展商及您的个人情况。",
"8. Third-party links": "8. 第三方链接",
"Links to third-party websites are provided for convenience. iNewProject does not control or endorse them and is not responsible for their content.": "第三方网站的链接为方便起见而提供。iNewProject 并不控制或认可这些网站，亦不对其内容负责。",
"9. Limitation of liability": "9. 责任限制",
"To the maximum extent permitted by law, iNewProject is not liable for any loss or damage arising from reliance on information on the Website or from any transaction between you and a developer. Nothing in this Disclaimer excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.": "在法律允许的最大范围内，对于因依赖本网站上的资料，或因您与发展商之间的任何交易而产生的任何损失或损害，iNewProject 概不承担责任。本免责声明的任何内容均不排除依法不得排除的责任。",
"10. Trademarks": "10. 商标",
