"How <0>e-Enquiry Works</0>": "<0>e-⁠Enquiry</0> 如何运作",
"iNewProject helps you find new-launch properties in Malaysia, enquire about the exact unit you want, and get rewarded when you buy on selected projects. It's free for buyers.": "iNewProject 帮您寻找马来西亚的新楼盘，直接咨询您想要的单位，在指定项目购买还可获得奖励。买家完全免费使用。",
"STEP 1": "第 1 步",
"Browse new launches": "浏览新楼盘",
"See each project's prices, layouts, floor plans, location and developer in one place.": "一站查看每个项目的价格、格局、平面图、地点和发展商。",
"STEP 2": "第 2 步",
"Choose your unit": "挑选您的单位",
"On projects open for e-Enquiry, pick your tower or phase, then the level or row (depending on the property type) and your unit. Check its size, layout and listed price.": "在开放 e-⁠Enquiry 的项目中，先选择大楼或期数，再视产业类型选择楼层或排数，然后选定您的单位。查看单位的面积、格局和标价。",
"STEP 3": "第 3 步",
"Submit an e-Enquiry": "提交 e-⁠Enquiry",
"Send your e-Enquiry in a minute and receive an e-Enquiry Reference ID. An e-Enquiry is an enquiry only. It is not a booking or a reservation, and you don't pay anything to iNewProject.": "一分钟内即可提交 e-⁠Enquiry，并获得 e-⁠Enquiry 参考编号。e-⁠Enquiry 只是询问，并非预订或保留单位，您也无需向 iNewProject 支付任何费用。",
"STEP 4": "第 4 步",
"Or speak with the developer's sales representative first": "或先与发展商的销售代表聊聊",
"Not ready to choose a unit? Use <0>Speak With Sales Representative</0> on the project page to ask a question first.": "还没准备好挑选单位？可在项目页面使用<0>联系销售代表</0>，先把问题问清楚。",
"Either way, the developer's sales representative for that project will contact you to confirm availability, the latest price and promotions, arrange a viewing and guide you through your purchase.": "无论选择哪一种方式，该项目的发展商销售代表都会联系您，确认单位供应、最新价格和优惠，安排看房，并协助您完成购买。",
"STEP 5": "第 5 步",
"Sign your SPA and claim your reward": "签署 SPA，领取奖励",
"On projects that show an e-Enquiry reward, eligible buyers receive one reward for each signed and verified Sale and Purchase Agreement (SPA). The reward is funded by iNewProject, not the developer. You need an iNewProject member account before you buy, so register early, ideally before you submit your e-Enquiry.": "在标示 e-⁠Enquiry 奖励的项目中，符合资格的买家每签署一份并经核实的买卖合约 (SPA)，即可获得一份奖励。奖励由 iNewProject 出资，而非发展商。您必须在购买前拥有 iNewProject 会员账户，所以请尽早注册，最好在提交 e-⁠Enquiry 之前完成。",
"Full conditions: <0>e-Enquiry Rewards Terms &amp; Conditions</0>.": "完整条件：<0>e-⁠Enquiry 奖励条款与条件</0>。",
"Common questions": "常见问题",
"<0>Do I pay anything?</0><1/> No. Browsing, enquiring and claiming an eligible reward are free.": "<0>需要付费吗？</0><1/> 不需要。浏览、咨询以及领取符合资格的奖励，全部免费。",
"<0>Do I need an account?</0><1/> Not to enquire. To be eligible for a reward you need a member account before you buy, so it's best to register before you submit your e-Enquiry.": "<0>需要注册账户吗？</0><1/> 咨询不需要。但若要符合领取奖励的资格，您必须在购买前拥有会员账户，所以最好在提交 e-⁠Enquiry 前先注册。",
"<0>How do I see the e-Enquiries I have made?</0><1/> Log in to your iNewProject member account. Every e-Enquiry you submit while logged in is listed in your member dashboard. If you enquired without an account, keep the e-Enquiry Reference ID you received.": "<0>如何查看我提交过的 e-⁠Enquiry？</0><1/> 登录您的 iNewProject 会员账户。登录状态下提交的每一份 e-⁠Enquiry，都会列在您的会员仪表板中。如果您没有账户就提交了咨询，请保存好收到的 e-⁠Enquiry 参考编号。",
"<0>Who confirms my unit and price?</0><1/> The developer's sales representative. Availability, prices and promotions can change until your SPA is signed.": "<0>谁来确认我的单位和价格？</0><1/> 发展商的销售代表。在您签署 SPA 之前，单位供应、价格和优惠都可能有变。",
"<0>How is my information used?</0><1/> We share your enquiry with the developer and its sales representative for that project so they can assist you. See our <2>Privacy Policy</2>.": "<0>我的资料会如何使用？</0><1/> 我们会将您的咨询转交给该项目的发展商及其销售代表，以便他们为您提供协助。详情请参阅我们的<2>隐私政策</2>。",
