"About 7 Square @ Bukit Serdang": "关于 7 Square @ Bukit Serdang",
"7 Square @ Bukit Serdang is an industrial development of <0>49 two-storey linked factories</0> by PDMC Land (Serdang) Sdn Bhd, in Taman Perindustrian Putra Permai, Bukit Serdang, Selangor.": "7 Square @ Bukit Serdang 是 PDMC Land (Serdang) Sdn Bhd 在雪兰莪 Bukit Serdang 的 Taman Perindustrian Putra Permai 打造的工业项目，共有 <0>49 间双层排屋式工厂</0>。",
"Every unit is engineered for real production work: an <0>18-foot ground floor ceiling</0>, <1>10 kN/m² heavy-duty factory floor loading</1>, <2>150 amp three-phase power</2>, a <3>motorised roller shutter</3> and a <4>goods hoist</4> serving both levels. The ground floor is planned as factory space and the first floor as factory/warehouse, with two staircases, a front verandah and rear service areas.": "每个单位都为真正的生产作业而设计：<0>底楼楼高 18 尺</0>、<1>10 kN/m² 重型工厂楼面承重</1>、<2>150 安培三相电源</2>、<3>电动卷帘门</3>，以及贯通两层的<4>货物升降机</4>。底楼规划为厂房，一楼为厂房/仓库，设有两道楼梯、前廊和后方服务区。",
"Built-up runs from <0>6,600 sq ft</0> (33’×100’ intermediate) to <1>8,000 sq ft</1> (40’×100’ corner and end lots). Corner and end units carry additional land of up to 3,186 sq ft, giving a combined land and built-up area of up to <2>11,186 sq ft</2>.": "建筑面积从 <0>6,600 平方尺</0>（中间单位 33’×100’）到 <1>8,000 平方尺</1>（角头及尾端单位 40’×100’）。角头及尾端单位另附最多 3,186 平方尺的额外土地，土地加建筑面积合计可达 <2>11,186 平方尺</2>。",
"The estate is laid out around Jalan Perindustrian PP9 and PP7 with 40-foot back lanes, dedicated parking bays, TNB substations and a centralised OSD tank. It enjoys <0>excellent visibility from the MEX Highway</0>, with reach to the KL–Seremban Highway, Sungai Besi Highway, Bukit Jalil Highway and Kesas Highway — putting Kuala Lumpur, Puchong, Putrajaya and Seri Kembangan within easy operating distance.": "园区沿 Jalan Perindustrian PP9 和 PP7 规划，设有 40 尺后巷、专属停车位、TNB 变电站和集中式 OSD 蓄水池。项目<0>从 MEX 大道上一眼可见</0>，可通往吉隆坡–芙蓉大道、Sungai Besi 大道、武吉加里尔大道和 Kesas 大道，往返吉隆坡、蒲种、布城和沙登都很方便。",
"7 Square was a winner at the <0>StarProperty Awards 2024 — The Business Estate Award (Best Industrial Park Development)</0>.": "7 Square 荣获 <0>StarProperty Awards 2024 — The Business Estate Award (Best Industrial Park Development)</0>（最佳工业园发展项目）。",
"7-10 Acres": "7-10 英亩",
"Set within Taman Perindustrian Putra Permai in Bukit Serdang, Selangor, 7 Square is a leasehold industrial development of 49 two-storey linked factories, planned as a single self-contained estate on Lot 51440, Mukim Petaling.<0/> <1/> The master plan arranges the 49 units across four rows addressed off Jalan Perindustrian PP7, PP8 and PP9. Three terraces run across the site — two facing north and one facing south — while a fourth row sits along the eastern edge, facing west onto Jalan Perindustrian PP7. Four unit types are offered: KT1 intermediate lots of 6,600 sq ft built-up on a 33' x 100' lot; KT2 corner lots of 8,000 sq ft built-up with an additional 3,186 sq ft of land; KT3 intermediate lots of 6,600 sq ft built-up with a further 990 sq ft; and a single KT4 end lot of 8,000 sq ft built-up with 1,200 sq ft of extra land. Built-up areas run from 6,600 to 8,000 sq ft, on lots of 3,300 to 7,186 sq ft including the extra land on the corner and end units.<2/> <3/> Every unit is specified for production rather than storage alone: ceilings of 18 feet on the ground floor and 12 feet on the first, floor loading of 10 kN/m² on the ground and 5 kN/m² above, a 150 amp three-phase supply, a motorised roller shutter and a goods hoist serving both levels. The estate is laid out on 66-foot internal roads with 40-foot back lanes and side lanes sized for lorry and container movement, with dedicated parking bays along every frontage, TNB substations within the site and a centralised OSD tank. With frontage visible from the MEX Highway and access to the KL–Seremban, Sungai Besi, Bukit Jalil and Kesas highways, 7 Square is positioned for businesses that need to move goods across the Klang Valley and beyond.": "7 Square 位于雪兰莪 Bukit Serdang 的 Taman Perindustrian Putra Permai，是租赁地契工业项目，共有 49 间双层排屋式工厂，规划为坐落在 Lot 51440, Mukim Petaling 的独立完整园区。<0/> <1/> 总规划图将 49 个单位分成四排，地址位于 Jalan Perindustrian PP7、PP8 和 PP9。三排排屋横贯园区 — 两排朝北，一排朝南 — 第四排则沿东面边界而建，朝西面向 Jalan Perindustrian PP7。共有四种单位类型：KT1 中间单位，建筑面积 6,600 平方尺，地段 33' x 100'；KT2 角头单位，建筑面积 8,000 平方尺，另附 3,186 平方尺额外土地；KT3 中间单位，建筑面积 6,600 平方尺，另附 990 平方尺土地；以及仅有一间的 KT4 尾端单位，建筑面积 8,000 平方尺，另附 1,200 平方尺额外土地。建筑面积介于 6,600 至 8,000 平方尺，地段面积 3,300 至 7,186 平方尺（含角头及尾端单位的额外土地）。<2/> <3/> 每个单位都按生产需求而建，不只是存货：底楼楼高 18 尺、一楼 12 尺；底楼楼面承重 10 kN/m²、楼上 5 kN/m²；配备 150 安培三相电源、电动卷帘门，以及贯通两层的货物升降机。园区内道路宽 66 尺，后巷宽 40 尺，侧巷足以让罗厘和货柜车通行；每个单位正面都设有专属停车位，园区内另有 TNB 变电站和集中式 OSD 蓄水池。项目正面从 MEX 大道上清楚可见，并可通往吉隆坡–芙蓉、Sungai Besi、武吉加里尔和 Kesas 等大道，适合需要在巴生谷及更远地区运货的企业。",
