"<0>PDMC Land (Serdang) Sdn Bhd</0> (Co. No. 199901002291 / 729020-M) is part of the <1>PDMC Group</1>, a Malaysian developer with around two decades of delivery across industrial, commercial and residential projects.": "<0>PDMC Land (Serdang) Sdn Bhd</0>（公司注册号 199901002291 / 729020-M）隶属 <1>PDMC Group</1>，这家马来西亚发展商近二十年来交付了多个工业、商业和住宅项目。",
"The group works extensively on joint ventures with government agencies, the public sector and private landowners, and was involved in reviving abandoned projects under the <0>Tabung Pemulihan Projek Terbengkalai (TPPT)</0> scheme established by Bank Negara Malaysia.": "集团与政府机构、公共领域及私人地主有广泛的联营合作，也曾参与国家银行设立的<0>Tabung Pemulihan Projek Terbengkalai (TPPT)</0>（废弃工程复苏基金）计划，复苏烂尾项目。",
