"About 963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun": "关于 963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun",
"963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun is a freehold industrial development of ten two-and-a-half-storey semi-detached factories in the Sg. Purun Industrial Zone, off Jalan Bangi Lama in Semenyih, Selangor. Developed by Homecity Realty, the park is planned for logistics, warehousing, distribution and light-manufacturing operators who want to own their premises on individual freehold title, with prices from RM6.5 million.": "963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun 位于雪兰莪士毛月 Jalan Bangi Lama 旁的 Sg. Purun Industrial Zone，是永久地契工业项目，共有十间两层半的半独立式工厂。项目由 Homecity Realty 发展，专为想以独立永久地契拥有自家厂房的物流、仓储、分销及轻工业业者而规划，售价 650 万令吉起。",
"Every factory pairs a high-volume ground-floor production hall with a mezzanine office level and a full first-floor warehouse, with provision for a goods hoist to move stock between floors. Three layouts are offered: Type A at 12,100 sq ft (approx. 42' x 123'), Type B at 11,952 sq ft (approx. 38' x 136') and the double-sized Type C at 23,026 sq ft (approx. 63' x 162'). Floor loading is rated at 2 tons on the ground floor and 1 ton on the first floor, each unit is served by a 200 AMP electricity supply, and the clip-lock roof is solar-ready, with generous glazing bringing ventilation and natural light into the work areas.": "每间工厂底楼都是宽敞挑高的生产厂房，配有夹层办公室和整层一楼仓库，并可安装货物升降机，方便在楼层之间搬运存货。共有三种格局：A 型 12,100 平方尺（约 42' x 123'）、B 型 11,952 平方尺（约 38' x 136'），以及面积加倍的 C 型 23,026 平方尺（约 63' x 162'）。底楼楼面承重 2 吨，一楼 1 吨；每个单位配备 200 AMP 电源；clip-lock 屋顶可加装太阳能板，大面积玻璃窗为工作区带来通风与自然采光。",
"Lots range from approximately 12,000 to 26,000 sq ft, so each factory stands in its own compound with space to load, park and manoeuvre, and the layout keeps side and rear land open for future extension, subject to approval. With only ten units in the park, operators are not queuing behind neighbouring traffic to move goods.": "地段面积约 12,000 至 26,000 平方尺，每间工厂都有自己的院落，装卸、停车和调头都有空间；侧边和后方土地也保留下来，日后可扩建（须获批准）。整个园区只有十个单位，运货时不必排在邻居的车流后面。",
"The location works the corridor hard: Plaza Tol Semenyih on the LEKAS Highway is a verified 2.9 km — about six minutes — from the site, putting Kajang, Cheras and Kuala Lumpur northbound and Nilai and Seremban southbound on one expressway, with the Cheras–Kajang Expressway as a second route. Semenyih town's shops and banks sit under 4 km away, and the surrounding Semenyih–Kajang–Bangi conurbation supplies workforce, suppliers and after-hours amenities.": "地点充分发挥走廊优势：LEKAS 大道上的 Plaza Tol Semenyih 距项目仅 2.9 km（已核实），约六分钟车程；一条大道北上可达加影、蕉赖和吉隆坡，南下可达汝来和芙蓉，另有蕉赖–加影大道作为第二条路线。士毛月市区的商店和银行不到 4 km，周边士毛月–加影–万宜一带也提供人力、供应商和下班后的生活配套。",
"Construction is targeted from Q3 2026 to Q2 2028. For owner-occupiers upgrading out of rented premises, or investors adding a freehold industrial asset in an established zone, 963 Industrial Park offers scale, power and access in one address — enquire online and the developer's sales representative will follow up with current availability and pricing.": "工程预计从 2026 年第 3 季度进行至 2028 年第 2 季度。对于想从租赁厂房升级为自置物业的业者，或想在成熟工业区增添永久地契工业资产的投资者，963 Industrial Park 集面积、电力和交通于一身 — 在线咨询，发展商的销售代表会为您提供最新的单位供应和价格。",
"Approx. 5 Acres": "约 5 英亩",
"963 Industrial Park occupies approximately five acres of freehold land in the established Sg. Purun Industrial Zone, reached off Jalan Bangi Lama between Semenyih town and Bandar Teknologi Kajang. The zone is an existing industrial address, so the park plugs into a working corridor rather than a greenfield experiment.<0/> <1/> The master plan arranges ten semi-detached factory lots as five paired blocks in three types. Type A occupies Lots 1 to 4 on the upper row, Type B takes Lots 5 to 8 across the central row, and the two largest Type C factories hold Lots 9 and 10 beside the entrance. Each pair shares a single party wall — 1 with 2, 3 with 4, 5 with 6, 7 with 8, and 9 with 10 — leaving every unit with three open frontages for access, light and signage.<2/> <3/> A single vehicular entrance opens from Jalan Bangi Lama and feeds a central 66-foot internal road, with parking bays lining the boundary and landscaped verges between the lots. Every factory sits in its own compound with a driveway apron off the internal road, keeping loading and visitor movement inside the park rather than on the public road.<4/> <5/> Each unit is provisioned with a 200 AMP electricity supply and a solar-ready roof. Construction commencement is targeted for Q3 2026 and completion for Q2 2028; plans, figures and timing are the developer's current indications and remain subject to approval by the relevant authorities.": "963 Industrial Park 占地约五英亩永久地契土地，位于成熟的 Sg. Purun Industrial Zone，经 Jalan Bangi Lama 进入，介于士毛月市区和 Bandar Teknologi Kajang 之间。这里本来就是工业区，园区直接接入运作中的产业走廊，而不是在荒地上从零开始。<0/> <1/> 总规划图将十个半独立式工厂地段规划为五对，分三种类型。A 型位于上排的 Lot 1 至 4，B 型位于中排的 Lot 5 至 8，面积最大的两间 C 型工厂则位于入口旁的 Lot 9 和 10。每对共用一道界墙 — 1 与 2、3 与 4、5 与 6、7 与 8、9 与 10 — 因此每个单位都有三面开放，方便进出、采光和挂招牌。<2/> <3/> 园区只有一个车辆出入口，从 Jalan Bangi Lama 进入后连接宽 66 尺的中央内部道路，边界设有停车位，地段之间有绿化带。每间工厂都有自己的院落和连接内部道路的车道，装卸和访客车辆都在园区内活动，不占用公共道路。<4/> <5/> 每个单位配备 200 AMP 电源和可加装太阳能板的屋顶。工程预计于 2026 年第 3 季度动工，2028 年第 2 季度竣工；规划、数据和时间表均为发展商目前的预估，仍须获得相关当局批准。",
