"Homecity Realty Sdn Bhd (Co. No. 201101018838 / 946971-P) is a Kajang-based property developer and the flagship of Homecity Group, which has been building in the Kajang–Semenyih corridor since 2001. The group is ISO 9001 certified and its landed work has been recognised with a StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) recognition and a Sin Chew Business Excellence Award in 2020.": "Homecity Realty Sdn Bhd（公司注册号 201101018838 / 946971-P）是总部位于加影的产业发展商，也是 Homecity Group 的旗舰公司，自 2001 年起在加影–士毛月一带建屋。集团获 ISO 9001 认证，其有地住宅项目曾获 StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) 肯定，并于 2020 年荣获星洲企业楷模奖 (Sin Chew Business Excellence Award)。",
"The group's portfolio spans completed gated residential communities — Garden Villa @ Semenyih and Taman Ara Bayu in Mantin, the latter completed with CCC under Malaysia's housing-development framework — alongside the in-progress Taman Ara Bayu 2 terrace and townhouse scheme developed with sister company PFA Land Sdn. Bhd. 963 Industrial Park marks the group's expansion into industrial development on its home ground, ahead of the upcoming I.MAS industrial scheme at Bandar Rinching, applying two decades of local building experience to premises for business owners.": "集团的项目包括已完工的门禁住宅社区 — Garden Villa @ Semenyih 和文丁的 Taman Ara Bayu（后者已按马来西亚房屋发展框架取得完工及合格证书 CCC）— 以及与姐妹公司 PFA Land Sdn. Bhd. 联合发展、正在兴建中的 Taman Ara Bayu 2 排屋和城镇屋计划。963 Industrial Park 标志着集团在大本营拓展至工业发展，之后还有位于 Bandar Rinching 的 I.MAS 工业计划；集团把二十年的本地建屋经验，用于为企业主打造厂房。",
