"About Alaia Titiwangsa @ Kuala Lumpur": "关于 Alaia Titiwangsa @ Kuala Lumpur",
"<0>ALAIA Titiwangsa</0> introduces a refreshing interpretation of urban living in the heart of Kuala Lumpur, bringing together contemporary residences, meaningful community spaces and the privacy of an established residential enclave. Set within Taman Tiara Titiwangsa, the development offers residents the convenience of city connectivity while maintaining a more peaceful and intimate living environment away from the intensity of the city centre.": "<0>ALAIA Titiwangsa</0> 为吉隆坡市中心的都市生活带来全新诠释，结合现代住宅、有温度的社区空间，以及成熟住宅区的隐私感。项目坐落于 Taman Tiara Titiwangsa，既享有城市交通便利，又远离市中心的喧嚣，生活环境更宁静、更亲密。",
"Designed around the concept of urban community living, ALAIA goes beyond the conventional high-rise experience. Residents are surrounded by thoughtfully curated spaces for work, wellness, recreation and social connection — from co-working areas and the Social Hub to landscaped gardens, leisure facilities and elevated lifestyle spaces across the development.": "ALAIA 以都市社区生活为设计理念，超越一般高楼住宅的体验。住户身边尽是用心规划的空间，可工作、养生、休闲和社交 — 从共享办公区、Social Hub，到园林花园、休闲设施，以及遍布项目各处的高空生活空间。",
"One of ALAIA’s defining features is its panoramic setting. Selected residences enjoy expansive views towards either Kuala Lumpur’s iconic skyline — including KLCC, TRX, Merdeka 118 and KL Tower — or the greenery of the Titiwangsa Range and Genting Highlands beyond. Clear glass balcony railings are incorporated to preserve these uninterrupted views from within the home.": "ALAIA 最大的特色之一是全景视野。部分单位可远眺吉隆坡标志性的城市天际线 — 包括 KLCC、TRX、Merdeka 118 和吉隆坡塔 — 或望向蒂蒂旺沙山脉的翠绿与更远的云顶高原。阳台采用透明玻璃栏杆，在家中也能将美景尽收眼底。",
"The development comprises 436 residences across 40 storeys, complemented by 18 retail shops and a collection of 28 lifestyle facilities. Residential layouts range from approximately 635 sq. ft. to 1,012 sq. ft., providing options suited to different urban lifestyles.": "项目共有 436 个住宅单位，楼高 40 层，另有 18 间零售商店和 28 项生活设施。住宅格局面积约 635 至 1,012 平方尺，适合不同的都市生活方式。",
"Connectivity further strengthens ALAIA’s appeal. The development is approximately 1 km from dedicated access to the DUKE Highway, around 3 km from the Titiwangsa LRT/MRT interchange and approximately 8 km from major destinations such as KLCC and Bukit Bintang.": "便利交通让 ALAIA 更具吸引力。项目距 DUKE 大道专属出入口约 1 km，距蒂蒂旺沙 LRT/MRT 转换站约 3 km，距 KLCC 和武吉免登等热门地点约 8 km。",
"ALAIA Titiwangsa is ultimately designed as more than a residence. It is a contemporary urban community where residents can live privately, connect naturally and enjoy Kuala Lumpur from a distinctive vantage point.": "ALAIA Titiwangsa 不只是一个住所，而是一个现代都市社区：住户可以享有私密生活、自然地与邻里交流，并从独特的角度欣赏吉隆坡。",
"1.6 Acres": "1.6 英亩",
"Set on approximately 1.6 acres in Taman Tiara Titiwangsa, ALAIA Titiwangsa is a 40-storey serviced apartment development comprising 436 residential units and 18 retail shops. The development is designed around a community-centric living concept, combining private residences with a wide range of shared social, recreational and lifestyle spaces. <0/> <1/> Residents enjoy 28 facilities distributed across multiple levels, including landscaped recreational areas, co-working and meeting spaces, a Social Hub, Sky Gym, Yoga and Pilates Garden, 25-metre Sky Pool, Sky Jacuzzi, sauna, Sky Dining, Sky Lounge and Sky Cinema &amp; BBQ Deck. Residential layouts range from approximately 635 sq. ft. to 1,012 sq. ft., with selected homes enjoying panoramic views towards either Kuala Lumpur’s city skyline or the Titiwangsa Range.": "ALAIA Titiwangsa 坐落于 Taman Tiara Titiwangsa，占地约 1.6 英亩，是一座 40 层的服务式公寓项目，共有 436 个住宅单位和 18 间零售商店。项目以社区为中心的生活理念设计，将私人住宅与多元的共享社交、休闲及生活空间结合在一起。 <0/> <1/> 住户可享用分布在多个楼层的 28 项设施，包括园林休闲区、共享办公及会议空间、Social Hub、Sky Gym、瑜伽与普拉提花园、25 米 Sky Pool、Sky Jacuzzi、桑拿、Sky Dining、Sky Lounge 以及 Sky Cinema &amp; BBQ Deck。住宅格局面积约 635 至 1,012 平方尺，部分单位可欣赏吉隆坡城市天际线或蒂蒂旺沙山脉的全景。",
