"ALAIA Titiwangsa is developed by <0>Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd.</0> and presented under the <1>Windsor Collection</1>, a property portfolio associated with Multifield International Holdings Ltd. According to the official brochure, the wider group has experience across property investment and development in the Asia-Pacific region, with a portfolio spanning luxury residences, office towers, corporate housing, serviced apartments and villas.": "ALAIA Titiwangsa 由 <0>Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd.</0> 发展，以 <1>Windsor Collection</1> 品牌推出；Windsor Collection 是与 Multifield International Holdings Ltd. 相关的产业组合。根据官方手册，该集团在亚太地区拥有产业投资与发展经验，项目涵盖豪华住宅、办公大楼、企业住房、服务式公寓和别墅。",
"Through the Windsor Collection, the developer positions its projects around carefully planned living environments, contemporary design and long-term residential quality. For ALAIA Titiwangsa, Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd. is the registered developer, with its office at Naza Tower, Platinum Park, Kuala Lumpur.": "通过 Windsor Collection，发展商的项目注重精心规划的居住环境、现代设计和长久的居住品质。ALAIA Titiwangsa 的注册发展商为 Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd.，办公室位于吉隆坡 Platinum Park 的 Naza Tower。",
