"About Anja Residence": "关于 Anja Residence",
"Anja Residence is a freehold home in Taman Bukit Serdang, Seri Kembangan, a short drive from Bukit Jalil and the MRT Putrajaya Line. Its single 32-storey tower holds 923 apartments with two and three bedrooms, priced from RM551,000 for 651 sq ft and from RM612,000 for three bedrooms. The design takes its cue from the Mediterranean, with arched lobbies, patterned tiles and a gated, guarded entrance with its own guardhouse.": "Anja Residence 是位于沙登 Taman Bukit Serdang 的永久地契住宅，距武吉加里尔和 MRT 布城线车程不远。项目只有一座 32 层大楼，共 923 个两房和三房单位，651 平方尺单位 RM551,000 起，三房单位 RM612,000 起。设计灵感来自地中海风格，设有拱形大堂、花纹瓷砖，以及配备专属门卫亭的门禁入口。",
"There are three layouts, and most of them are made for families: about four in five of the 923 homes have three bedrooms and two bathrooms. The 794 sq ft Type B, the most common layout, has a master bedroom with its own bathroom and a yard off the kitchen. The 988 sq ft Type A adds a balcony off the living room. The 651 sq ft Type C has two bedrooms and one bathroom, an easy first home for a couple. Bedrooms have laminated floors, the living and dining areas are tiled, and every home has air-conditioning points and a fibre wall socket.": "共有三种格局，大多为家庭而设：923 个单位中约五分之四为三房两浴。最常见的 B 型面积 794 平方尺，主卧附独立浴室，厨房旁设有晾衣区。988 平方尺的 A 型在客厅外多了一个阳台。651 平方尺的 C 型为两房一浴，很适合小两口作为第一个家。卧室铺设复合地板，客厅和饭厅铺瓷砖，每个单位都备有冷气接口和光纤墙插。",
"From the site, MRT Serdang Raya Utara on the Putrajaya Line is about 2.7 km away, and the Bukit Jalil Highway is about 2.3 km away via Jalan PBS 14/1. Kingsgate International School and SMK Seri Kembangan are both under 3 km away, and South City Plaza, The Mines and Pavilion Bukit Jalil are all within about 7 km. Columbia Asia Hospital Bukit Jalil is about 5 km away.": "从项目出发，布城线的 MRT Serdang Raya Utara 站约 2.7 km，经 Jalan PBS 14/1 到武吉加里尔大道约 2.3 km。Kingsgate International School 和 SMK Seri Kembangan 都在 3 km 内，South City Plaza、The Mines 和 Pavilion Bukit Jalil 都在约 7 km 范围内。Columbia Asia Hospital Bukit Jalil 约 5 km。",
"Level 1 is given over to residents: a beach-style zero-entry pool, a kids' pool, the main pool and a jacuzzi, a gym and an outdoor gym, a multipurpose hall, an amphitheatre, a glamping space, a playground and an on-site kindergarten. Level 2 adds an activity court, and Level 32 has a sky lounge with a co-sharing space and a viewing deck.": "第 1 层专为住户而设：沙滩式泳池、儿童池、主泳池和按摩池、健身房和户外健身区、多功能厅、露天剧场、豪华露营区、游乐场，以及项目内的幼儿园。第 2 层另有活动场，第 32 层则设有空中休闲厅，附共享空间和观景台。",
"Anja Residence is developed by Gan Sin Poo &amp; Sons Sdn. Bhd. under the Villamas brand, and the developer expects to complete it in February 2031. Send an enquiry and the developer's sales representative will share the latest prices and available units.": "Anja Residence 由 Gan Sin Poo &amp; Sons Sdn. Bhd. 以 Villamas 品牌发展，发展商预计于 2031 年 2 月竣工。提交咨询后，发展商的销售代表会为您提供最新价格和可选单位。",
"Anja Residence, registered as Pangsapuri Anja, is a freehold residential development in Taman Bukit Serdang Seksyen 10, Seri Kembangan, under the Subang Jaya City Council. The site is reached by a new access road off Jalan Mawar, with Taman Teknologi Malaysia and the Bukit Jalil Highway to the north and the established homes of Taman Bukit Serdang to the south.<0/> <1/> The development is a single 32-storey block of 923 apartments in three layouts: 319 Type A homes of 988 sq ft with three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a balcony; 414 Type B homes of 794 sq ft with three bedrooms and two bathrooms, plus four Type B1 units of the same size; and 186 Type C homes of 651 sq ft with two bedrooms and one bathroom. Every layout has a yard off the kitchen.<2/> <3/> Residents' facilities are arranged around the pools on Level 1: a drop-off and grand lobby, a mail room, a beach-style zero-entry pool, a kids' pool and the main pool with a pool deck, lounge, pavilion and jacuzzi, an outdoor shower area, a playground, a glamping space, an amphitheatre, an outdoor gym, a gym, a games room, a multipurpose hall, a kindergarten, changing rooms and an activity court. A second activity court is on Level 2, and Level 32 has a sky lounge with a co-sharing space and a viewing deck. The entrance is gated and guarded.<4/> <5/> The advertising and sales permit runs from July 2026 to July 2029, and the first sale and purchase agreements were signed in August 2026. The Ministry of Housing and Local Government reports construction at 7% and on track. The developer expects completion in February 2031, and vacant possession is due by 24 June 2031 under the approved timeline.": "Anja Residence 注册名称为 Pangsapuri Anja，是位于沙登 Taman Bukit Serdang Seksyen 10 的永久地契住宅项目，隶属梳邦再也市政厅管辖。项目经 Jalan Mawar 的新通道进入，北面是 Taman Teknologi Malaysia 和武吉加里尔大道，南面则是成熟的 Taman Bukit Serdang 住宅区。<0/> <1/> 项目为一座 32 层大楼，共 923 个单位，分三种格局：319 个 A 型单位，988 平方尺，三房两浴附阳台；414 个 B 型单位，794 平方尺，三房两浴，另有四个同样面积的 B1 型单位；以及 186 个 C 型单位，651 平方尺，两房一浴。每种格局的厨房旁都设有晾衣区。<2/> <3/> 住户设施围绕第 1 层的泳池而设：落客区和气派大堂、邮件室、沙滩式泳池、儿童池、附泳池平台、休闲区、凉亭和按摩池的主泳池、户外淋浴区、游乐场、豪华露营区、露天剧场、户外健身区、健身房、游戏室、多功能厅、幼儿园、更衣室和活动场。第 2 层另有一个活动场，第 32 层则设有空中休闲厅，附共享空间和观景台。入口设有门禁和保安。<4/> <5/> 广告及销售准证有效期从 2026 年 7 月至 2029 年 7 月，首批买卖合约于 2026 年 8 月签署。地方政府发展部报告显示，工程进度为 7%，按计划进行。发展商预计于 2031 年 2 月竣工，按核准时间表须于 2031 年 6 月 24 日前交屋 (VP)。",
