"Anja Residence is developed by Gan Sin Poo &amp; Sons Sdn. Bhd. (102722-P), which builds under the Villamas brand and works from Villamas's head office at Plaza TTDI, Taman Tun Dr Ismail, Kuala Lumpur. The company is a licensed housing developer whose first housing permits, for Bukit Kepong Baru, date from 2002. Anja is registered with the Ministry of Housing and Local Government as Pangsapuri Anja.": "Anja Residence 由 Gan Sin Poo &amp; Sons Sdn. Bhd. (102722-P) 发展，该公司以 Villamas 品牌建屋，办公地点为 Villamas 位于吉隆坡 Taman Tun Dr Ismail 的 Plaza TTDI 总部。公司是持牌房屋发展商，首批房屋准证为 Bukit Kepong Baru 项目，可追溯至 2002 年。Anja 在地方政府发展部的注册名称为 Pangsapuri Anja。",
"Villamas says it has more than 20 years of experience completing projects, including Verve @ Ara Damansara, Zefer Hill and Atmosfera in Puchong, as well as developments in Kepong, Serdang, Bukit Jalil and Cyberjaya. Its current mixed development, Meta_City in Seri Kembangan, is also where the Anja Residence property gallery is, at Pusat Perniagaan Atmosphere, Bandar Putra Permai.": "Villamas 表示拥有超过 20 年的项目交付经验，项目包括 Verve @ Ara Damansara，以及蒲种的 Zefer Hill 和 Atmosfera，还有位于甲洞、Serdang、武吉加里尔和赛城的发展项目。其目前在沙登发展的综合项目 Meta_City，也是 Anja Residence 销售展厅的所在地，位于 Bandar Putra Permai 的 Pusat Perniagaan Atmosphere。",
