"About Breeze Hill Shoppes": "关于 Breeze Hill Shoppes",
"Every day, a steady stream of visitors winds up the mountain road through Gohtong Jaya on the way to Genting Highlands — one of Malaysia's most-visited leisure destinations. They stop for breakfast before the climb, for coffee on the way down, for supplies, souvenirs and a night out. Breeze Hill Shoppes puts your business directly on that route: a new retail address rising within the Tropicana Windcity masterplan, about 3 km from Genting Highlands Premium Outlets, where highland footfall meets a growing resident community.": "每天，络绎不绝的游客沿着山路经过 Gohtong Jaya，前往马来西亚最热门的休闲胜地之一 — 云顶高原。他们上山前在这里吃早餐，下山时喝杯咖啡，顺便补给、买手信，或在夜里出来消遣。Breeze Hill Shoppes 让您的生意直接坐落在这条路线上：这是 Tropicana Windcity 总体规划中崛起的全新零售地标，距 Genting Highlands Premium Outlets 约 3 km，高原人流与日益增长的住户社区在此交汇。",
"The Shoppes offers 90 freehold, individually strata-titled retail lots from 959 to 3,470 sq ft, spread across Ground and Upper Ground zones that follow the natural slope of the hill. Lots are designed the way retailers actually trade — wide shopfronts for visibility, ceilings from 12 feet, natural light and ventilation, and al fresco frontage, double frontage and column-free layouts on selected lots. A dedicated three-level Shoppes car park and three drop-off zones bring customers to the door, while public washrooms, a surau, seating areas, landscaping, security and cleaning are maintained under a single management body — so the whole destination stays presentable, not just your unit.": "The Shoppes 提供 90 个永久地契、独立分层地契的零售单位，面积 959 至 3,470 平方尺，分布在顺着山坡自然地势而建的 Ground 和 Upper Ground 区。单位按商家真正的经营方式设计 — 宽阔店面更显眼、楼高 12 尺起、自然采光与通风，部分单位还有户外用餐区门面、双门面和无柱格局。Shoppes 专属的三层停车场和三个落客区把顾客直接带到店门口，而公共厕所、祈祷室 (surau)、座位区、园林、保安和清洁都由同一个管理机构负责 — 整个商场都保持体面整洁，不只是您的单位。",
"There's a place here for almost every trade. Zones near the entrance carry upgraded 100A three-phase power for F&amp;B operators running serious kitchens — restaurants, grocers, convenience-with-café concepts — while main-road frontage suits cafés, bistros and dessert franchises. A self-contained entertainment floor is planned for karaoke, family edutainment, claw-machine and VR concepts, and further lots suit wellness, beauty, laundry, gadgets and everyday services. Directly above it all: the development's two service-apartment towers — 1,722 homes of built-in, walk-down custom.": "几乎每种生意都能在这里找到位置。靠近入口的区域配备升级版 100A 三相电，适合需要正规厨房的餐饮业者 — 餐馆、杂货店、便利店结合咖啡馆的概念店 — 而大路旁的门面则适合咖啡馆、小餐馆和甜品连锁店。另规划了一整层独立的娱乐楼层，适合卡拉 OK、亲子寓教于乐、夹娃娃机和 VR 等概念，其他单位则适合保健、美容、洗衣、电子产品和日常服务。就在这一切的正上方：项目的两座服务式公寓大楼 — 1,722 户住户，下楼就是现成的客源。",
"Breeze Hill Shoppes is developed by Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd., a member of the Tropicana Corporation Berhad group (established 1979). Where Gohtong Jaya's retail has long meant traditional individually-titled shoplots, the Shoppes introduces a managed, stratified retail destination — a new category for the town, arriving alongside its next wave of residents. Enquire for the full lot list, floor plans and zone specifications.": "Breeze Hill Shoppes 由 Tropicana Corporation Berhad 集团（成立于 1979 年）旗下的 Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd. 发展。Gohtong Jaya 的零售向来以传统独立地契店屋为主，而 The Shoppes 带来有统一管理的分层零售商场 — 这是小镇的全新类别，与新一波住户同步到来。欢迎咨询完整单位清单、平面图和各区规格。",
"Site Plan Overview — Retail Zones &amp; Directions": "地盘平面图总览 — 零售区与方位",
"6.76 Acres": "6.76 英亩",
"Set across 6.76 acres of freehold land in Gohtong Jaya, Breeze Hill Shoppes is the retail component of Breeze Hill, an integrated highland development by Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd.<0/> <1/> The Shoppes is a two-storey strata retail component of 90 freehold lots ranging from 959 to 3,470 sq ft, arranged across a Ground level and an Upper Ground level that steps with the natural slope of the site. Lots are served by a dedicated three-level Shoppes car park, three drop-off areas, and shared facilities under a single management body, including public washrooms, a surau, public seating, landscaping, security and cleaning.<2/> <3/> Where Gohtong Jaya's established retail is largely traditional shoplots, the Shoppes offers stratified retail lots with wide shopfronts, ceiling heights from 12 feet, and al fresco frontage to selected lots. Layouts are sized for F&amp;B and cafes, convenience and services, wellness and beauty, and lifestyle and entertainment operators. The development sits within Tropicana Windcity, approximately 3 km from Genting Highlands Premium Outlets, and adjoins the 1,722-unit Breeze Hill serviced apartments.": "Breeze Hill Shoppes 坐落于 Gohtong Jaya 6.76 英亩的永久地契土地上，是 Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd. 打造的高原综合发展项目 Breeze Hill 的零售部分。<0/> <1/> The Shoppes 为两层的分层零售商场，共有 90 个永久地契单位，面积 959 至 3,470 平方尺，分布在顺着地势而建的 Ground 层和 Upper Ground 层。单位配有 Shoppes 专属的三层停车场、三个落客区，以及由同一个管理机构负责的共享设施，包括公共厕所、祈祷室 (surau)、公共座位、园林、保安和清洁。<2/> <3/> Gohtong Jaya 现有的零售大多是传统店屋，而 The Shoppes 提供分层零售单位，店面宽阔，楼高 12 尺起，部分单位设有户外用餐区门面。格局适合餐饮与咖啡馆、便利店与服务、保健与美容，以及生活与娱乐业者。项目位于 Tropicana Windcity，距 Genting Highlands Premium Outlets 约 3 km，紧邻拥有 1,722 个单位的 Breeze Hill 服务式公寓。",
