"About Breeze Hill Serviced Apartment": "关于 Breeze Hill Serviced Apartment",
"Imagine waking up to cool mountain air, lush green surroundings and sweeping highland views—while the excitement of Genting Highlands remains close at hand. Breeze Hill is a freehold integrated development in Gohtong Jaya, created for those who want the refreshing atmosphere of a highland retreat without giving up modern comfort, convenience and connectivity.": "想象每天醒来，迎接清凉的山间空气、葱郁的绿意和开阔的高原美景——而云顶高原的热闹就在不远处。Breeze Hill 是 Gohtong Jaya 的永久地契综合发展项目，专为想要享受高原度假般的清新氛围、同时不放弃现代舒适、便利与交通的人而打造。",
"Developed by Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd., part of the Tropicana group, Breeze Hill brings together contemporary service apartments and the vibrant Breeze Hill Shoppes within a thoughtfully planned 6.7-acre destination. Its elevated setting places residents close to the shops and dining conveniences of Gohtong Jaya, with Genting Highlands Premium Outlets and the Awana SkyWay approximately 3 km away. Theme parks, entertainment venues, dining destinations and popular highland attractions are also within convenient reach.": "Breeze Hill 由 Tropicana 集团旗下的 Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd. 发展，在精心规划、占地 6.7 英亩的项目中，结合现代服务式公寓和充满活力的 Breeze Hill Shoppes。项目地势较高，住户可就近享用 Gohtong Jaya 的商店和餐饮，距 Genting Highlands Premium Outlets 和 Awana SkyWay 约 3 km。主题乐园、娱乐场所、美食据点和热门高原景点也都近在咫尺。",
"The residential component features two elegant 27-storey towers comprising 1,722 units overall. Phase 1 offers 861 units across three practical layouts: a smart 431 sq ft studio, a comfortable 756 sq ft two-bedroom home and a spacious 975 sq ft three-bedroom residence. Whether envisioned as a personal highland escape, a holiday home or a place for relaxed everyday living, each layout is designed to complement different lifestyles and space requirements.": "住宅部分为两座优雅的 27 层大楼，共 1,722 个单位。第 1 期推出 861 个单位，分三种实用格局：精巧的 431 平方尺开放式单位、舒适的 756 平方尺两房单位，以及宽敞的 975 平方尺三房单位。无论是作为个人的高原小憩、度假屋，还是轻松的日常住所，每种格局都能配合不同的生活方式和空间需求。",
"At the heart of the development is an approximately 26,000 sq ft facilities podium featuring over 40 lifestyle amenities. Residents can unwind by the swimming and family pools, enjoy the heated jacuzzi and landscaped gardens, stay active at the gymnasium, CrossFit and jogging areas, or spend quality time at the children’s play spaces, games room, co-working space and outdoor leisure zones. The integrated retail component adds another layer of convenience, bringing everyday essentials, dining and lifestyle experiences closer to home.": "项目的核心是一个约 26,000 平方尺的设施平台，拥有超过 40 项生活设施。住户可在泳池和家庭池畔放松，享受温水按摩池和园林花园，在健身房、CrossFit 区和慢跑区保持活力，或在儿童游乐区、游戏室、共享办公空间和户外休闲区共度美好时光。综合零售部分让生活更便利，日常所需、餐饮和生活体验都近在家门口。",
"With its freehold tenure, refreshing mountain setting, integrated conveniences and well-rounded residential offering, Breeze Hill presents a distinctive opportunity to experience the best of highland living. Phase 1 is expected to be completed in October 2030.": "凭借永久地契、清新的山间环境、一站式便利和全面的住宅选择，Breeze Hill 为您带来体验高原生活精华的难得机会。第 1 期预计于 2030 年 10 月竣工。",
"6.7 Acres": "6.7 英亩",
"Set across 6.76 acres of freehold land in Gohtong Jaya, Breeze Hill is an integrated highland development thoughtfully planned to bring residential living, lifestyle facilities and everyday convenience together in one elevated destination.<0/> <1/> The master plan comprises two 27-storey service-apartment towers with 1,722 residences overall, complemented by a ten-storey car park podium and the two-storey Breeze Hill Shoppes, which features 90 retail lots. The towers are positioned along the natural contours of the site to offer two distinctive outlooks: Hill View and Genting View. Phase 1 comprises 861 residences across three layouts, from 431 sq ft studios to 756 sq ft two-bedroom and 975 sq ft three-bedroom homes.<2/> <3/> At the heart of the development is an approximately 26,000 sq ft lifestyle facilities podium featuring over 40 amenities for relaxation, recreation, fitness, family time and social activities. With integrated retail conveniences and direct orientation towards Gohtong Jaya, Breeze Hill is designed as a complete highland address where residents can retreat into nature while remaining connected to Genting Highlands’ attractions and everyday necessities.": "Breeze Hill 坐落于 Gohtong Jaya 6.76 英亩的永久地契土地上，是精心规划的高原综合发展项目，把住宅、生活设施和日常便利汇聚在同一个高处。<0/> <1/> 总规划图包括两座 27 层的服务式公寓大楼，共 1,722 个住宅单位，另有十层停车场平台，以及拥有 90 个零售单位的两层 Breeze Hill Shoppes。大楼顺着地势而建，提供两种不同景观：Hill View 和 Genting View。第 1 期共 861 个单位，分三种格局，从 431 平方尺的开放式单位，到 756 平方尺两房和 975 平方尺三房单位。<2/> <3/> 项目核心是一个约 26,000 平方尺的生活设施平台，拥有超过 40 项设施，供休闲、娱乐、健身、家庭时光和社交活动之用。凭借综合零售便利和直面 Gohtong Jaya 的朝向，Breeze Hill 是一个完整的高原住址，住户既能隐居自然，又能随时前往云顶高原的景点、满足日常所需。",
