"About Candela": "关于 Candela",
"Candela is a completed, freehold collection of <0>25 two-storey superlink terrace homes</0> by Benéton Properties Group, set within the guarded Suria Residen enclave at the foothills of the <1>Bukit Sungai Putih Forest Reserve</1> in Cheras — a low-density neighbourhood of just seven homes to the acre. Every home is <2>ready to move in: CCC obtained and individual titles issued</2>.": "Candela 是 Benéton Properties Group 旗下已完工的永久地契项目，共 <0>25 间双层 superlink 排屋</0>，坐落于蕉赖 <1>Bukit Sungai Putih 森林保留地</1>山脚下、设有保安的 Suria Residen 社区——每英亩仅 7 间，属低密度住宅区。每间房屋都<2>可即刻入住：已取得 CCC，独立地契也已发出</2>。",
"The homes sit in a single tree-lined row facing west onto the internal estate road, with nothing but the forest-reserve boundary behind them. Three layouts are offered: <0>Type 1 intermediate</0> (24' × 70', 2,560 sq ft), <1>Type 2 end lots</1> (24' × 70', 2,583–2,584 sq ft) and <2>Type 3 corners</2> (29'–29.5' × 70', 2,583–2,584 sq ft) — every one with <3>4+1 bedrooms, 5 bathrooms</3> and an en-suite to every bedroom.": "所有房屋沿一排林荫道排列，坐东朝西，面向社区内部道路，屋后只有森林保留地的边界。共有三种格局：<0>1 型中间单位</0>（24' × 70'，2,560 平方尺）、<1>2 型尾段单位</1>（24' × 70'，2,583–2,584 平方尺）和 <2>3 型角头单位</2>（29'–29.5' × 70'，2,583–2,584 平方尺），全部都是 <3>4+1 间卧室、5 间浴室</3>，每间卧室都附独立浴室。",
"Candela's signature is light: designed by <0>SNO Architects</0>, the staircase and lightwell are one, drawing natural sunlight through the roof into both floors. An open-plan ground floor runs living and dining as one space, with separate wet and dry kitchens, a ground-floor guest room with full bath, and a study that doubles as a home office. The column-free porch carries an <1>EV-charging power point</1>; supply is 3-phase; the insulated metal roof keeps the house quiet and cool.": "Candela 的亮点是光线：由 <0>SNO Architects</0> 设计，楼梯与天井合为一体，让自然阳光从屋顶洒进上下两层。底层采用开放式设计，客厅与饭厅连成一体，另设独立的干湿厨房、附完整浴室的楼下客房，以及可兼作家庭办公室的书房。无柱车廊配备<1>电动车充电插座</1>；采用 3 相电源；隔热金属屋顶让屋内安静又凉爽。",
"Residents share a private central facilities area — swimming pool, wading pool, gymnasium, playground, changing room and barbeque pit — inside a guarded neighbourhood minutes from the Cheras Leisure Mall–EkoCheras retail belt, international schools and UKM Medical Centre, with highway access via SUKE, the Cheras–Kajang Expressway and the Salak Expressway.": "住户共享位于中央的私人设施区——游泳池、儿童戏水池、健身房、游乐场、更衣室和烧烤区。社区设有保安，距 Cheras Leisure Mall–EkoCheras 商圈、国际学校和 UKM Medical Centre 仅几分钟，并可经 SUKE、蕉赖–加影大道和 Salak 大道出入。",
"Approx. 3.6 Acres": "约 3.6 英亩",
"Set across approximately 3.6 acres within the established Suria Residen enclave at the foothills of the Bukit Sungai Putih Forest Reserve, Candela is a completed, freehold addition to one of Cheras' most tightly held guarded neighbourhoods. At just seven homes to the acre, the master plan trades density for space: 25 superlink terrace homes, finished with CCC obtained and individual titles issued.<0/> <1/> The plan arranges all 25 homes in a single tree-lined row along the eastern edge of the estate, split into two runs by an internal junction — Row 1 (lots 12A to 38) and Row 2 (lots 40 to 62). Twenty-one intermediate homes are anchored by wider end lots at 38 and 40 and corner lots at 12A and 62. Every front door opens west onto the estate road, looking across at the completed Suria Residen homes, while the rear boundary backs directly onto the tree-lined edge of the forest-reserve foothills — no rear neighbours, today or in the future.<2/> <3/> At the heart of the neighbourhood, beside the southern run, sits the residents' central facilities area: a swimming pool and wading pool, gymnasium, playground, changing room and barbeque pit, shared by only 25 families. A guard house controls the single estate entrance to the south, a landscaped retention pond anchors the north-west corner, and mature planting runs the full perimeter, giving the enclave its park-like frame.<4/> <5/> From this quiet, elevated pocket, daily life stays connected: the SUKE elevated highway, the Cheras–Kajang (Grand Saga) route via the 9th Mile toll and the Salak Expressway put the Cheras Leisure Mall–EkoCheras retail belt, international schools, UCSI and UKM Medical Centre within easy reach, with Kuala Lumpur's city centre a direct highway run away.": "Candela 占地约 3.6 英亩，坐落于 Bukit Sungai Putih 森林保留地山脚下的成熟社区 Suria Residen，为这个蕉赖最抢手的保安社区之一增添了已完工的永久地契住宅。每英亩仅 7 间，总体规划以密度换取空间：25 间 superlink 排屋，已取得 CCC 并发出独立地契。<0/> <1/> 全部 25 间房屋沿社区东侧排成一列林荫屋排，由一个内部路口分为两段——第 1 排（12A 至 38 号地段）和第 2 排（40 至 62 号地段）。21 间中间单位的两端，是 38 和 40 号较宽的尾段单位，以及 12A 和 62 号的角头单位。每户正门朝西，面向社区道路，对望已完工的 Suria Residen 住宅；屋后直接背靠森林保留地山脚的林边——现在没有、将来也不会有后排邻居。<2/> <3/> 社区中心、南段旁边，是住户的中央设施区：游泳池、儿童戏水池、健身房、游乐场、更衣室和烧烤区，只供 25 户共享。保安亭把守社区南面唯一的出入口，西北角有一座园景滞洪池，四周种满成熟树木，让整个社区犹如公园。<4/> <5/> 从这片宁静的高地出发，日常出行依然便利：SUKE 高架大道、经 Batu 9 收费站的蕉赖–加影大道 (Grand Saga) 和 Salak 大道，让您轻松前往 Cheras Leisure Mall–EkoCheras 商圈、国际学校、UCSI 和 UKM Medical Centre，走大道即可直达吉隆坡市中心。",
