"About CG New Town @ Bukit Tinggi Klang": "关于 CG New Town @ Bukit Tinggi Klang",
"CG New Town": "CG New Town",
"CG New Town is a contemporary freehold commercial development in the established Bandar Bukit Tinggi, Klang catchment, created for businesses seeking visibility, flexible space and room to grow. Developed by Ancubic Puchong Sdn. Bhd., the project comprises 47 stratified commercial units across two four-storey blocks, with official built-ups ranging from approximately 1,840 to 8,956 sq ft.": "CG New Town 是位于巴生 Bandar Bukit Tinggi 成熟商圈的现代永久地契商业项目，专为追求曝光度、灵活空间和发展空间的企业而打造。项目由 Ancubic Puchong Sdn. Bhd. 发展，共有 47 个分层商业单位，分布于两座四层楼，官方建筑面积约 1,840 至 8,956 平方尺。",
"Designed to accommodate retail, dining, healthcare, education, wellness, professional services and corporate offices, CG New Town combines high-ceiling multi-level spaces with selected mezzanine configurations and dedicated lift access. Its prominent commercial frontage, contemporary façade, alfresco-friendly areas and 388 communal car-parking bays support an engaging customer experience and practical day-to-day business operations.": "CG New Town 适合零售、餐饮、医疗、教育、保健、专业服务和企业办公，结合挑高的多层空间、部分单位的夹层设计和专用电梯。醒目的商业门面、现代外观、适合户外用餐的空间，以及 388 个公共停车位，既带来良好的顾客体验，也方便日常营运。",
"The development also incorporates regenerative-drive elevators, low-VOC interior paint, water-efficient sanitary fittings and EV-charging facilities. A multi-tier security system, CCTV coverage at car parks and lift lobbies, a 24-hour manned guard house, and formal emergency and risk-management measures provide additional assurance for business owners, occupants and visitors.": "项目还配备再生驱动电梯、低 VOC 室内漆、节水卫浴设备和电动车充电设施。多层保安系统、停车场和电梯大堂的闭路电视、24 小时有人驻守的保安亭，以及完善的紧急应变与风险管理措施，让业主、使用者和访客更安心。",
"Connected via KESAS Highway, Federal Highway, LKSA, SKVE, Jalan Langat and Jalan Banting, CG New Town is positioned within reach of Bandar Botanic, Bayu Perdana, Taman Sentosa, Klang town centre and Port Klang. It presents a forward-looking freehold business address for entrepreneurs, brands and investors seeking adaptable commercial space in Klang. Submit an enquiry to receive the current developer-approved pricing, availability and sales information.": "CG New Town 经 KESAS 大道、联邦大道、LKSA、SKVE、Jalan Langat 和 Jalan Banting 四通八达，邻近 Bandar Botanic、Bayu Perdana、Taman Sentosa、巴生市中心和巴生港口。对于想在巴生寻找灵活商业空间的创业者、品牌和投资者来说，这是一个具前瞻性的永久地契营业地址。立即咨询，获取发展商核准的最新价格、单位供应和销售资料。",
"3.02 Acres": "3.02 英亩",
"CG New Town is a contemporary freehold stratified shop-office development positioned along prominent south-facing street frontage within the mature Bukit Tinggi, Klang catchment. Planned across two four-storey commercial blocks with lower-ground parking and mezzanine Levels 2A and 3A, the development comprises 47 commercial units with current official built-ups ranging from approximately 1,840 to 8,956 sq ft.<0/> <1/> Flexible multi-level configurations, selected-unit dedicated lift access, high ceilings and alfresco-friendly spaces provide a versatile setting for retail, office, healthcare, wellness, education and service-oriented businesses. The development is supported by 388 communal car-parking bays and convenient connections through KESAS, Federal Highway, LKSA, SKVE, Jalan Langat and Jalan Banting.<2/> <3/> Its surrounding catchment encompasses Bandar Bukit Tinggi, Bandar Botanic, Bayu Perdana, Taman Sentosa, Klang town centre and Port Klang, placing businesses close to established residential communities, commercial activity and major employment areas.": "CG New Town 是现代永久地契分层店屋项目，位于巴生 Bukit Tinggi 成熟商圈，沿醒目的朝南临街面而建。项目规划为两座四层商业楼，设下层停车场以及 2A 和 3A 夹层，共有 47 个商业单位，目前官方建筑面积约 1,840 至 8,956 平方尺。<0/> <1/> 灵活的多层格局、部分单位专用电梯、挑高楼层和适合户外用餐的空间，适合零售、办公、医疗、保健、教育和服务类业务。项目设有 388 个公共停车位，并可经 KESAS、联邦大道、LKSA、SKVE、Jalan Langat 和 Jalan Banting 便捷往来。<2/> <3/> 周边商圈涵盖 Bandar Bukit Tinggi、Bandar Botanic、Bayu Perdana、Taman Sentosa、巴生市中心和巴生港口，让商家贴近成熟住宅区、商业活动和主要就业区。",
