"Established in 2011 under the leadership of Dato’ Low Boon An, Ancubic Group is a Malaysian property developer with a diversified portfolio spanning residential, commercial, mixed-use and industrial developments. Guided by integrity, transparency and practical solutions, the group creates places designed to support individuals, communities and enterprises at different stages of growth.": "Ancubic Group 于 2011 年在 Dato’ Low Boon An 的领导下成立，是马来西亚产业发展商，项目涵盖住宅、商业、综合发展和工业。集团秉持诚信、透明和务实的理念，打造能在不同成长阶段支持个人、社区和企业的空间。",
"For CG New Town, the legal project developer is Ancubic Puchong Sdn. Bhd., part of Ancubic Group. The development brings the group’s commercial experience to a freehold business address in Bukit Tinggi, Klang, combining flexible multi-level shop-office spaces with selected-unit dedicated lift access, high ceilings, alfresco-friendly areas, extensive communal parking and access to established residential and commercial catchments.": "CG New Town 的法定项目发展商是 Ancubic Puchong Sdn. Bhd.，隶属 Ancubic Group。项目将集团的商业项目经验带到巴生 Bukit Tinggi 的永久地契营业地址，结合灵活的多层店面办公空间、部分单位专用电梯、挑高楼层、适合户外用餐的空间、充足的公共停车位，并连接成熟的住宅与商业区。",
