"About Dynaton Casa Hill": "关于 Dynaton Casa Hill",
"<0><1>Casa Hill by Dynaton</1></0> is a distinctive freehold bungalow community in Mentakab, Pahang, created for families who want more than simply a larger home. Set across approximately 35 acres of landscaped surroundings along Sungai Semantan, the development is shaped around space, privacy and a more considered way of living — where generous homes, greenery and community come together naturally.": "<0><1>Casa Hill by Dynaton</1></0> 是位于彭亨文德甲、别具一格的永久地契独立式洋房社区，专为不只想要一间更大房子的家庭而打造。项目占地约 35 英亩，沿 Sungai Semantan 而建，四周园景环绕，以空间、私隐和更用心的生活方式为核心——宽敞的住宅、绿意与社区自然融为一体。",
"Designed with modern and multigenerational families in mind, Casa Hill offers a collection of spacious detached residences with expansive layouts, high-volume interiors and thoughtful living spaces that allow different generations to stay connected without sacrificing personal privacy. Selected home concepts incorporate flexible spaces suited for extended families, while large windows, open-plan living areas and impressive ceiling heights create interiors that feel bright, open and comfortable throughout the day.": "Casa Hill 专为现代及多代同堂家庭而设计，提供一系列宽敞的独立式住宅：格局开阔、室内挑高、生活空间规划周到，让几代人既能紧密相处，又保有各自的私人空间。部分户型设有适合大家庭的灵活空间，大窗户、开放式客厅和挑高天花板，让室内全天明亮、开阔又舒适。",
"Beyond the individual homes, the development places equal emphasis on the environment around them. Landscaped linear gardens, pedestrian and cycling spaces, recreational areas and extensive greenery introduce a calmer rhythm to everyday life. Instead of being confined within the boundaries of each individual lot, residents are given spaces to walk, exercise, unwind and spend time outdoors within the neighbourhood itself.": "除了住宅本身，项目同样重视周边环境。园景线性花园、步行与脚车空间、休闲区和大片绿地，让日常生活节奏更从容。住户不必局限于自家地段，在社区内就能散步、运动、放松，享受户外时光。",
"Casa Hill also brings together an extensive collection of lifestyle and recreational facilities designed to support different generations and interests. From swimming, fitness and wellness spaces to sporting, leisure and social facilities, the development encourages residents to enjoy a more complete lifestyle without having to travel far from home.": "Casa Hill 也汇集了丰富的生活与休闲设施，满足不同年龄和兴趣的需要。从游泳、健身、保健空间，到运动、休闲和社交设施，住户不必远离家门，就能享受更完整的生活。",
"At its core, Casa Hill represents a different approach to landed living in Mentakab — combining the privacy of a bungalow, the scale of a spacious family residence and the atmosphere of a thoughtfully planned community. It is a home designed not only for how families live today, but for the years, generations and memories that follow.": "归根结底，Casa Hill 为文德甲的有地住宅带来不一样的选择——兼具独立式洋房的私隐、宽敞家庭住宅的规模，以及用心规划的社区氛围。这个家不只为今天的生活而设计，更为往后的岁月、下一代和更多回忆而建。",
"35 Acres": "35 英亩",
"Casa Hill is a freehold, low-density bungalow community on 35 acres along the Semantan River in Mentakab, Pahang, on one of the highest parcels of land in the town. It sits next to Mentakab station, which the developer notes will offer East Coast Rail Link (ECRL) access, with future commercial developments planned nearby.<0/> <1/> The homes are two-storey bungalows in four designs. Types A and C/C+ offer 4 + 2 bedrooms and 5 bathrooms on 55’ x 80’ and 50’/55’ x 80’/87’ lots, while Type B adds a basement level with a second master suite, for 5 + 2 bedrooms and 7 bathrooms on a 55’ x 87’ lot. Type E, the current phase of seven homes, offers 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms with a 2,092 sq ft built-up on 3,800 to 5,554 sq ft of land. The earlier phases were completed in 2022, and Type E is expected to complete in January 2027.<2/> <3/> The community is gated, with a three-tier security system of guard patrols and CCTV along the roads. A back lane of about 40 feet is laid out as a linear garden with pedestrian and cycling paths, a 2 km jogging track runs through the gardens with river views, and residents have exclusive use of a clubhouse with a 50-metre infinity pool, gymnasium, cafés and a multipurpose hall.": "Casa Hill 是位于彭亨文德甲的永久地契低密度独立式洋房社区，占地 35 英亩，沿 Sungai Semantan 而建，坐落在镇上地势最高的地段之一。社区紧邻文德甲车站，据发展商表示，该站将连接东海岸铁路 (ECRL)，附近也规划了未来的商业发展项目。<0/> <1/> 住宅为双层独立式洋房，共四种设计。A 型和 C/C+ 型提供 4 + 2 间卧室和 5 间浴室，地段为 55’ x 80’ 及 50’/55’ x 80’/87’；B 型多一层地下层，设第二间主人套房，共 5 + 2 间卧室和 7 间浴室，地段为 55’ x 87’。目前推出的 E 型共 7 间，提供 4 间卧室和 3 间浴室，建筑面积 2,092 平方尺，土地面积 3,800 至 5,554 平方尺。较早的几期已于 2022 年完工，E 型预计于 2027年1月竣工。<2/> <3/> 社区为封闭式，设有三层保安系统，包括保安巡逻和沿路闭路电视。约 40 尺宽的后巷规划为线性花园，设步行道和脚车道；一条 2 公里的慢跑径穿过花园，可欣赏河景；住户还可专享会所，内设 50 米无边际泳池、健身房、咖啡馆和多功能礼堂。",
