"Casa Hill is a Dynaton development, delivered in phases by the group’s Temerloh-based companies — Dynaton World Sdn. Bhd., Temerloh Home Builder Sdn. Bhd. and, for the current Type E phase, Pulau Tioman Resort City Sdn. Bhd. — all operating from Wisma Dynaton in Dynaton Bukit Angin, Temerloh. The earlier bungalow phases were completed with their Certificates of Completion and Compliance issued in September and October 2022.": "Casa Hill 是 Dynaton 的发展项目，由集团在淡马鲁的几家公司分期发展——Dynaton World Sdn. Bhd.、Temerloh Home Builder Sdn. Bhd.，以及负责目前 E 型这一期的 Pulau Tioman Resort City Sdn. Bhd.——全部在淡马鲁 Dynaton Bukit Angin 的 Wisma Dynaton 办公。较早几期的独立式洋房已完工，并于 2022年9月和10月取得完工及合格证书 (CCC)。",
"Casa Hill is marketed today by Miracle Land Holdings Berhad, which operates from the same Temerloh headquarters and also markets Miracle Sentral in Jengka. Other Dynaton developments in the Temerloh district registered with KPKT include Dynaton Izona Bukit Bendera and Dynaton Impiana Taman Bahagia.": "Casa Hill 目前由 Miracle Land Holdings Berhad 负责营销。该公司同样设于淡马鲁总部，也负责 Jengka 的 Miracle Sentral。Dynaton 在淡马鲁县其他已向地方政府发展部 (KPKT) 注册的项目，包括 Dynaton Izona Bukit Bendera 和 Dynaton Impiana Taman Bahagia。",
