"About Harmoni One by Ancubic @ Ancubic Harmoni City": "关于 Harmoni One by Ancubic @ Ancubic Harmoni City",
"About Harmoni ONE": "关于 Harmoni ONE",
"Harmoni ONE is the flagship commercial component of <0>Ancubic Harmoni City</0>, a 33-acre integrated lifestyle development in Telok Panglima Garang, Selangor. Designed as a prominent commercial address within the township, the development comprises a limited collection of <1>3½- and 4-storey shop offices</1> positioned along the main frontage for strong visibility and business exposure.": "Harmoni ONE 是 <0>Ancubic Harmoni City</0> 的旗舰商业部分。Ancubic Harmoni City 是位于雪兰莪 Telok Panglima Garang、占地 33 英亩的综合生活发展项目。Harmoni ONE 定位为镇内醒目的商业地址，只推出数量有限的 <1>3½ 层和 4 层店屋</1>，沿主要临街面而建，曝光度高，生意更好做。",
"Built for businesses that need more than a conventional shoplot, Harmoni ONE combines generous multi-storey floorplates with lift access, basement parking connectivity and flexible spaces suited to retail, dining, wellness, education and professional uses. Shared and selected individual lifts help make the upper floors more practical for everyday commercial use.": "Harmoni ONE 专为需要比一般店屋更多空间的企业而建，结合宽敞的多层楼面、电梯、连通地下停车场的设计，以及适合零售、餐饮、保健、教育和专业服务的灵活空间。共用电梯和部分单位的独立电梯，让楼上楼层更方便日常商业使用。",
"The development also benefits from its position within the larger Harmoni City ecosystem, where commercial, retail, medical, dining, sports and lifestyle components are planned to work together. With surrounding mature townships, established highways and a growing local catchment, Harmoni ONE is positioned as a commercial hub designed for long-term business visibility and activity.": "项目也受惠于更大的 Harmoni City 生态圈，商业、零售、医疗、餐饮、运动和生活设施规划成相辅相成的整体。周边有成熟的住宅区、完善的大道网络和持续增长的本地人口，Harmoni ONE 定位为能长期保持曝光度与人流的商业中心。",
"33 Acres": "33 英亩",
"Harmoni ONE is a commercial component of Ancubic Harmoni City, a 33-acre leasehold township by Ancubic Group at Persiaran Aman Perdana 3, Tropicana Aman, Telok Panglima Garang, just north of Bandar Rimbayu. Planned as \"The Harmoni ESG City\", the township brings living, working and leisure together within one integrated address, with Harmoni ONE's shop offices sitting alongside the five-storey shoplots of Harmoni 8.<0/> <1/> Harmoni ONE comprises 46 strata shop offices in 3½- and 4-storey formats, with built-ups of approximately 5,274 to 9,149 sq ft. The shops front the main road, and shared and individual lifts connect the upper floors directly to a basement car park. The development also provides retail kiosks and 24-hour security with a manned guardhouse.<2/> <3/> Around the shops, the township is designed as an everyday destination. Village Grocer operates within Ancubic Harmoni, the Ancubic PickleClub offers 22 sheltered professional pickleball courts, and a 1.5 km circular, pet-friendly Botanical Park walkpath runs through the development. Harmoni ONE also includes energy- and water-saving features recorded by the developer, among them elevators with regenerative drives, solar panels, EV charging facilities, water-efficient sanitary fittings and low-VOC interior paint.<4/> <5/> The site connects to the KESAS, ELITE, SKVE, LKSA and MEX highways, and sits within the growing Kota Kemuning South and Kuala Langat catchment, close to the established communities of Kota Kemuning, Bandar Rimbayu and Telok Panglima Garang.": "Harmoni ONE 是 Ancubic Harmoni City 的商业部分。Ancubic Harmoni City 是 Ancubic Group 位于 Telok Panglima Garang Tropicana Aman 的 Persiaran Aman Perdana 3、占地 33 英亩的租赁地契城镇，就在 Bandar Rimbayu 北面。城镇以 \"The Harmoni ESG City\" 为规划理念，将居住、工作和休闲集中在同一个综合地址，Harmoni ONE 的店屋与 Harmoni 8 的五层店屋比邻。<0/> <1/> Harmoni ONE 共有 46 间分层店屋，分为 3½ 层和 4 层两种，建筑面积约 5,274 至 9,149 平方尺。店铺面向主干道，共用电梯和独立电梯直接连接楼上楼层与地下停车场。项目还设有零售亭，以及 24 小时有人驻守的保安亭。<2/> <3/> 店铺周边，整个城镇被打造成日常生活的好去处：Ancubic Harmoni 内有 Village Grocer 超市，Ancubic PickleClub 提供 22 个有盖专业匹克球场，还有一条 1.5 公里、欢迎宠物的环形 Botanical Park 步道贯穿项目。Harmoni ONE 也配备发展商列明的节能节水设计，包括再生驱动电梯、太阳能板、电动车充电设施、节水卫浴设备和低 VOC 室内漆。<4/> <5/> 项目连接 KESAS、ELITE、SKVE、LKSA 和 MEX 大道，位于持续发展的 Kota Kemuning South 和瓜拉冷岳一带，邻近 Kota Kemuning、Bandar Rimbayu 和 Telok Panglima Garang 等成熟社区。",
