"Ancubic is a Malaysian property developer focused on creating thoughtfully planned residential, commercial and integrated developments that respond to the way people live, work and do business. Its developments place emphasis on practical design, connectivity, lifestyle integration and the creation of environments that can support long-term community growth.": "Ancubic 是马来西亚产业发展商，专注打造规划周到的住宅、商业和综合发展项目，贴合人们居住、工作和经商的方式。旗下项目注重实用设计、交通连接、生活机能，以及能支持社区长期发展的环境。",
"Through projects such as <0>Ancubic Harmoni City</0>, the group is expanding its presence with larger masterplanned developments that bring together commercial, retail, wellness, recreation and residential components. <1>Harmoni ONE</1>, developed by Ancubic Valley Sdn Bhd, reflects this approach through a modern commercial concept designed around visibility, accessibility and flexible business spaces within a growing integrated township.": "通过 <0>Ancubic Harmoni City</0> 等项目，集团以更大型的整体规划发展项目扩大版图，结合商业、零售、保健、休闲和住宅。由 Ancubic Valley Sdn Bhd 发展的 <1>Harmoni ONE</1> 正体现了这一方向：在持续发展的综合城镇中，以现代商业概念打造曝光度高、交通便利、空间灵活的营业场所。",
