"About I.MAS @ Bandar Rinching": "关于 I.MAS @ Bandar Rinching",
"I.MAs Industrial @ Semenyih is a freehold industrial scheme of just seven factories by Homecity Realty in Bandar Rinching Seksyen 6, on the eastern side of Jalan Semenyih. Six semi-detached factories and one detached bungalow factory give owner-occupiers a choice of sizes in an established neighbourhood where industrial units already sit beside homes, shops and schools. The name is short for \"Industrial Masterpiece\", and the bold orange-and-charcoal façades give every unit a street presence that works as its own signage.": "I.MAs Industrial @ Semenyih 是 Homecity Realty 在 Jalan Semenyih 东侧 Bandar Rinching Seksyen 6 推出的永久地契工业项目，仅有 7 间工厂。6 间半独立式工厂和 1 间独立式工厂，为自用业主提供不同面积的选择；所在社区成熟，工业单位本就与住宅、商店和学校比邻。项目名称是 \"Industrial Masterpiece\" 的缩写，醒目的橙色与炭灰色外墙让每个单位在街上都很显眼，本身就是招牌。",
"The semi-detached factories are built on three working levels: a ground-floor production hall, a mezzanine office floor overlooking the double-volume void, and a full first-floor warehouse. Types A and A1 (Lots 1 to 4) each offer 13,220 sq ft of built-up space in a building 51 feet wide and 115 feet deep, while Type B (Lots 5 and 6) offers 10,669 sq ft in the same three-level format at 85 feet deep. Office, production and storage sit under one roof, with separate staircases serving each unit.": "半独立式工厂设有三个工作楼层：底层生产厂房、俯瞰双层挑空的夹层办公室，以及整层一楼仓库。A 型和 A1 型（第 1 至 4 号地段）建筑面积各为 13,220 平方尺，楼宽 51 尺、深 115 尺；B 型（第 5 和 6 号地段）同样是三层格局，建筑面积 10,669 平方尺，深 85 尺。办公、生产和仓储集中在同一屋檐下，每个单位都有独立楼梯。",
"Lot 7 is the scheme's only bungalow factory: a detached Type C building of 11,860 sq ft with a ground-floor factory and first-floor warehouse, set on the largest parcel at 21,934 sq ft. Across the scheme, land sizes run from 12,463 to 21,934 sq ft, so every factory stands in its own compound with room around the building for parking, loading and landscaping.": "第 7 号地段是项目中唯一的独立式工厂：C 型独立建筑，建筑面积 11,860 平方尺，底层为厂房、一楼为仓库，坐落在面积最大的 21,934 平方尺地段上。整个项目的土地面积介于 12,463 至 21,934 平方尺，每间工厂都有独立院地，建筑四周留有停车、上下货和园景的空间。",
"Day-to-day logistics are straightforward. The site is served by 66-foot roads, and the LEKAS Highway's Semenyih toll plaza is about 5.7 km (roughly 8 minutes) away, linking north to Kajang, Cheras and Kuala Lumpur and south to Nilai and Seremban. Lotus's Semenyih and a petrol station are under 3 km away and Semenyih town is about 4.5 km, putting staff amenities, banks and suppliers close at hand.": "日常物流十分便利。项目有 66 尺宽道路，距 LEKAS 大道的 Semenyih 收费站约 5.7 公里（约 8 分钟），北通加影、蕉赖和吉隆坡，南达汝来和芙蓉。Lotus's Semenyih 和油站不到 3 公里，士毛月市区约 4.5 公里，员工生活所需、银行和供应商都近在咫尺。",
"I.MAs is at the upcoming stage, with plans subject to approval by the relevant authorities. For manufacturers, distributors and workshop operators who want to own freehold premises in the Semenyih corridor rather than keep renting, it is a compact, well-specified choice — contact the developer for pricing and release details.": "I.MAs 目前处于即将推出阶段，规划仍须相关当局批准。对于想在士毛月一带拥有永久地契厂房、不再租用的制造商、分销商和工作坊业者来说，这是规模精巧、规格完善的选择——请联系发展商了解价格和推出详情。",
"I.MAs Industrial sits in Bandar Rinching Seksyen 6, Semenyih, an established township east of Jalan Semenyih where light-industrial units, housing and local commerce sit side by side. The land is freehold, and the scheme is laid out as a compact enclave of seven industrial lots rather than part of a large industrial estate.<0/> <1/> The master plan arranges the seven lots in four product types. Three semi-detached pairs share party walls — Lots 1 and 2 (Type A), Lots 3 and 4 (Type A1) and Lots 5 and 6 (Type B) — while Lot 7 (Type C) is a stand-alone bungalow factory. Semi-detached built-ups are 13,220 sq ft for Types A and A1 and 10,669 sq ft for Type B; the bungalow factory offers 11,860 sq ft.<2/> <3/> Each block sits within its own landscaped compound, with internal driveways circling the buildings, tree planting along the boundaries and a substation on site. The scheme is bounded by 66-foot roads on its northern sides, giving goods vehicles a direct approach to every lot; the irregular corner parcels are taken up by Type A1 and the larger Lot 7.<4/> <5/> Lot sizes range from 12,463 sq ft to 21,934 sq ft, leaving open land around every building for parking, loading and circulation. I.MAs is at the upcoming stage; the layout, specifications and figures shown are the developer's current plans and remain subject to approval and change.": "I.MAs Industrial 位于士毛月 Bandar Rinching Seksyen 6，这是 Jalan Semenyih 东面的成熟城镇，轻工业单位、住宅和本地商业比邻共存。土地为永久地契，项目规划为 7 个工业地段组成的精巧园区，而非大型工业区的一部分。<0/> <1/> 总体规划将 7 个地段分为四种类型。三对半独立式工厂共用隔墙——第 1 和 2 号地段（A 型）、第 3 和 4 号地段（A1 型）以及第 5 和 6 号地段（B 型）；第 7 号地段（C 型）则是一间独立式工厂。半独立式工厂的建筑面积为：A 型和 A1 型 13,220 平方尺，B 型 10,669 平方尺；独立式工厂为 11,860 平方尺。<2/> <3/> 每栋建筑都有自己的园景院地，内部车道环绕建筑，边界种满树木，园区内另设变电站。项目北面临 66 尺宽道路，货车可直达每个地段；不规则的角落地段则由 A1 型和面积较大的第 7 号地段使用。<4/> <5/> 地段面积介于 12,463 平方尺至 21,934 平方尺，每栋建筑四周都留有停车、上下货和车辆进出的空地。I.MAs 目前处于即将推出阶段；所示格局、规格和数据均为发展商目前的规划，仍须经过批准并可能更改。",
