"Homecity Realty Sdn Bhd (Co. No. 201101018838 / 946971-P) is a Kajang-based property developer and the flagship of Homecity Group, which has been building in the Kajang–Semenyih corridor since 2001. The group is ISO 9001 certified, and its landed work has been recognised with a StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) recognition and a Sin Chew Business Excellence Award in 2020.": "Homecity Realty Sdn Bhd（公司注册号 201101018838 / 946971-P）是总部设在加影的产业发展商，也是 Homecity Group 的旗舰公司，自 2001 年起便在加影–士毛月一带建屋。集团获 ISO 9001 认证，其有地住宅项目曾获 StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) 认可，并于 2020 年荣获星洲企业楷模奖 (Sin Chew Business Excellence Award)。",
"Homecity Realty completed Taman Ara Bayu in Mantin, a 97-home terrace scheme that received its Certificate of Completion and Compliance in January 2025, and the group is currently delivering Taman Ara Bayu 2 through sister company PFA Land Sdn Bhd. I.MAs Industrial joins 963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun as the group's move into industrial property on its home ground in Semenyih, applying two decades of local building experience to premises designed for business owners.": "Homecity Realty 已完成文丁的 Taman Ara Bayu，这是一个共 97 间排屋的项目，于 2025年1月取得完工及合格证书 (CCC)；集团目前正通过姊妹公司 PFA Land Sdn Bhd 发展 Taman Ara Bayu 2。I.MAs Industrial 与 963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun 一样，代表集团在士毛月大本营进军工业产业，把二十年的在地建屋经验，用于打造为企业主而设计的厂房。",
