"About Irama Wangsa @ Wangsa Maju": "关于 Irama Wangsa @ Wangsa Maju",
"Irama Wangsa is a freehold hillpark condominium in Seksyen 10, Wangsa Maju, developed by World Finder Resources Sdn Bhd, a member of the Benéton Properties Group. Completed in July 2018 with its Certificate of Completion and Compliance issued and individual strata titles in hand, the development places just 655 homes on 9 acres of elevated land — three towers of 25 and 26 storeys — with almost half the site, a 4-acre private hill park, kept as green space for residents.": "Irama Wangsa 是位于旺沙玛朱 Seksyen 10 的永久地契山丘公园共管公寓，由 Benéton Properties Group 旗下的 World Finder Resources Sdn Bhd 发展。项目于 2018年7月完工，已取得完工及合格证书 (CCC)，独立分层地契也已发出。9 英亩的高地上只有 655 个单位——三座分别为 25 层和 26 层的大楼——近一半土地保留为 4 英亩的私人山丘公园，作为住户的绿地。",
"The hill park is the heart of the address: a multi-level jungle-trail jogging track winds up the slope to a tree house lookout, and a bridge links the greenery directly to the resort deck on Level 6 — a 50-metre Olympic-length freeform pool, water play park, fully equipped gymnasium and an indoor badminton hall within the 10,000 sq ft clubhouse. A kindergarten, surau, retail lots and the management office sit within the grounds, while each tower greets residents with a grand drop-off lobby, three-tier security access and a visitor-management mobile app. The landscape earned Irama Wangsa a Gold at the EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021.": "山丘公园是这里的核心：多层丛林慢跑径沿山坡蜿蜒而上，直达树屋观景台；一座天桥将绿地与第 6 层的度假平台直接相连——平台上有 50 米奥运标准长度的自由形泳池、水上游乐园、设备齐全的健身房，以及位于 10,000 平方尺会所内的室内羽球馆。园区内设有幼儿园、祈祷室 (surau)、零售单位和管理处；每座大楼都设有气派的落客大堂、三层保安门禁和访客管理手机应用。凭借园景设计，Irama Wangsa 荣获 EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021 金奖。",
"Homes span seven practical family layouts from 991 sq ft (2+1 bedrooms) to 1,637 sq ft, each with a balcony framing either the city skyline or the hill park, laminated-floor bedrooms, tiled living and wet areas, and generous parking — most units come with two car park bays.": "共有七种实用的家庭格局，面积由 991 平方尺（2+1 间卧室）至 1,637 平方尺，每户都有阳台，可眺望城市天际线或山丘公园；卧室铺设复合地板，客厅和湿区铺瓷砖，停车位充足——大部分单位附两个停车位。",
"Wangsa Maju keeps daily life close: Wangsa Walk Mall, AEON BIG and the Setapak retail belt minutes away, reputable schools and universities in the neighbourhood, and quick access to the DUKE, MRR2 and AKLEH highways — with a residents’ shuttle to Sri Rampai LRT station, six stops from KLCC. As a completed and individually-titled development, the final developer units are move-in ready, from RM550,000.": "住在旺沙玛朱，生活所需近在咫尺：Wangsa Walk Mall、AEON BIG 和文良港商圈只需几分钟，附近有知名学校和大学，还可快速进入 DUKE、MRR2 和 AKLEH 大道；住户专属穿梭巴士往返 LRT Sri Rampai 站，距 KLCC 仅六站。项目已完工并发出独立地契，发展商最后几个单位可即刻入住，RM550,000 起。",
"9 Acres": "9 英亩",
"The master plan hands almost half the land back to nature: of the 9-acre freehold parcel on a natural rise in Seksyen 10 Wangsa Maju, the built footprint is kept compact so that a 4-acre private hill park survives intact along the southern and eastern boundary — a gazetted-feeling forest garden that belongs to the 655 households alone.": "总体规划把近一半土地还给大自然：在旺沙玛朱 Seksyen 10 一片天然高地上的 9 英亩永久地契土地中，建筑占地保持紧凑，让 4 英亩的私人山丘公园沿南面和东面边界完整保留——犹如受保护的森林花园，只属于 655 户住户。",
"Three towers frame the central resort deck. Blocks A and B stand to the north, Block C to the south, and between them sits the freeform 50-metre swimming pool with its wading and children’s pools, pool decks and seating deck, the clubhouse complex with its multipurpose hall, surau and changing rooms, a barbecue area and playground. From the deck, a green bridge crosses into the hill park where the jungle walk switchbacks up the slope to a tree house lookout — the landscape that won the project a Gold at the EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021.": "三座大楼环绕中央的度假平台。A 座和 B 座位于北面，C 座位于南面，中间是 50 米自由形泳池，连同浅水池和儿童池、池畔平台和休憩平台，以及设有多功能礼堂、祈祷室 (surau) 和更衣室的会所、烧烤区和游乐场。从平台出发，一座绿色天桥通往山丘公园，丛林步道沿山坡曲折而上，直达树屋观景台——正是这片园景让项目荣获 EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021 金奖。",
"The estate runs on a single guarded main entrance with a signature tree at the arrival court and a dedicated drop-off porte-cochère at each tower, backed by three-tier security access. Completed in July 2018 with CCC and strata titles issued, the plan’s low density — 655 homes on 9 acres — is what keeps Irama Wangsa feeling like a hillside resort rather than a high-rise estate.": "整个社区只有一个设有保安的主入口，迎宾广场上种着一棵标志性大树，每座大楼都有专属落客门廊，并配备三层保安门禁。项目于 2018年7月完工，已取得 CCC 并发出分层地契；低密度规划——9 英亩只有 655 户——让 Irama Wangsa 更像山坡度假村，而不是密集的高楼住宅区。",
