"About K Residence": "关于 K Residence",
"K Residence sits directly above Avenue K on Jalan Ampang, across the road from Suria KLCC and the Petronas Twin Towers. The freehold tower, completed in 2008, holds 188 residences. Its penthouses sit on the uppermost residential floors, and the ones now available are some of the largest homes in the building, from about 6,100 to 8,800 sq ft.": "K Residence 坐落于 Jalan Ampang 的 Avenue K 正上方，与 Suria KLCC 和国油双峰塔只隔一条马路。这座永久地契大楼于 2008 年竣工，共有 188 个住宅单位。顶层公寓位于最高的几层住宅楼层，目前可选的单位是楼内面积最大的住宅之一，约 6,100 至 8,800 平方尺。",
"Two of the penthouses each take up half of Level 48. Each has a living room, dining room and separate lounge, dry and wet kitchens, three bedrooms, and a separate room with its own bathroom that can serve as a home office or guest suite. The third is a duplex across Levels 46 and 47 of about 8,826 sq ft. The upper floor holds the living room, master bedroom, four further bedrooms, a family room and a play room. The lower floor has the kitchen, a second family room, maid's quarters and a terrace.": "其中两个顶层单位各占第 48 层的一半，每个单位都有客厅、饭厅和独立起居室、干湿厨房、三间卧室，以及一间附独立浴室的房间，可用作家庭办公室或客房。第三个单位是横跨第 46 和 47 层的复式单位，面积约 8,826 平方尺。上层设有客厅、主卧、另外四间卧室、家庭厅和游戏室；下层则是厨房、第二个家庭厅、佣人房和露台。",
"Daily life needs little driving. The KLCC LRT station on the Kelana Jaya Line connects to Avenue K below the residence, and the mall itself has a supermarket, cafés and restaurants. Suria KLCC is about five minutes' walk away, as is KLCC Park with its jogging track. Pavilion Kuala Lumpur is a short drive. Residents also have a private vehicle entrance from Jalan Mayang, away from the traffic on Jalan Ampang.": "日常生活几乎不必开车。Kelana Jaya 线的 KLCC LRT 站直通楼下的 Avenue K，商场内就有超市、咖啡馆和餐厅。步行约五分钟即可到 Suria KLCC，附设跑步径的 KLCC 公园也一样近；开车不久就到 Pavilion Kuala Lumpur。住户还有从 Jalan Mayang 进出的私人车道，避开 Jalan Ampang 的车流。",
"The tower was designed by DCM Studios with a curved double-layered façade, and residents have their own lobby with a concierge desk. A swimming pool and landscaped garden sit on the podium roof. For buyers who want a large home at the centre of Kuala Lumpur, close to embassies, international schools and the city's leading hospitals, these penthouses offer space that is rarely available in the KLCC area. Viewings are by appointment with the developer's sales representative.": "大楼由 DCM Studios 设计，采用弧形双层外墙，住户拥有自己的大堂和礼宾柜台。裙楼屋顶设有游泳池和景观花园。对于想在吉隆坡市中心拥有大面积住宅、又想靠近各国大使馆、国际学校和城中顶尖医院的买家来说，这些顶层公寓提供了 KLCC 一带难得一见的空间。看房须通过发展商的销售代表预约。",
"K Residence stands on freehold land at 156 Jalan Ampang, in the Kuala Lumpur City Centre. The site is shared with Avenue K, a retail podium whose shops and restaurants face Jalan Ampang, while the residential tower rises above it. The development is managed as one strata scheme covering both the mall and the residences.<0/> <1/> The tower is about 202 metres tall and contains 188 residences, with most floors holding around five homes. The penthouses on the uppermost residential floors are the largest. Two of them split Level 48 between them, one facing the Petronas Twin Towers and Jalan Ampang, the other facing east over Jalan Yap Kwan Seng. The duplex occupies half of Level 47 together with part of Level 46.<2/> <3/> Residents reach the tower through a private access road from Jalan Mayang, with their own lobby and lifts separate from the mall. A swimming pool and landscaped garden sit on the podium roof. The KLCC LRT station connects to Avenue K, so rail, shopping and dining are available without leaving the building, and KLCC Park, Suria KLCC and the Kuala Lumpur Convention Centre are all within walking distance.": "K Residence 位于吉隆坡市中心 156 Jalan Ampang 的永久地契土地上。地段与 Avenue K 共用——Avenue K 是一座零售裙楼，商店和餐厅面向 Jalan Ampang，住宅大楼则在其上拔地而起。整个发展项目以单一分层管理计划运作，涵盖商场和住宅。<0/> <1/> 大楼高约 202 米，共有 188 个住宅单位，大部分楼层约有五个单位。最高几层住宅楼层的顶层公寓面积最大。其中两个单位平分第 48 层，一个面向国油双峰塔和 Jalan Ampang，另一个朝东俯瞰 Jalan Yap Kwan Seng。复式单位则占第 47 层的一半，加上第 46 层的一部分。<2/> <3/> 住户经由 Jalan Mayang 的私人通道进入大楼，拥有与商场分开的专属大堂和电梯。裙楼屋顶设有游泳池和景观花园。KLCC LRT 站直通 Avenue K，搭车、购物、用餐都不必走出大楼；KLCC 公园、Suria KLCC 和吉隆坡会展中心也都在步行范围内。",
