"K Residence was developed by KL Landmark Sdn Bhd, a subsidiary of Olympia Industries Berhad. Olympia Industries and DutaLand Berhad are sister companies under the same controlling shareholder, and DutaLand presents K Residence among its affiliated projects. The tower was built above Avenue K, the Jalan Ampang shopping mall owned by the same group, and was completed in 2008.": "K Residence 由 Olympia Industries Berhad 的子公司 KL Landmark Sdn Bhd 发展。Olympia Industries 与 DutaLand Berhad 是同一控股股东旗下的姐妹公司，DutaLand 也将 K Residence 列为其关联项目之一。大楼建于同一集团旗下的 Jalan Ampang 购物商场 Avenue K 之上，于 2008 年竣工。",
"DutaLand Berhad has been listed on Bursa Malaysia since 1973 and was renamed from Mycom Berhad in 2007. Its property business spans Kuala Lumpur and Negeri Sembilan. In Kuala Lumpur, it developed KH Villa, a Sri Hartamas enclave of four-storey town villas designed with Kengo Kuma &amp; Associates and completed in 2011. In Seremban, its subsidiary Oakland Holdings has been developing the Oakland commercial area since the early 1990s, including the completed Oakland Square and the Oakland Ninety2 shop offices now under construction.": "DutaLand Berhad 自 1973 年起在马来西亚交易所上市，2007 年由 Mycom Berhad 易名而来。其产业业务遍及吉隆坡和森美兰。在吉隆坡，它发展了 KH Villa——位于 Sri Hartamas、与 Kengo Kuma &amp; Associates 合作设计的四层城镇别墅社区，于 2011 年竣工。在芙蓉，其子公司 Oakland Holdings 自 1990 年代初便开始发展 Oakland 商业区，包括已竣工的 Oakland Square，以及目前建筑中的 Oakland Ninety2 店屋。",
