"Skypark Kepler is the first residential phase of Lido Waterfront Boulevard, Tropicana's 163-acre freehold waterfront development on the Johor Bahru city coastline, looking across the Johor Strait to Singapore. Its two 54-storey towers hold 1,596 serviced apartments, priced from RM522,000, in one-, two- and three-bedroom layouts of 463 to 807 sq ft.": "Skypark Kepler 是 Lido Waterfront Boulevard 的首个住宅期。Lido Waterfront Boulevard 是 Tropicana 在新山市区海岸线上占地 163 英亩的永久地契海滨发展项目，隔着柔佛海峡遥望新加坡。两座 54 层大楼共有 1,596 个服务式公寓单位，售价 RM522,000 起，提供一房、两房和三房格局，面积 463 至 807 平方尺。",
"Each layout keeps the essentials simple. The 463 sq ft Type A is a one-bedroom, one-bathroom home with a living and dining area, a kitchen and a store room. The 667 sq ft Type B, which makes up most of the towers, has two bedrooms, two bathrooms and a balcony, while the 807 sq ft Type C adds a third bedroom and a third bathroom. Homes come either fully furnished, with Samsung appliances, a Teka kitchen and Kohler sanitary ware, or semi-furnished, with kitchen cabinets, a hood and hob, air-conditioning in every bedroom and the living room, and water heaters.": "每种格局都简单实用。463 平方尺的 A 型为一房一浴，设客厅兼饭厅、厨房和储藏室。667 平方尺的 B 型占了大楼的大部分单位，有两房两浴和阳台；807 平方尺的 C 型则多一间卧室和一间浴室。单位可选全配套，附 Samsung 电器、Teka 厨房和 Kohler 卫浴；或半配套，附厨柜、抽油烟机和炉灶、每间卧室及客厅的冷气，以及热水器。",
"Skypark Kepler sits off Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan, the coastal road into the city centre. The RTS Link's Bukit Chagar station is about 4.6 km away by road; when the line opens at the end of 2026, trains will reach Woodlands North in Singapore in about five minutes, with immigration cleared at the station. Tropicana plans a complimentary shuttle to the station for two years. Danga City Mall, KOMTAR JBCC and Johor Bahru City Square are around 5 to 6 km away, and KPJ Johor Specialist Hospital is less than 5 km away.": "Skypark Kepler 位于通往市中心的沿海大道 Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan 旁。驾车约 4.6 km 即可抵达 RTS Link 的 Bukit Chagar 站；该线于 2026 年底通车后，约五分钟就能抵达新加坡的 Woodlands North 站，并在车站完成通关。Tropicana 计划提供两年免费接驳车往返车站。Danga City Mall、KOMTAR JBCC 和 Johor Bahru City Square 约 5 至 6 km，KPJ Johor Specialist Hospital 不到 5 km。",
"Residents get 43 facilities on the Level 9 podium deck: a pool zone with a swimming pool, water slide, bubble pool and jacuzzi; a recreation zone with a half basketball court, outdoor gym, parcourse and yoga deck; landscaped gardens with mini golf and a children's playscape; and gathering spaces with BBQ areas and lounges. Beyond the towers, Lido Waterfront Boulevard is planned with a 2.5 km coastal boardwalk and a 32-acre green park.": "住户可在第 9 层裙楼平台享用 43 项设施：泳池区设有游泳池、滑水道、气泡池和按摩池；休闲区有半场篮球场、户外健身房、体能训练径和瑜伽平台；景观花园内有迷你高尔夫和儿童游乐区；另有设烧烤区和休闲厅的聚会空间。大楼之外，Lido Waterfront Boulevard 还规划了 2.5 km 的海滨栈道和占地 32 英亩的绿色公园。",
"The land is freehold and designated an international lot, so foreign buyers can purchase from RM400,000. Tropicana has partnered Banyan Group as collaborator and management company for the residences, and China State Construction Engineering Corporation is building the towers, with completion expected in November 2029. Send an enquiry and the developer's sales representative will share the latest prices and available units.": "这块地为永久地契，并被列为国际地段，外国买家可购买 RM400,000 起的单位。Tropicana 与 Banyan Group 合作，由其担任住宅的合作方和管理公司；大楼由中国建筑工程总公司承建，预计于 2029年11月竣工。提交询问后，发展商的销售代表会为您提供最新价格和可选单位。",
"3.97 Acres": "3.97 英亩",
"Lido Waterfront Boulevard is Tropicana's 163-acre freehold mixed development on reclaimed land along the Johor Bahru city waterfront, facing Singapore across the Johor Strait. Its master plan brings together residential, commercial, wellness, education, hospitality, recreational and lifestyle components, with a planned 2.5 km coastal boardwalk and a 32-acre green park along the water. Skypark Kepler is the development's first residential phase, set on a 3.97-acre freehold site beside Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan.<0/> <1/> Skypark Kepler comprises two 54-storey towers with 1,596 serviced apartments in three layouts: Type A one-bedroom units of 463 sq ft, Type B two-bedroom units of 667 sq ft, which form the large majority, and Type C three-bedroom units of 807 sq ft. Sixteen retail units occupy the base of the building, car parking takes up levels 2 to 8, and the residents' facilities sit on the Level 9 podium deck between the two towers.<2/> <3/> The approved plan divides the Level 9 deck into four zones: a landscape zone with a forest garden, mini golf, a children's playscape, a play wall, trampolines and a reflexology path; a pool zone with the main pool and wet deck, a water slide, a pool pergola, a bubble pool and a jacuzzi; a recreation zone with a half basketball court, parcourse, outdoor gym and yoga deck; and gathering spaces with an outdoor BBQ area, lounges, a feature gazebo, a contemplation deck and sensory and herb gardens. Tiered security controls access to the towers.<4/> <5/> The sales permit runs from January 2025, and the first sale and purchase agreements were signed in May 2025. KPKT reports construction at 20% and on track as of October 2026. The developer expects completion in November 2029, and vacant possession is due by 16 March 2030 under the approved timeline. Timing for the later components of Lido Waterfront Boulevard has not been announced.": "Lido Waterfront Boulevard 是 Tropicana 在新山市区海滨填海地上打造的 163 英亩永久地契综合发展项目，隔着柔佛海峡与新加坡相望。其总体规划涵盖住宅、商业、健康养生、教育、酒店、休闲和生活方式等部分，并计划沿海建设 2.5 km 的海滨栈道和 32 英亩的绿色公园。Skypark Kepler 是项目的首个住宅期，坐落于 Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan 旁一块 3.97 英亩的永久地契地段。<0/> <1/> Skypark Kepler 由两座 54 层大楼组成，共有 1,596 个服务式公寓单位，分三种格局：463 平方尺的一房 A 型、667 平方尺的两房 B 型（占绝大多数），以及 807 平方尺的三房 C 型。大楼底层设有十六个零售单位，第 2 至 8 层为停车场，住户设施则位于两座大楼之间的第 9 层裙楼平台。<2/> <3/> 根据获批的规划，第 9 层平台分为四个区：景观区设有森林花园、迷你高尔夫、儿童游乐区、游戏墙、弹跳床和脚底按摩步道；泳池区设有主泳池及浅水平台、滑水道、泳池凉棚、气泡池和按摩池；休闲区有半场篮球场、体能训练径、户外健身房和瑜伽平台；聚会空间则有户外烧烤区、休闲厅、特色凉亭、冥想平台，以及感官花园和香草园。大楼设有多重保安系统管制出入。<4/> <5/> 销售准证自 2025年1月起生效，首批买卖合约于 2025年5月签署。截至 2026年10月，地方政府发展部 (KPKT) 报告工程进度达 20%，按计划进行。发展商预计于 2029年11月竣工，根据获批的时间表，须于 2030年3月16日前交屋 (VP)。Lido Waterfront Boulevard 后续部分的时间表尚未公布。",
