"Skypark Kepler is developed by Lido Waterfront Boulevard Sdn. Bhd. (471389-X), a Tropicana Corporation Berhad company and the licensed housing developer for the Lido Waterfront Boulevard land off Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan, Johor Bahru. The company, formerly known as Central Malaysian Properties Sdn. Bhd., is registered at Tropicana's head office in Tropicana Gardens Office Tower, Petaling Jaya, and runs the Lido Waterfront Boulevard Property Gallery in Teluk Danga.": "Skypark Kepler 由 Tropicana Corporation Berhad 旗下的 Lido Waterfront Boulevard Sdn. Bhd. (471389-X) 发展，该公司是新山 Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan 旁 Lido Waterfront Boulevard 地段的持证房屋发展商。公司前身为 Central Malaysian Properties Sdn. Bhd.，注册地址为 Tropicana 位于八打灵再也 Tropicana Gardens Office Tower 的总部，并在 Teluk Danga 设有 Lido Waterfront Boulevard Property Gallery。",
"Tropicana Corporation Berhad is a property group listed on Bursa Malaysia. Founded in 1979, it is known for resort-style communities such as Tropicana Golf &amp; Country Resort, Tropicana Indah and Tropicana City in the Klang Valley, and Tropicana Danga Bay in Johor. For Skypark Kepler, Tropicana works with Singapore-based Banyan Group, which plays a dual role as collaborator and management company, and with Samsung and Kohler on the homes' appliances and sanitary ware. Construction began after the groundbreaking with China State Construction Engineering Corporation in October 2024.": "Tropicana Corporation Berhad 是在马来西亚交易所上市的产业集团，创立于 1979 年，以度假村式社区闻名，例如巴生谷的 Tropicana Golf &amp; Country Resort、Tropicana Indah 和 Tropicana City，以及柔佛的 Tropicana Danga Bay。在 Skypark Kepler 项目中，Tropicana 与新加坡的 Banyan Group 合作，由其同时担任合作方和管理公司；住宅的电器和卫浴则分别与 Samsung 和 Kohler 合作。项目于 2024年10月与中国建筑工程总公司举行动土礼后开工。",
