"About Minest Residence": "关于 Minest Residence",
"MiNest Residence is a completed freehold development in Sentul, about 6 km from KLCC, where the keys are already handed over. The development received its Certificate of Completion and Compliance on 22 October 2024, so buyers step into finished homes and a running community rather than waiting out a construction timeline.": "MiNest Residence 是位于冼都、距离 KLCC 约 6 km 的已竣工永久地契项目，钥匙已经交付。项目于 2024年10月22日获得完工与合规证书 (CCC)，买家可以直接入住现成的房子和成熟的社区，不必苦等施工期。",
"The open-market block, The Zen, is built for families who need real space. Every layout offers four bedrooms and three bathrooms: Type A at 1,050 sq ft, and Types B and C at 1,239 sq ft. Each plan has an enclosed kitchen with its own yard, a balcony off the living room, and a fourth bedroom that sits beside its own bathroom.": "面向公开市场的 The Zen 座，专为需要宽敞空间的家庭而建。所有格局都是四房三浴：A 型 1,050 平方尺，B 型和 C 型 1,239 平方尺。每个格局都有自带晒衣区的封闭式厨房、连接客厅的阳台，以及旁边设有专属浴室的第四间卧室。",
"Residents share 40 facilities spread across three levels. The Level 7 podium carries a 50m infinity pool, jacuzzi, children's pool, a 350m jogging track, mini golf, an outdoor gym, a reflexology path, BBQ areas, a reading room and a kids' creative space. The Level 43 rooftop adds a sky gym, sky yoga, a sky tea garden, a meditation deck and a sky BBQ, while the ground floor has a surau, laundry, shops and a kindergarten. Badminton courts sit on Level 6.": "住户共享分布在三个楼层的 40 项设施。第 7 层裙楼设有 50m 无边际泳池、按摩池、儿童泳池、350m 跑步径、迷你高尔夫、户外健身房、脚底按摩步道、烧烤区、阅读室和儿童创意空间。第 43 层屋顶另有空中健身房、空中瑜伽、空中茶园、冥想平台和空中烧烤区，底层则有祈祷室 (surau)、洗衣房、商店和幼儿园。羽毛球场位于第 6 层。",
"Getting around is straightforward. LRT Sentul Timur, KTM Sentul and the MRT Putrajaya Line are all close by, with the developer's approved advertisement placing the MRT about 1 km away, and the Duta–Ulu Klang Expressway (DUKE) runs between Jalan Duta and Ulu Klang. Bukit Bintang is about 7 km and Mont Kiara about 9 km away.": "出行很方便。LRT Sentul Timur、KTM Sentul 和 MRT 布城线都在附近，发展商获批的广告显示 MRT 站仅约 1 km；Duta–Ulu Klang 大道 (DUKE) 连接 Jalan Duta 和 Ulu Klang。武吉免登约 7 km，满家乐约 9 km。",
"Approved selling prices across the development range from RM299,800 to RM750,000. The 822 sq ft homes at RM299,800 were offered under the Residensi Wilayah (RUMAWIP) scheme, which carries its own eligibility criteria. Send an enquiry and the developer's sales representative will confirm which homes are currently available and at what price.": "整个项目的获批售价介于 RM299,800 至 RM750,000。售价 RM299,800、面积 822 平方尺的单位属于 Residensi Wilayah (RUMAWIP) 计划，另有申请资格规定。提交询问后，发展商的销售代表会为您确认目前还有哪些单位及其售价。",
"5.5 Acres": "5.5 英亩",
"MiNest Residence is a freehold residential development on approximately 5.5 acres in Sentul, Kuala Lumpur, approved by Dewan Bandaraya Kuala Lumpur. It comprises 1,368 homes in two blocks of 684 units each, completed with the Certificate of Completion and Compliance issued on 22 October 2024.<0/> <1/> The Zen is the open-market block, offering four-bedroom, three-bathroom homes in three layouts: Type A at 1,050 sq ft, and Types B and C at 1,239 sq ft. Zen 2 is the Residensi Wilayah (RUMAWIP) block, with 822 sq ft three-bedroom, two-bathroom homes approved at RM299,800 for eligible buyers; public applications for this scheme closed on 15 March 2025.<2/> <3/> Parking occupies a multi-level podium served by a direct car-park ramp. Facilities are spread across three levels: the ground floor, the Level 7 podium deck and the Level 43 rooftop, with badminton courts on Level 6. In all, the developer's approved advertisement lists 40 shared facilities.": "MiNest Residence 是位于吉隆坡冼都、占地约 5.5 英亩的永久地契住宅项目，由吉隆坡市政局 (Dewan Bandaraya Kuala Lumpur) 批准。项目共有 1,368 个单位，分为两座，每座 684 个单位，已经竣工，并于 2024年10月22日获发完工与合规证书 (CCC)。<0/> <1/> The Zen 是面向公开市场的一座，提供四房三浴单位，共三种格局：A 型 1,050 平方尺，B 型和 C 型 1,239 平方尺。Zen 2 是 Residensi Wilayah (RUMAWIP) 座，三房两浴单位面积 822 平方尺，获批售价 RM299,800，供符合资格的买家购买；此计划的公开申请已于 2025年3月15日截止。<2/> <3/> 停车场设在多层裙楼内，有直达停车场的车道。设施分布在三个楼层：底层、第 7 层裙楼平台和第 43 层屋顶，羽毛球场则在第 6 层。发展商获批的广告共列出 40 项共享设施。",
