"Mi Nest Development Sdn. Bhd. is the KPKT-licensed developer of MiNest Residence in Sentul (developer licence 19664/04-2028/0130(R)). The company carried the 1,368-unit development through to completion, with the Certificate of Completion and Compliance issued on 22 October 2024 and vacant possession delivered from 1 November 2024.": "Mi Nest Development Sdn. Bhd. 是冼都 MiNest Residence 的 KPKT 持证发展商（发展商执照 19664/04-2028/0130(R)）。公司一手将这个 1,368 个单位的项目建成，于 2024年10月22日获发完工与合规证书，并自 2024年11月1日起交屋。",
"The group behind MiNest also delivered The Nest @ Genting Klang in Setapak, a 364-unit serviced residence completed in 2018. MiNest Residence brings that experience to a larger address, combining open-market family homes with an affordable Residensi Wilayah component on the same site.": "MiNest 背后的集团也曾完成位于文良港的 The Nest @ Genting Klang，这是一个拥有 364 个单位、于 2018 年竣工的服务式住宅。MiNest Residence 把这份经验带到规模更大的项目，在同一地段结合公开市场的家庭单位与 Residensi Wilayah 可负担房屋。",
