"About Oakland Ninety2": "关于 Oakland Ninety2",
"Own your business address in Seremban 2. Oakland Ninety2 is a new row of 92 freehold shop offices on Jalan Haruan 5/9 in Oakland, next to the completed Oakland Square. Each unit has its own individual commercial title, so you own the land and the whole building rather than a strata share.": "在 Seremban 2 拥有属于您的营业地址。Oakland Ninety2 是位于 Oakland 区 Jalan Haruan 5/9 的一排全新店屋，共 92 间，永久地契，紧邻已竣工的 Oakland Square。每个单位都有独立的商业地契，土地和整栋建筑都归您所有，而不只是分层产权的一部分。",
"Choose the size that fits your business. The 53 two-storey units (2,662 to 2,990 sq ft) put a shop on the ground floor and an office on the 1st floor. The 39 three-storey units (4,205 to 6,663 sq ft) add a second office floor. They fill Blocks A and F and the ends of the other rows, and the corner units have glass corporate facades.": "选择最适合您生意的面积。53 间双层单位（2,662 至 2,990 平方尺）底层为店面，第 1 层为办公室。39 间三层单位（4,205 至 6,663 平方尺）则多一层办公楼层，分布在 A 座和 F 座以及其他各排的两端，角头单位更设有玻璃企业外墙。",
"The design suits owners who want to use one floor and rent out the others. A private staircase leads from the ground floor to the office floor, every floor has its own TNB and water meters, and the three-storey units have two staircases. The shop floor has a high ceiling, at 3.6 m floor to floor, behind a column-free verandah and a glass shop-front door, with a roller shutter at the back. Rainwater harvesting is built in, and parking bays line every row, with 626 visitor car parks in all.": "这样的设计适合想自用一层、出租其余楼层的业主。底层有独立楼梯直达办公楼层，每层都有独立的 TNB 电表和水表，三层单位更设有两道楼梯。店面楼层楼高达 3.6 m，前有无柱五脚基和玻璃店门，后有卷闸门。单位内置雨水收集系统，每排都设有停车位，共有 626 个访客停车位。",
"Oakland is an established business area. AEON Seremban 2 and NSK Trade City are about 2.3 km by road, Columbia Asia Hospital 1.5 km and the Seremban toll on the North–South Expressway 2.7 km, with KLIA about 48 km away. Car showrooms, the Yakult factory and state offices such as Jabatan Audit Negara are within 2 km, and the developer's sales gallery is at Oakland Square, a short walk away.": "Oakland 是成熟的商业区。驾车约 2.3 km 就到 AEON Seremban 2 和 NSK Trade City，Columbia Asia Hospital 1.5 km，南北大道的芙蓉收费站 2.7 km，KLIA 约 48 km。汽车展销厅、Yakult 工厂以及 Jabatan Audit Negara 等政府部门都在 2 km 范围内，发展商的销售展厅则设在步行可达的 Oakland Square。",
"4.53 Acres": "4.53 英亩",
"Oakland Ninety2 is Phase 4G, the final plot of DutaLand's Oakland commercial area in Seremban. The freehold site of 4.53 acres (Lots PT3258 and PT3259, Mukim Pekan Bukit Kepayang) lies on the south side of Jalan Haruan 5/9, opposite Oakland Square, with a lake along its west side.<0/> <1/> The site plan has 92 shop offices with individual commercial titles in nine blocks, A to J (there is no Block I). 53 units are two-storey and 39 are three-storey: Blocks A and F are three-storey throughout, and the other rows have three-storey units at their ends. Parking bays line every row, with 626 visitor car parks in total.<2/> <3/> The project was launched in the first quarter of 2024 with an estimated gross development value of RM110.0 million. DutaLand reported 48% of the units sold by 30 June 2024 and 79% in its 2025 annual report.<4/> <5/> Construction is under way. The developer's progress photos show earthworks in April 2024, piling in December 2024 and the structural frame in May 2025. No completion date has been published, so ask the developer's sales representative for the latest progress and handover timing.": "Oakland Ninety2 是第 4G 期，也是 DutaLand 在芙蓉 Oakland 商业区的最后一块地段。这块 4.53 英亩的永久地契地段（Lot PT3258 和 PT3259，Mukim Pekan Bukit Kepayang）位于 Jalan Haruan 5/9 南侧，对面就是 Oakland Square，西侧临湖。<0/> <1/> 根据地盘平面图，项目共有 92 间附独立商业地契的店屋，分为 A 至 J 九座（没有 I 座）。其中 53 间为双层，39 间为三层：A 座和 F 座全为三层单位，其他各排的两端也是三层单位。每排都设有停车位，共有 626 个访客停车位。<2/> <3/> 项目于 2024 年第一季推出，预计发展总值 (GDV) 为 1.1 亿令吉。DutaLand 报告指截至 2024年6月30日已售出 48% 单位，在 2025 年年报中则为 79%。<4/> <5/> 工程正在进行。发展商的进度照片显示，2024年4月进行土方工程，2024年12月打桩，2025年5月已见结构框架。竣工日期尚未公布，请向发展商的销售代表了解最新进度和交屋时间。",
