"Oakland Ninety2 is developed by Oakland Holdings Sdn. Bhd. (198401008346 / 120863-A), a wholly owned subsidiary of DutaLand Berhad. DutaLand has been listed on Bursa Malaysia since 1973 and was known as Mycom Berhad until 2007. Its business covers property development, commodity trading and oil palm plantations, with property development its main earnings driver.": "Oakland Ninety2 由 DutaLand Berhad 的全资子公司 Oakland Holdings Sdn. Bhd. (198401008346 / 120863-A) 发展。DutaLand 自 1973 年起在马来西亚交易所上市，2007 年前名为 Mycom Berhad。其业务涵盖产业发展、商品贸易和油棕种植，其中产业发展是主要盈利来源。",
"DutaLand took control of Oakland Holdings in the early 1990s, and the company has since developed Oakland, a commercial area of shop offices on the Seremban side of the North–South Expressway. Its previous phase, Oakland Square (Phase 4F, 182 shops and offices), was completed in the fourth quarter of 2019 across Jalan Haruan 5/9. Oakland Ninety2 (Phase 4G) is the final plot of the area. In Kuala Lumpur, DutaLand's projects include KH Villa in Sri Hartamas.": "DutaLand 于 1990 年代初取得 Oakland Holdings 的控制权，此后该公司一直发展 Oakland——位于南北大道芙蓉一侧、以店屋为主的商业区。上一期 Oakland Square（第 4F 期，182 间店铺和办公室）位于 Jalan Haruan 5/9 对面，已于 2019 年第四季竣工。Oakland Ninety2（第 4G 期）是该区最后一块地段。在吉隆坡，DutaLand 的项目包括 Sri Hartamas 的 KH Villa。",
