"About Oakland Square": "关于 Oakland Square",
"Oakland Square is a freehold commercial development of 86 retail shops and 96 strata offices on 7.5 acres in Seremban, completed in the fourth quarter of 2019. It is built around a covered central boulevard, which the developer describes as the first boulevard concept in Seremban 2. The development sits in DutaLand's Oakland commercial area off Jalan Haruan 1, beside the North-South Expressway and next to the Seremban 2 township.": "Oakland Square 是位于芙蓉、占地 7.5 英亩的永久地契商业项目，共有 86 间零售店铺和 96 间分层办公室，已于 2019 年第四季竣工。项目围绕一条有盖的中央林荫大道而建，发展商称之为 Seremban 2 首个林荫大道概念。项目位于 DutaLand 的 Oakland 商业区，就在 Jalan Haruan 1 旁，紧邻南北大道和 Seremban 2 镇区。",
"The retail shops occupy the ground and first floors and open onto the boulevard. They range from about 1,041 to 2,119 sq ft; corner shops have frontage on three sides and intermediate shops on two, and the column-free spaces suit F&amp;B, lifestyle and service businesses. The strata offices on the upper floors range from about 1,120 to 2,718 sq ft, and some third-floor offices come with their own flat roof. They are open-plan suites with high ceilings and large windows, suitable for professional practices, regional offices and training or education centres.": "零售店铺位于底层和一楼，直接面向林荫大道，面积约 1,041 至 2,119 平方尺；角头店铺三面临街，中间店铺两面临街，无柱空间适合餐饮、生活时尚和服务业。楼上的分层办公室面积约 1,120 至 2,718 平方尺，部分三楼办公室还附有专属平台屋顶。这些开放式办公套房楼底高、窗户大，适合专业事务所、区域办事处以及培训或教育中心。",
"Getting there is simple for staff and customers. The North-South Expressway is about 2.3 km away and Jalan Lingkaran Tengah about 2 km, and KLIA is about 40 km away. NSK Trade City is about 700 m away, AEON Seremban 2 about 1.8 km and Columbia Asia Hospital about 1.2 km. Government offices, including the Seremban district police headquarters and the court complex, are about 1.8 km away.": "员工和顾客往来都很方便。南北大道约 2.3 km，Jalan Lingkaran Tengah 约 2 km，KLIA 约 40 km。NSK Trade City 约 700 m，AEON Seremban 2 约 1.8 km，Columbia Asia Hospital 约 1.2 km。芙蓉县警察总部和法庭大厦等政府机构约 1.8 km。",
"Oakland Square is already a working address. The developer reports about 92% of the shops and 85% of the offices occupied (January 2026), with tenants that include restaurants, cafés, beauty and wellness studios, offices and King's International School. It has 407 car parks, including 245 in the basement, 25 lifts and 24-hour security. Because the development is completed, buyers can view the actual premises before committing, with appointments arranged by the developer's sales representative.": "Oakland Square 已是一个运作中的营业地址。发展商报告指，约 92% 的店铺和 85% 的办公室已有租户入驻（2026年1月），租户包括餐厅、咖啡馆、美容与养生工作室、办公室，以及 King's International School。项目共有 407 个停车位（其中 245 个在地下室）、25 部电梯和 24 小时保安。由于项目已竣工，买家可以在决定前先参观实际单位，由发展商的销售代表安排预约。",
"7.5 Acres": "7.5 英亩",
"Oakland Square occupies a block between Jalan Haruan 5/8 and Jalan Haruan 5/9 in the Oakland commercial area of Seremban, with Jalan Haruan 1 at its western end. The freehold development stands on 7.5 acres and was completed in the fourth quarter of 2019 as Phase 4F of Oakland's commercial centre. Its neighbour to the south, Oakland Ninety2, is a separate final phase of individual-title shop offices.<0/> <1/> The complex holds 182 strata units in two blocks. Block A has four storeys with 112 units and Block B five storeys with 70 units; shops take the ground and first floors (86 units) and offices the floors above (96 units). The blocks are arranged around a covered central boulevard that links the retail frontages and the offices, so visitors can walk between shops and offices under cover.<2/> <3/> The development has 407 car parks: 245 private bays in the basement and 162 open bays. The offices are served by 25 lifts, security operates around the clock, and there is an open rooftop terrace. The boulevard doubles as open space for bazaars and weekend events, which helps bring visitors to the ground-floor shops.": "Oakland Square 位于芙蓉 Oakland 商业区 Jalan Haruan 5/8 与 Jalan Haruan 5/9 之间的地段，西端为 Jalan Haruan 1。这个永久地契项目占地 7.5 英亩，于 2019 年第四季竣工，是 Oakland 商业中心的第 4F 期。南面的邻居 Oakland Ninety2 则是另一个独立的最后一期，由独立地契的店屋组成。<0/> <1/> 整个综合体共有 182 个分层单位，分为两座。A 座为四层，共 112 个单位；B 座为五层，共 70 个单位；底层和一楼为店铺（86 个单位），以上楼层为办公室（96 个单位）。两座大楼围绕一条有盖的中央林荫大道而建，连接临街店面和办公室，访客可在有遮蔽的情况下往来于店铺与办公室之间。<2/> <3/> 项目共有 407 个停车位：地下室 245 个私人车位和 162 个露天车位。办公室配备 25 部电梯，保安全天候运作，另有开放式屋顶露台。林荫大道也可作为举办市集和周末活动的开放空间，有助于为底层店铺带来人流。",
