"About Residensi Sinaran": "关于 Residensi Sinaran",
"Residensi Sinaran is a completed, low-density residential development situated within the established neighbourhood of Taman Sri Muda, Shah Alam. Comprising only 62 three-storey stratified townhouses, the development is designed for families seeking the space and privacy of multi-level living within a more manageable residential community.": "Residensi Sinaran 是位于莎阿南 Taman Sri Muda 成熟社区的已竣工低密度住宅项目。项目仅有 62 间三层分层城镇屋，专为想要多层住宅的空间与隐私、又希望社区规模更易管理的家庭而设计。",
"Each home features a practical three-storey layout that creates a clear separation between shared living areas and private family spaces. The arrangement allows different areas of the home to serve different purposes, whether for everyday family activities, personal relaxation, working from home or accommodating members of a growing household. Spacious interiors and functional layouts provide residents with greater flexibility in planning their living environment according to their individual needs.": "每间房子都采用实用的三层格局，公共起居空间与家人的私人空间分隔清楚。这样的安排让家中不同区域各有用途，无论是日常家庭活动、个人休憩、在家办公，还是安顿日渐增加的家庭成员都很合适。宽敞的室内空间和实用的格局，让住户能按自己的需要更灵活地规划居住环境。",
"The development is set within a gated and guarded environment with controlled access, providing residents with an added sense of privacy and security. Its low-density nature also creates a quieter residential setting compared with larger developments containing hundreds of homes. Residents can enjoy the convenience of dedicated parking, shared community facilities and an environment planned around comfortable day-to-day living.": "项目采用设有门禁和保安的封闭式设计，为住户带来更多隐私和安全感。低密度规划也让居住环境比动辄数百户的大型项目更宁静。住户可享有专属停车位、共享社区设施，以及围绕舒适日常生活而规划的环境。",
"Located in the mature township of Taman Sri Muda, Residensi Sinaran is surrounded by established schools, markets, shops, healthcare services, public transportation and other everyday conveniences. Its Shah Alam location also provides access to surrounding commercial areas and key destinations across the Klang Valley through the existing road network.": "Residensi Sinaran 位于成熟的 Taman Sri Muda 镇区，周边学校、巴刹、商店、医疗服务、公共交通等日常便利设施一应俱全。地处莎阿南，也能通过现有道路网络前往周边商业区和巴生谷各主要地点。",
"As Residensi Sinaran is already completed, prospective purchasers have the advantage of viewing the actual homes, layouts and surrounding environment before making a decision. This provides greater clarity and confidence compared with purchasing a property based only on plans, illustrations or future completion promises.": "由于 Residensi Sinaran 已经竣工，有意买家可在做决定前亲眼看看实屋、格局和周边环境。比起只凭图则、效果图或未来竣工的承诺来买房，这样更清楚，也更安心。",
"Residensi Sinaran offers a practical option for homebuyers looking for a completed family residence, multi-level living, a low-density community and the convenience of an established Shah Alam neighbourhood.": "对于想要已竣工家庭住宅、多层居住空间、低密度社区，以及莎阿南成熟社区便利的买家来说，Residensi Sinaran 是个实际的选择。",
"2.2 Acres": "2.2 英亩",
"Residensi Sinaran is a completed low-density residential development located in the established neighbourhood of Taman Sri Muda, Shah Alam. Comprising only 62 three-storey stratified townhouses, the development offers spacious multi-level living designed for families seeking greater privacy, functionality and comfort.<0/> <1/> Each home features a practical layout that separates the main living areas from the bedrooms and private spaces, making it suitable for both growing and multi-generational families. Residents also benefit from the convenience of living within a mature neighbourhood, with schools, shops, daily necessities and major road connections located nearby.<2/> <3/> As a completed development, interested purchasers can view the actual homes and surroundings before making a decision. Submit an e-Enquiry to check the latest unit availability, pricing and viewing arrangements with the developer’s appointed sales representative.": "Residensi Sinaran 是位于莎阿南 Taman Sri Muda 成熟社区的已竣工低密度住宅项目。项目仅有 62 间三层分层城镇屋，提供宽敞的多层居住空间，专为追求更多隐私、实用与舒适的家庭而设计。<0/> <1/> 每间房子都采用实用格局，将主要起居空间与卧室和私人空间分开，适合成长中的家庭和三代同堂。住户也能享受成熟社区的便利，学校、商店、日常所需和主要道路都在附近。<2/> <3/> 项目已竣工，有意买家可在做决定前亲自看看实屋和周边环境。提交 e-⁠Enquiry，即可向发展商指定的销售代表查询最新可选单位、价格和看房安排。",
