"Established in 2016, SEGA Land Development Sdn Bhd is a boutique property developer based in Selangor. Its directors bring experience across property development, construction, valuation, estate agency, land matters and property management.": "SEGA Land Development Sdn Bhd 成立于 2016 年，是一家立足雪兰莪的精品产业发展商。公司董事在产业发展、建筑、估价、房地产中介、土地事务和产业管理方面拥有丰富经验。",
"Residensi Sinaran is the company’s maiden residential development—a low-density community of 62 stratified townhouses in Taman Sri Muda, Shah Alam. The project reflects the developer’s focus on practical layouts, controlled density and homes designed for long-term owner occupation.": "Residensi Sinaran 是该公司的首个住宅项目——位于莎阿南 Taman Sri Muda、由 62 间分层城镇屋组成的低密度社区。项目体现了发展商对实用格局、控制密度，以及适合业主长期自住的房子的重视。",
