"About RIA Sunsuria": "关于 RIA Sunsuria",
"<0>RIA Sunsuria</0> is a freehold condominium in Kwasa Damansara, the EPF-backed township taking shape between Kota Damansara and Sungai Buloh. Developed by Sunsuria Damansara Sdn Bhd, a subsidiary of Bursa-listed Sunsuria Berhad, in partnership with master developer Kwasa Land, it is Sunsuria's first project in the township: 494 condominium homes across two 21-storey towers on a 9.46-acre freehold parcel, with a further 26 three-storey terraced homes on the same land. The project is targeted for completion in January 2030.": "<0>RIA Sunsuria</0> 是位于 Kwasa Damansara 的永久地契公寓。Kwasa Damansara 是由雇员公积金局（EPF）支持、正在哥打白沙罗与双溪毛糯之间成形的新镇。项目由大马交易所上市公司 Sunsuria Berhad 的子公司 Sunsuria Damansara Sdn Bhd 与总发展商 Kwasa Land 合作发展，是 Sunsuria 在该镇的首个项目：在 9.46 英亩的永久地契地段上，两栋 21 层高楼共有 494 个公寓单位，同一地段另有 26 间三层排屋。项目目标于 2030年1月竣工。",
"What sets RIA apart is space. Instead of compact investor units, it offers four family-sized layouts from 1,195 sq ft to 1,841 sq ft — three-bedroom homes with three bathrooms, and four-bedroom homes with four to five bathrooms, a balcony on every layout, and a dedicated study or utility room on the two largest. Rooms face outward for natural light and airflow, common areas are stroller- and wheelchair-friendly, and the whole development is planned for multi-generational living, from a senior citizens' activity lounge to a pet recreation zone.": "RIA 最大的不同，在于空间。这里没有小巧的投资型单位，而是四种适合家庭的格局，面积 1,195 至 1,841 平方尺：三房三浴，以及四房配四至五间浴室；每种格局都有阳台，最大的两种还另设书房或多用途房。房间朝外，采光通风俱佳；公共区域方便婴儿车和轮椅通行；整个项目为三代同堂而规划，从乐龄活动厅到宠物休闲区一应俱全。",
"Facilities are spread across the landscaped deck and the podium: a swimming pool and wading pool, gym, multipurpose hall, surau, cabana and pavilion, BBQ area, children's playground, and pickleball, badminton and basketball courts on the carpark podium, with provisions for a kindergarten, reading room and laundry. The address is gated and guarded with multi-tier security, and residents overlook Kwasa Damansara's planned 42-acre Central Park and its 13.6-acre lake.": "设施分布在园林平台和裙楼：游泳池与浅水池、健身房、多功能厅、祈祷室、休闲小屋与凉亭、烧烤区、儿童游乐场，以及设在停车场裙楼上的匹克球场、羽毛球场和篮球场，并规划了幼儿园、阅读室和洗衣房的空间。社区采用围篱门禁设计，设有保安和多层保安系统，住户可眺望 Kwasa Damansara 规划中的 42 英亩中央公园及其 13.6 英亩湖泊。",
"Connectivity is the other half of the story. The Kwasa Damansara MRT interchange — serving both the Kajang and Putrajaya lines, with Park &amp; Ride — is about 300 metres away, putting Kota Damansara two stops away, 1 Utama five, and TRX fourteen. By road there is direct access to the DASH via Jalan Sungai Buloh, with the NKVE, Guthrie, LATAR and Federal Highway close by, so established neighbourhoods like Kota Damansara, Bandar Utama, TTDI and Desa ParkCity — and their malls, international schools and hospitals — are all a short drive from home.": "交通是另一大卖点。Kwasa Damansara MRT 转换站同时服务加影线和布城线，并设有泊车转乘，距离仅约 300 米：到哥打白沙罗只需两站，到 1 Utama 五站，到 TRX 十四站。公路方面，可经 Jalan Sungai Buloh 直通 DASH 大道，NKVE、Guthrie、LATAR 及联邦大道也近在咫尺；哥打白沙罗、万达镇、TTDI 和 Desa ParkCity 等成熟住宅区，以及当地的购物中心、国际学校和医院，都只需短程车程。",
