"RIA Sunsuria is developed by Sunsuria Damansara Sdn. Bhd., part of Sunsuria’s property development business. Established in 1989, Sunsuria Berhad is a publicly listed Malaysian group with businesses spanning property development, construction, education, healthcare, property investment and retail.": "RIA Sunsuria 由 Sunsuria Damansara Sdn. Bhd. 发展，隶属 Sunsuria 的产业发展业务。Sunsuria Berhad 成立于 1989 年，是马来西亚上市集团，业务涵盖产业发展、建筑、教育、医疗保健、产业投资和零售。",
"Guided by community-centric planning, Sunsuria focuses on creating environments that respond to how people live, work and connect. RIA Sunsuria reflects this approach through family-oriented layouts, shared recreational spaces and features designed for different generations.": "Sunsuria 秉持以社区为本的规划理念，致力打造贴合人们生活、工作与交流方式的环境。RIA Sunsuria 以适合家庭的格局、共享休闲空间和为不同世代设计的配套，体现了这一理念。",
