"About ROSEDALE by Ancubic (Retail &amp; Business Suites)": "关于 ROSEDALE by Ancubic (Retail &amp; Business Suites)",
"Rosedale's commercial component gives business owners a freehold address inside one of Bandar Botanic's newest integrated developments. Ancubic is releasing 40 retail lots across two phases, from 786 sq ft to 8,650 sq ft on the ground and first floors, planned for retail, food and beverage, services and a wide range of other business uses, together with 105 business suites of 630 sq ft on levels 2 to 6.": "Rosedale 的商业部分，让商家在 Bandar Botanic 最新的综合发展项目之一拥有永久地契地址。Ancubic 分两期推出 40 个零售单位，面积 786 至 8,650 平方尺，位于底层和一楼，可用于零售、餐饮、服务及其他各类商业用途；另有 105 间 630 平方尺的商务套房，位于第 2 至 6 层。",
"The lots come with a customer base built in. Rosedale's two residential phases add 976 serviced apartments to the same address, and the development sits within the established catchments of Bandar Botanic, Ambang Botanic, Bandar Bukit Tinggi and Kota Bayuemas. Shops face the main road with a north–south orientation, with 24/7 security and direct access to parking for customers.": "这些单位自带客源。Rosedale 的两期住宅在同一地址增加 976 个服务式公寓单位，项目也坐落在 Bandar Botanic、Ambang Botanic、Bandar Bukit Tinggi 和 Kota Bayuemas 等成熟社区的覆盖范围内。店铺面向大路，南北朝向，设有 24/7 保安，顾客可直通停车场。",
"The business suites suit offices, studios and short stays: short-term rental (Airbnb) is allowed, suite owners share the facilities deck with the residents, and ceilings are 2.9 m on levels 2 to 5 and 2.8 m on level 6.": "商务套房适合办公室、工作室和短期住宿：允许短租（Airbnb），套房业主与住户共享设施平台，第 2 至 5 层楼高 2.9 米，第 6 层 2.8 米。",
"Footfall has an anchor from the start. Jaya Grocer is the planned anchor tenant, and Ancubic signed memoranda of understanding with Jaya Grocer and Hock Kee for Rosedale in January 2026.": "人流从一开始就有主力店带动。Jaya Grocer 是规划中的主力租户，Ancubic 已于 2026年1月为 Rosedale 与 Jaya Grocer 及 Hock Kee 签署合作备忘录。",
"Access works for customers, staff and suppliers alike. The Bandar Bukit Tinggi station on the LRT3 Shah Alam Line, open since June 2026, is about 1 km away, and the KESAS Bandar Botanik interchange connects to Shah Alam, Subang and Kuala Lumpur, with LKSA, SKVE, WCE and the Federal Highway also within reach. The e-Enquiry page shows the units open now with the developer's list prices; the developer's sales representative will confirm the latest availability.": "无论顾客、员工还是供应商，出入都方便。LRT3 莎阿南线的 Bandar Bukit Tinggi 站已于 2026年6月通车，距离约 1 km；KESAS 大道的 Bandar Botanik 交流道通往莎阿南、梳邦和吉隆坡，LKSA、SKVE、WCE 及联邦大道也不远。e-⁠Enquiry 页面显示目前仍可咨询的单位及发展商标价；发展商的销售代表会为您确认最新供应情况。",
"Rosedale is a freehold mixed-use development on 5.379 acres in Bandar Botanic, Klang. Its podium holds 40 retail lots of 786 to 8,650 sq ft on the ground and first floors and 105 business suites of 630 sq ft on levels 2 to 6, below two towers with 976 serviced apartments.<0/> <1/> Phase 1 is expected to complete in March 2030, and the Bandar Bukit Tinggi LRT station is about 1 km away.": "Rosedale 是位于巴生 Bandar Botanic、占地 5.379 英亩的永久地契综合发展项目。裙楼底层和一楼设有 40 个零售单位，面积 786 至 8,650 平方尺；第 2 至 6 层设有 105 间 630 平方尺的商务套房；其上为两栋共 976 个单位的服务式公寓。<0/> <1/> 第 1 期预计于 2030年3月竣工，距 Bandar Bukit Tinggi LRT 站约 1 km。",
