"About ROSEDALE by Ancubic": "关于 ROSEDALE by Ancubic",
"<0>ᴀ ɴᴇᴡ ᴇxᴘʀᴇꜱꜱɪᴏɴ ᴏꜰ ʟɪᴠɪɴɢ<1/> ɪɴ ʙᴀɴᴅᴀʀ ʙᴏᴛᴀɴɪᴄ</0><2/>": "<0>演绎生活新意<1/> 尽在 Bandar Botanic</0><2/>",
"Rosedale by Ancubic introduces a more considered way of living in Bandar Botanic — one shaped by space, greenery, connectivity and the rhythm of everyday life.": "Rosedale by Ancubic 为 Bandar Botanic 带来更用心的生活方式 — 由空间、绿意、便捷交通与日常生活节奏共同塑造。",
"Set within one of Klang’s most established neighbourhoods, this freehold integrated development brings together contemporary serviced residences, retail conveniences and business spaces within a single address. Rather than existing apart from its surroundings, Rosedale is designed to become part of them — connected to the mature communities, amenities and conveniences that have long defined Bandar Botanic and Bukit Tinggi.": "这个永久地契综合发展项目坐落于巴生最成熟的社区之一，把现代服务式住宅、零售便利与商业空间汇聚于同一地址。Rosedale 并非与周边隔绝，而是设计成社区的一部分 — 与长久以来造就 Bandar Botanic 和 Bukit Tinggi 的成熟社区、生活设施和便利紧密相连。",
"At the heart of Rosedale are homes created for the way people live today. Thoughtfully planned layouts offer a balance between practicality and comfort, with spaces that can adapt naturally to different stages of life — from young professionals and couples to growing families. Beyond the residence itself, landscaped surroundings, lifestyle facilities, private parking and controlled access create an environment designed to make daily living feel more composed and effortless.": "Rosedale 的核心，是为现代生活方式而设计的家。精心规划的格局兼顾实用与舒适，空间可随人生不同阶段自然调整 — 从年轻专业人士、情侣夫妇到成长中的家庭。住宅之外，园林环境、生活设施、私人停车位和门禁管理，让日常生活更从容、更轻松。",
"Convenience extends beyond the front door. With retail integrated into the development, including Jaya Grocer as an anchor tenant, everyday essentials are brought closer to home. Nearby, residents are surrounded by established destinations such as GM Klang, AEON Mall Bukit Tinggi and Bukit Tinggi Medical Centre, while the operational Bandar Bukit Tinggi LRT station adds another layer of connectivity to the wider Klang Valley.": "便利不止于家门口。项目内设有零售空间，并以 Jaya Grocer 为主力租户，日常所需近在咫尺。周边有 GM Klang、AEON Mall Bukit Tinggi 和 Bukit Tinggi Medical Centre 等成熟地标，已通车的 Bandar Bukit Tinggi LRT 站更让您轻松往返整个巴生谷。",
"Yet Rosedale is not defined by any single feature. Its appeal comes from the way everything comes together — <0>freehold ownership, an established address, contemporary homes, everyday convenience and growing connectivity</0>.": "然而，Rosedale 的魅力不在于单一亮点，而在于一切的完美结合 — <0>永久地契、成熟地段、现代住宅、日常便利，以及日益完善的交通</0>。",
"A home rooted in a mature neighbourhood, yet designed for what comes next.": "扎根成熟社区，为未来而设计的家。",
"This is Rosedale.": "这就是 Rosedale。",
"Rosedale is a freehold mixed-use development on 5.379 acres in Bandar Botanic, Klang, with two towers of serviced apartments (480 units in Tower A, Phase 1, and 496 in Tower B, Phase 2) above a podium of retail shops, business suites and parking.<0/> <1/> Residents get a 60,051 sq ft facilities deck with 26 facilities and 4-tier security, with the Bandar Bukit Tinggi LRT station about 1 km away.": "Rosedale 是位于巴生 Bandar Botanic、占地 5.379 英亩的永久地契综合发展项目，两栋服务式公寓（第 1 期 A 座 480 个单位，第 2 期 B 座 496 个单位）矗立于由零售店铺、商务套房和停车场组成的裙楼之上。<0/> <1/> 住户可享用 60,051 平方尺的设施平台，内含 26 项设施，并配备 4 层保安系统；距 Bandar Bukit Tinggi LRT 站约 1 km。",
