"About Sutera Suites @ KL City Gateway": "关于 Sutera Suites @ KL City Gateway",
"Sutera Suites is the first launch at KL City Gateway, the transit-oriented masterplan by Sunsuria and Suezcap in Kampung Baru, Kuala Lumpur. The 46-storey tower stands beside LRT Kampung Baru and the Saloma Link, the pedestrian bridge that carries you over to Jalan Ampang and KLCC. The suites come fully furnished, start at 425 sq ft and are priced from RM575,000, giving buyers a city-centre address within walking distance of the Petronas Twin Towers.": "Sutera Suites 是 KL City Gateway 的首个推出项目。KL City Gateway 是 Sunsuria 与 Suezcap 在吉隆坡 Kampung Baru 打造的公共交通导向（TOD）总体规划。这栋 46 层高楼紧邻 LRT Kampung Baru 站和 Saloma Link 行人天桥，走过天桥便是 Jalan Ampang 和 KLCC。套房附全套家具，面积 425 平方尺起，售价 RM575,000 起，让买家在市中心拥有一个步行可达国油双峰塔的地址。",
"There are two studio layouts. Type A offers 425 sq ft, and Type A1, set in the corner positions, offers 450 sq ft. Each is one open room with its own bathroom, so the space can be arranged for sleeping, working and relaxing without walls in the way. Suites face either north toward Genting or south toward the KL skyline. The layouts suit professionals who need a base in the city, owners who spend part of the week in Kuala Lumpur, and buyers who plan to let the suite. Under a memorandum of understanding signed in July 2026, Maple Hospitality Group is set to manage Sutera Suites under its MapleSuites brand.": "共有两种开放式格局：A 型面积 425 平方尺；A1 型位于转角，面积 450 平方尺。每个单位都是一个开放空间，附独立浴室，睡眠、工作和休闲区可自由安排，不受墙面阻隔。套房朝北可望云顶，朝南则面向吉隆坡城市天际线。这些格局适合需要在市区落脚的专业人士、每周部分时间待在吉隆坡的业主，以及打算出租的买家。根据 2026年7月签署的合作备忘录，Maple Hospitality Group 将以旗下 MapleSuites 品牌管理 Sutera Suites。",
"Getting around is the main draw. LRT Kampung Baru is about a five-minute walk away, one stop from KLCC and four from KL Sentral, where the KLIA Ekspres departs. The Saloma Link is around 300 m from the tower, and Suria KLCC is about 15 minutes on foot. MRT Raja Uda on the Putrajaya Line is a 13-minute walk, and the National Heart Institute is around 2 km by road. The developer also plans dedicated ramps to and from the AKLEH, subject to approval.": "交通便利是最大亮点。步行约五分钟即到 LRT Kampung Baru 站，一站到 KLCC，四站到可搭乘 KLIA Ekspres 的 KL Sentral。Saloma Link 距大楼约 300 米，步行约 15 分钟可到 Suria KLCC。步行 13 分钟可到布城线的 MRT Raja Uda 站，国家心脏中心车程约 2 km。发展商也计划兴建进出 AKLEH 的专属匝道，以获批准为准。",
"Facilities are spread across three floors. The Level 8 podium has a swimming pool, leisure, jacuzzi and kids' pools, a pool deck, a gym, a pickleball court in the multipurpose hall, a BBQ pavilion, a garden trail, a nursery and a prayer zone. Level 41 holds the Sky Business Lounge with a sky terrace and business suite, and Level 43 is the Sky Entertainment Hub. A hotel-style reception welcomes guests, and street-front retail sits at the base of the tower.": "设施分布在三个楼层。第 8 层裙楼设有游泳池、休闲池、按摩池和儿童池、池畔平台、健身房、设于多功能厅内的匹克球场、烧烤凉亭、花园步道、托儿所和祈祷区。第 41 层是 Sky Business Lounge，设有空中露台和商务套房；第 43 层则是 Sky Entertainment Hub。酒店式接待大堂迎接访客，大楼底层设有临街零售店铺。",
"Sutera Suites suits buyers who want a furnished suite in central Kuala Lumpur with rail and KLCC within walking distance. It is a leasehold development, and completion is expected in 2030.": "Sutera Suites 适合想在吉隆坡市中心拥有附家具套房、步行即可到轨道交通和 KLCC 的买家。项目为租赁地契，预计于 2030 年竣工。",
"7.95 Acres": "7.95 英亩",
"KL City Gateway is a transit-oriented development on 9.66 acres along Jalan Sungai Baru, Kampung Baru, across the AKLEH from KLCC. Sutera Suites is the first launch in its 7.95-acre Phase 1, which is planned for serviced suites, residences, offices, retail and public space.<0/> <1/> Sutera is a 46-storey tower at the western end of the site, beside the Saloma Link and LRT Kampung Baru. It has street-front retail at its base and facilities on Levels 8, 41 and 43. Later towers are planned further east.": "KL City Gateway 是位于 Kampung Baru Jalan Sungai Baru 沿线、占地 9.66 英亩的公共交通导向发展项目，与 KLCC 隔着 AKLEH 大道相望。Sutera Suites 是其 7.95 英亩第 1 期的首个推出项目，第 1 期规划有服务式套房、住宅、办公室、零售及公共空间。<0/> <1/> Sutera 是一栋 46 层高楼，位于地段西端，紧邻 Saloma Link 和 LRT Kampung Baru 站。大楼底层设有临街零售店铺，设施位于第 8、41 及 43 层。后续大楼计划建于更东边。",
