"<0>Gleneagles Kuala Lumpur<1>4.6 km · Private hospital on Jalan Ampang</1></0><2>12 min</2>": "<0>Gleneagles Kuala Lumpur<1>4.6 km · 位于 Jalan Ampang 的私人医院</1></0><2>12 分钟</2>",
"Sutera Suites is developed by KL City Gateway Sdn. Bhd., the company behind the KL City Gateway masterplan in Kampung Baru. Sunsuria Berhad, a Bursa Malaysia-listed group established in 1989 under Tan Sri Datuk Ter Leong Yap, raised its stake in the company to 61% in April 2026 and now holds it as a subsidiary. The remaining 39% is held by Suez Capital Sdn Bhd (Suezcap) and Transworld Equity Sdn Bhd. Sunsuria's businesses span property development, construction, landscape, education and healthcare.": "Sutera Suites 由 KL City Gateway Sdn. Bhd. 发展，该公司负责 Kampung Baru 的 KL City Gateway 总体规划。Sunsuria Berhad 是大马交易所上市集团，1989 年在 Tan Sri Datuk Ter Leong Yap 领导下成立，已于 2026年4月将其在该公司的持股增至 61%，使之成为子公司。其余 39% 股权由 Suez Capital Sdn Bhd（Suezcap）和 Transworld Equity Sdn Bhd 持有。Sunsuria 的业务涵盖产业发展、建筑、园林景观、教育和医疗保健。",
"The two partners bring complementary experience. Suezcap's group developed KL Gateway on Jalan Kerinchi, an integrated development with a shopping mall, residences and the Menara Suezcap office towers. Sunsuria's own developments include the Sunsuria Forum suites and serviced apartments in Selangor and RIA Sunsuria in Kwasa Damansara. At KL City Gateway, Sunsuria leads the project's execution and provides financial backing for the first phase, while Suezcap remains a shareholder and partner.": "两家合作伙伴的经验相辅相成。Suezcap 集团发展了 Jalan Kerinchi 的 KL Gateway，这是一个包含购物中心、住宅和 Menara Suezcap 办公大楼的综合发展项目。Sunsuria 自家的项目包括雪兰莪的 Sunsuria Forum 套房与服务式公寓，以及 Kwasa Damansara 的 RIA Sunsuria。在 KL City Gateway，Sunsuria 主导项目执行，并为第一期提供资金支持，Suezcap 则继续担任股东和合作伙伴。",
