"About Taman Ara Bayu 2": "关于 Taman Ara Bayu 2",
"Taman Ara Bayu 2 is a freehold landed neighbourhood of 40 terrace homes in Mantin, Negeri Sembilan, developed by PFA Land, a Homecity Group company. Buyers choose between 16 single-storey and 24 double-storey terrace houses, with KPKT-approved prices from RM438,800, and completion targeted for December 2026 with construction already well advanced.": "Taman Ara Bayu 2 是位于森美兰文丁的永久地契有地住宅区，共 40 间排屋，由 Homecity Group 旗下的 PFA Land 发展。买家可在 16 间单层排屋和 24 间双层排屋之间选择，经地方政府发展部（KPKT）批准的售价 RM438,800 起，目标于 2026年12月竣工，工程已进入后期阶段。",
"The single-storey homes sit on 20' × 76' lots with 1,312 sq ft of built-up space. Everything is on one level: a living room opening to the dining area and kitchen, four bedrooms including a master bedroom, two bathrooms and a covered car porch in front. It is a rare layout for families with young children or elderly parents who want four bedrooms without stairs.": "单层排屋地段为 20' × 76'，建筑面积 1,312 平方尺。所有空间都在同一层：客厅连通饭厅和厨房，四间卧室（含主卧）、两间浴室，屋前设有盖顶车廊。对家有幼儿或年长父母、想要四房又不想爬楼梯的家庭来说，这样的格局相当难得。",
"The double-storey homes offer 1,715 sq ft on 20' × 75' lots. Downstairs are the living and dining areas, a kitchen, a utility area, a guest bedroom with its own bathroom and a small rear garden; upstairs, a family hall connects the master bedroom with its attached bathroom and two further bedrooms. With four bedrooms and three bathrooms, it suits growing families and multi-generation households, and the homes come ready for an auto-gate.": "双层排屋地段为 20' × 75'，建筑面积 1,715 平方尺。楼下有客厅、饭厅、厨房、工作区、附独立浴室的客房和屋后小花园；楼上的家庭厅连接附浴室的主卧和另外两间卧室。四房三浴，适合成长中的家庭和三代同堂，房屋也已为安装自动门做好准备。",
"Mantin town is a few minutes' drive away: SK Mantin is about 1.7 km from the site, with Linton University College, KFC, banks and the Mantin health clinic all within roughly 3.5 km. The LEKAS Highway's Mantin toll plaza is about 5.8 km away, linking north to Semenyih and Kajang and south to Seremban, while AEON Mall Nilai is around 15 km and Seremban town under 20 km.": "文丁市区只需几分钟车程：SK Mantin 距项目约 1.7 km，Linton University College、KFC、银行和文丁卫生诊所都在约 3.5 km 范围内。LEKAS 大道的文丁收费站约 5.8 km，北通士毛月和加影，南达芙蓉；AEON Mall Nilai 约 15 km，芙蓉市区不到 20 km。",
"For first-time buyers and upgraders looking for freehold landed living within reach of the Klang Valley, Taman Ara Bayu 2 pairs practical four-bedroom layouts with Mantin's small-town convenience. Contact the developer to check which units are still available.": "对想在巴生谷附近拥有永久地契有地住宅的首购族和换屋族来说，Taman Ara Bayu 2 结合了实用的四房格局与文丁小镇的便利。欢迎联系发展商，查看还有哪些单位。",
"Approx. 3.8 Acres": "约 3.8 英亩",
"Taman Ara Bayu 2 is located on the edge of Mantin town in the Seremban district of Negeri Sembilan, close to the Kajang–Seremban route and the LEKAS Highway. The wider Ara Bayu 2 scheme occupies approximately 3.8 acres of freehold land, with building plans approved by Majlis Bandaraya Seremban and no encumbrances on the title.<0/> <1/> This listing covers the scheme's 40 terrace homes: 16 single-storey terraces on 20' × 76' lots (1,312 sq ft built-up) and 24 double-storey terraces on 20' × 75' lots (1,715 sq ft built-up). End and corner lots vary in size. The same scheme also includes 17 affordable townhouses sold under a separate permit, which are not part of this listing.<2/> <3/> The homes are built with a reinforced-concrete frame, brick walls with cement render, concrete roof tiles on lightweight trusses, aluminium-framed windows and ceramic floor tiles. Every house comes fenced with 1,500 mm PVC-coated chain-link fencing and a mild-steel gate, and each has a covered car porch at the front; the double-storey homes add a rear garden and are pre-wired with auto-gate and gate-light points.<4/> <5/> The developer is targeting completion in December 2026. Sale and purchase agreements are under Schedule G, with vacant possession due within 24 months of the first agreements signed in April 2025, and the developer's progress reports to KPKT show construction well advanced.": "Taman Ara Bayu 2 位于森美兰芙蓉县文丁镇边缘，靠近加影–芙蓉路线和 LEKAS 大道。整个 Ara Bayu 2 计划占地约 3.8 英亩永久地契土地，建筑图则已获芙蓉市政厅（Majlis Bandaraya Seremban）批准，地契无任何产权负担。<0/> <1/> 本页涵盖该计划的 40 间排屋：16 间单层排屋，地段 20' × 76'（建筑面积 1,312 平方尺）；24 间双层排屋，地段 20' × 75'（建筑面积 1,715 平方尺）。尾端单位和角头单位面积不一。同一计划另有 17 间以独立准证出售的可负担城镇屋，不属于本页范围。<2/> <3/> 房屋采用钢筋混凝土结构、水泥批荡砖墙、轻型屋架配混凝土瓦片、铝框窗户及瓷砖地板。每间房屋都设有 1,500 mm 高的 PVC 涂层铁丝网围篱和低碳钢大门，屋前设盖顶车廊；双层排屋另设屋后花园，并已预先铺设自动门和门灯线路。<4/> <5/> 发展商目标于 2026年12月竣工。买卖合约采用 Schedule G（G 表格），交屋期为 2025年4月首批合约签署后 24 个月内；发展商呈交 KPKT 的进度报告显示，工程已进入后期阶段。",
