"PFA Land Sdn Bhd (Co. No. 201401024459 / 1100547-T) is a licensed housing developer within Homecity Group, operating from the group's office at Kajang Prima, Selangor. Taman Ara Bayu 2 in Mantin is its current residential development, delivered under a developer licence issued by the Ministry of Housing and Local Government.": "PFA Land Sdn Bhd（公司注册号 201401024459 / 1100547-T）是 Homecity Group 旗下的持牌房屋发展商，在集团位于雪兰莪 Kajang Prima 的办公室运营。文丁的 Taman Ara Bayu 2 是其目前的住宅项目，持有地方政府发展部发出的发展商执照。",
"Homecity Group has been building in the Kajang–Semenyih corridor since 2001 and is ISO 9001 certified, with a StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) recognition and a Sin Chew Business Excellence Award in 2020. In Mantin, sister company Homecity Realty completed Taman Ara Bayu, a 97-home terrace scheme that received its Certificate of Completion and Compliance in January 2025 — the same neighbourhood name that Taman Ara Bayu 2 now continues.": "Homecity Group 自 2001 年起在加影–士毛月走廊发展项目，获 ISO 9001 认证，曾获 StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) 奖项及 2020 年星洲企业楷模奖。在文丁，姐妹公司 Homecity Realty 已完成共 97 间排屋的 Taman Ara Bayu，并于 2025年1月获得完工及合格证书（CCC）— Taman Ara Bayu 2 正是延续这个社区名称。",
