"About Taman Dato’ Harun 1": "关于 Taman Dato’ Harun 1",
"A single-storey terrace home on a lot half as deep again as the usual — 20 by 91.95 feet, so behind the 840 sq ft house sits a private rear garden nearly 40 feet long, with a covered car porch and a long driveway in front. Inside are three bedrooms and two bathrooms on one level, with no stairs: the master bedroom has its own bathroom, the living room opens from the porch, and the kitchen and dining area lead straight out to that garden.": "这是一间单层排屋，地段比一般深一半 — 20 x 91.95 尺，因此在 840 平方尺的屋子后面，还有一个近 40 尺长的私人后花园，屋前则有盖顶车廊和长车道。屋内三房两浴都在同一层，无需爬楼梯：主卧附独立浴室，从车廊直接进入客厅，厨房和饭厅可直通后花园。",
"Every home carries an individual freehold title on Malay Reserve land, priced from RM365,000. Corner and end lots up to 43.9 feet wide carry extra side land for a garden or a future extension, and every lot keeps the same full 91.95-foot depth.": "每间房屋都位于马来保留地，持有永久地契独立地契，售价 RM365,000 起。角头和尾端单位宽达 43.9 尺，附带侧边余地，可作花园或日后扩建；所有地段都保持相同的 91.95 尺深度。",
"There are only 25 homes here, on a single quiet lane off Jalan Dato' Harun in the Telok Gong – Pulau Indah corridor. A 99 Speedmart is three minutes away, SMK Pulau Indah six, and the Pulau Indah Expressway two minutes at the Petron — putting Westports nine minutes and Port Klang Free Zone eleven from the door, with AEON Bukit Tinggi and Klang town about eighteen.": "这里只有 25 间房屋，坐落在 Telok Gong – Pulau Indah 走廊、Jalan Dato' Harun 旁的一条宁静小巷。到 99 Speedmart 只需三分钟，SMK Pulau Indah 六分钟，从 Petron 油站上 Pulau Indah 大道只需两分钟 — 出门九分钟到 Westports，十一分钟到巴生港口自由区，到 AEON Bukit Tinggi 和巴生市区约十八分钟。",
"Construction is already 72% complete, with completion expected in 2027 — this is a neighbourhood you can watch being finished, not a promise on paper. Seven homes are already sold; enquire now to choose from the eighteen that remain, and ask about the latest promotion privately.": "工程已完成 72%，预计 2027 年竣工 — 这是一个您可以亲眼看着完工的社区，而不是纸上的承诺。已售出七间；现在就咨询，从剩下的十八间中挑选，并私下询问最新优惠。",
"1.9 Acres (approx.)": "约 1.9 英亩",
"Taman Dato' Harun 1 comprises 25 single-storey terrace houses on PT 124921, fronting Lorong Dato' Harun 6A/KS13 off Jalan Dato' Harun in the Telok Gong - Pulau Indah corridor of Klang, Selangor. The homes are arranged in two blocks along a single lane - 12 homes (Nos. 1-23) and 13 homes (Nos. 25-49) - with a designated entrance from Jalan Dato' Harun and an open space at the far end of the lane. Each home has a built-up of 840 sq ft (20' x 42') on land of 20' x 91.95'; end lots are 25.8 feet wide and the corner lot 43.9 feet. All homes have three bedrooms and two bathrooms, ceramic-tiled living areas and bedrooms, homogeneous-tiled kitchen and bathrooms, aluminium-framed windows and sliding door, and single-phase wiring with an air-conditioning point provided. The building plan (MPK/BGN-600-5/1/0008(2022)) is approved by Majlis Bandaraya Diraja Klang, and the homes are sold with individual freehold titles on Malay Reserve land under Schedule G sale and purchase agreements. Construction is 72% complete as at the latest KPKT progress report, with completion expected in 2027.": "Taman Dato' Harun 1 共有 25 间单层排屋，位于 PT 124921，面向 Lorong Dato' Harun 6A/KS13，地处雪兰莪巴生 Telok Gong - Pulau Indah 走廊的 Jalan Dato' Harun 旁。房屋沿一条小巷分为两排 - 12 间（门牌 1-23 号）和 13 间（门牌 25-49 号）- 由 Jalan Dato' Harun 设专属入口，小巷尽头为空地。每间建筑面积 840 平方尺（20' x 42'），土地面积 20' x 91.95'；尾端单位宽 25.8 尺，角头单位宽 43.9 尺。所有房屋均为三房两浴，客厅和卧室铺瓷砖，厨房和浴室铺通体砖，配铝框窗户和推拉门，单相电线路并附冷气插座。建筑图则（MPK/BGN-600-5/1/0008(2022)）已获巴生皇城市政厅（Majlis Bandaraya Diraja Klang）批准，房屋位于马来保留地，以永久地契独立地契出售，采用 Schedule G（G 表格）买卖合约。根据最新的 KPKT 进度报告，工程已完成 72%，预计 2027 年竣工。",
