"Taman Dato' Harun 1 is developed by <0>Prima Inspirasi Development Sdn. Bhd.</0> (202101036862 / 1437162-V), a Klang-based housing developer within the Prima Impian group of Bandar Bukit Raja. Licensed by the Ministry of Housing and Local Government since June 2022 (licence 30091/06-2027/0090(A)), the company has completed two schemes within four years of licensing — Taman Merbah in Kuala Langat (51 single-storey terraces, completed September 2025) and Taman Desa Kencana in Klang (30 single-storey terraces, completed May 2026), both with certificates of completion and compliance.": "Taman Dato' Harun 1 由 <0>Prima Inspirasi Development Sdn. Bhd.</0>（202101036862 / 1437162-V）发展，这是一家以巴生为基地的房屋发展商，隶属 Bandar Bukit Raja 的 Prima Impian 集团。公司自 2022年6月起持有地方政府发展部发出的执照（执照号 30091/06-2027/0090(A)），获发执照后四年内已完成两个项目 — 瓜拉冷岳的 Taman Merbah（51 间单层排屋，2025年9月完工）和巴生的 Taman Desa Kencana（30 间单层排屋，2026年5月完工），两者均已获得完工及合格证书。",
"Taman Dato' Harun 1 is its third project on site, sold under advertising and sale permit 30091-3/05-2027/0341(N)-(L), and the wider group's record around Klang includes Taman Tok Muda Permai in Kapar, Taman Desa Baiduri and Taman Desa Permai in Klang, and Taman Bentara in Kuala Langat, alongside the group's current phases at Pulau Indah and Kapar.": "Taman Dato' Harun 1 是其第三个动工项目，以广告及销售准证 30091-3/05-2027/0341(N)-(L) 出售。集团在巴生一带的往绩还包括 Kapar 的 Taman Tok Muda Permai、巴生的 Taman Desa Baiduri 和 Taman Desa Permai，以及瓜拉冷岳的 Taman Bentara，另有集团目前在 Pulau Indah 和 Kapar 进行中的各期项目。",
