"About Taman Langat Utama 2 (Bungalow House)": "关于 Taman Langat Utama 2 (Bungalow House)",
"<0>Taman Langat Utama 2</0> introduces a limited collection of six single-storey bungalow homes in Bukit Changgang, Kuala Langat, Selangor. Set within a low-density residential development of 30 landed homes, the bungalow enclave offers a quieter and more private alternative to the surrounding terrace residences. The development is situated near Bukit Changgang’s everyday conveniences, major road connections and routes towards Banting, Klang and Kuala Lumpur International Airport.": "<0>Taman Langat Utama 2</0> 在雪兰莪瓜拉冷岳 Bukit Changgang 推出限量六间单层独立式洋房。这个低密度住宅区共有 30 间有地房屋，其中的洋房区比周边排屋更宁静、更私密。项目邻近 Bukit Changgang 的日常生活设施和主要道路，可通往万津、巴生及吉隆坡国际机场。",
"Each bungalow provides a generous four-bedroom, two-bathroom layout designed for comfortable single-level living. The open arrangement brings the living, dining and kitchen areas together while allowing bedrooms to remain practical and private. With no stairs between key spaces, the homes are suitable for families who value convenience, accessibility and easier daily movement.": "每间洋房都是宽敞的四房两浴格局，专为舒适的单层生活而设计。开放式布局将客厅、饭厅和厨房连成一体，卧室则保持实用与私密。主要空间之间没有楼梯，适合重视便利、无障碍和日常行动轻松的家庭。",
"The bungalow homes sit on larger plots than the terrace houses, with documented bungalow land dimensions ranging from approximately 50.2 feet to 54.9 feet in depth and 79.7 feet in width, depending on the type. Built-up areas range from approximately 1,233 to 1,292 sq ft. The limited six-home supply consists of three Type A units, two Type B units and one Type C unit, giving buyers a choice of bungalow layouts within the same development.": "洋房地段比排屋更大，根据资料，洋房土地深度约 50.2 至 54.9 尺、宽度 79.7 尺，视类型而定。建筑面积约 1,233 至 1,292 平方尺。限量六间包括三间 A 型、两间 B 型和一间 C 型，让买家在同一项目中有不同的洋房格局可选。",
"The brochure also presents an exclusive Aqara smart-home offer for the bungalow homes, including smart access, monitoring and lighting-control features, subject to the developer’s applicable terms. Combined with private outdoor space, individual car-parking areas and a single-storey layout, the homes are positioned for buyers seeking a more spacious and distinctive family residence in the Bukit Changgang area.": "宣传册还为洋房推出 Aqara 智能家居独家优惠，包括智能门禁、监控和灯光控制功能，以发展商的相关条款为准。加上私人户外空间、独立停车区和单层格局，这些洋房适合想在 Bukit Changgang 一带拥有更宽敞、更与众不同的家庭住宅的买家。",
"Taman Langat Utama 2 is a 30-home landed residential development in Bukit Changgang, comprising 24 single-storey terrace homes and six single-storey bungalow homes. This listing focuses on the bungalow component, which forms the more private and spacious portion of the overall development. The project is located in Kuala Langat, Selangor, on leasehold tenure with a documented 99-year term ending on 24 June 2119.<0/> <1/> The bungalow component consists of six detached homes arranged as three Type A units, two Type B units and one Type C unit. The homes provide four bedrooms and two bathrooms, with built-up areas ranging from approximately 1,233 to 1,292 sq ft. Their larger plots create a more open residential setting than the terrace row, with space for private landscaping, outdoor use and individual arrival areas.<2/> <3/> The wider site plan is organised around internal residential roads serving both the terrace and bungalow sections. The bungalow homes occupy separate detached plots within the development, while the terrace homes are arranged in rows along the internal road network. The site also identifies open-space and utility areas, including a designated open-space parcel and electrical substation, supporting the basic infrastructure of the neighbourhood.<4/> Located near Bukit Changgang’s established conveniences, Taman Langat Utama 2 offers access to nearby schools, local retail, places of worship, petrol stations and road links towards Banting, Sepang, Nilai and KLIA.": "Taman Langat Utama 2 是位于 Bukit Changgang 的有地住宅项目，共 30 间房屋，包括 24 间单层排屋和六间单层独立式洋房。本页介绍的是洋房部分，也是整个项目中更私密、更宽敞的区域。项目位于雪兰莪瓜拉冷岳，为 99 年地契，根据记录于 2119年6月24日到期。<0/> <1/> 洋房部分共有六间独立式洋房，包括三间 A 型、两间 B 型和一间 C 型，均为四房两浴，建筑面积约 1,233 至 1,292 平方尺。较大的地段营造出比排屋更开阔的居住环境，可用于私人园艺、户外活动和独立的停车区。<2/> <3/> 整体地盘围绕内部住宅道路规划，同时服务排屋区和洋房区。洋房各自位于独立地段，排屋则沿内部道路成排而建。地盘内也划定了空地和公用设施区，包括一块指定空地和变电站，为社区提供基本基础设施。<4/> Taman Langat Utama 2 邻近 Bukit Changgang 的成熟生活设施，附近有学校、本地商店、宗教场所、油站，并有道路通往万津、雪邦、汝来和 KLIA。",
