"About Taman Langat Utama 2 (Terraced House)": "关于 Taman Langat Utama 2 (Terraced House)",
"<0>Taman Langat Utama 2</0> is a thoughtfully planned collection of 24 single-storey terrace homes in Bukit Changgang, Selangor. Designed for comfortable everyday living, each home offers 967 sq ft of built-up space with 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms—suited to young families, first-time homeowners, and buyers looking for a practical landed home.": "<0>Taman Langat Utama 2</0> 是位于雪兰莪 Bukit Changgang、经过精心规划的 24 间单层排屋。每间建筑面积 967 平方尺，3 房 2 浴，专为舒适的日常生活而设计，适合年轻家庭、首次购屋者，以及想要实用有地住宅的买家。",
"The development includes intermediate, end and corner terrace lots, giving buyers a choice of lot configurations while retaining a functional single-storey layout. Each residence is planned with essential living spaces for day-to-day convenience, including a car porch, living and dining areas, kitchen, bedrooms, bathrooms and a yard area.": "项目包括中间、尾端和角头排屋，买家可选择不同地段，同时保留实用的单层格局。每间住宅都规划了日常所需的基本空间，包括车廊、客厅和饭厅、厨房、卧室、浴室及晾衣区。",
"Located in Bukit Changgang, Taman Langat Utama 2 places daily essentials within reach. 99 Speedmart and Petronas Bukit Changgang are nearby, while schools such as SK RTB, KAFA Bukit Changgang, Kolej MARA Banting and SMK Bandar Banting serve the surrounding community. Mitsui Outlet Park KLIA and Xiamen University Malaysia are also within the wider area.": "Taman Langat Utama 2 位于 Bukit Changgang，日常所需触手可及。附近有 99 Speedmart 和 Petronas Bukit Changgang 油站，周边社区还有 SK RTB、KAFA Bukit Changgang、Kolej MARA Banting 和 SMK Bandar Banting 等学校。Mitsui Outlet Park KLIA 和 Xiamen University Malaysia 也在周边一带。",
"The location provides convenient connections towards KLIA, Putrajaya, Dengkil and Nilai via Jalan Labohan Dagang–Nilai, Putrajaya–Dengkil–KLIA, ELITE and PLUS highways. KLIA is approximately 12 km away, offering added convenience for frequent travellers and working professionals.": "项目可经 Jalan Labohan Dagang–Nilai，以及 Putrajaya–Dengkil–KLIA、ELITE 和 PLUS 大道，便捷通往 KLIA、布城、龙溪和汝来。KLIA 距离约 12 km，对经常出行的人士和上班族更加方便。",
"Taman Langat Utama 2 is currently under construction, with expected completion in 2027. Contact Imperial Land for the latest approved prices, current availability and further guidance.": "Taman Langat Utama 2 目前建筑中，预计 2027 年竣工。请联系 Imperial Land，了解最新批准价格、现有单位及更多详情。",
"Taman Langat Utama 2 is a 24-unit single-storey terrace development in Bukit Changgang, Selangor, comprising intermediate, end and corner terrace homes. Each residence offers 967 sq ft of built-up space with 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, designed for practical family living. Located near everyday conveniences and key routes towards KLIA, Putrajaya, Dengkil and Nilai, the development is currently under construction with expected completion in 2027.": "Taman Langat Utama 2 是位于雪兰莪 Bukit Changgang 的单层排屋项目，共 24 个单位，包括中间、尾端和角头排屋。每间建筑面积 967 平方尺，3 房 2 浴，为实用的家庭生活而设计。项目邻近日常生活设施，以及通往 KLIA、布城、龙溪和汝来的主要路线，目前建筑中，预计 2027 年竣工。",
