"Discover exclusive low-density living at Taman Perigi Nenas with our Single-Storey Semi-Detached homes. Designed with expansive ground-floor layouts and generous private side-yard space, these homes offer maximum privacy and modern comfort for growing families in Pulau Indah, Klang.": "在 Taman Perigi Nenas 享受独特的低密度生活。单层半独立式洋房拥有宽敞的平面格局和充裕的私人侧院，为巴生 Pulau Indah 成长中的家庭带来十足的私密感与现代舒适。",
