"Upgraded Electrical Provision: Equipped with 13A power outlets (12 units), lighting points (13 units), fan points (2 units), air-conditioning supply point, and telephone point.": "升级电气配置：配备 13A 电源插座（12 个）、灯位（13 个）、风扇位（2 个）、冷气供电位及电话插座。",
