"<0>Prime Accessibility:</0> Situated along Persiaran Sultan Abdul Aziz and Lebuhraya Pulau Indah with quick routes to Westports, Bandar Bukit Tinggi, Shah Alam, and KLIA.": "<0>交通便利：</0>位于 Persiaran Sultan Abdul Aziz 和 Lebuhraya Pulau Indah 沿线，可快速前往 Westports、Bandar Bukit Tinggi、莎阿南和 KLIA。",
"≈ 2.4 Acres": "≈ 2.4 英亩",
"Lot 4767 is a freehold parcel of Malay Reserve land in Kampung Perigi Nenas, Pulau Indah, approved for 30 single-storey homes under KPKT permit 13520-5: eight semi-detached homes, which form this listing, and 22 terrace homes listed separately. It adjoins PT 151310, where the group's sister company is building a further 26 terrace homes, so the two parcels together form a neighbourhood of 56 homes off Jalan Imam Yusof.<0/> <1/> The parcel is served by a new cul-de-sac lane, Lorong Imam Yusof 37/KS13, running north to south through the middle of the site. The eight semi-detached homes stand in four pairs along the eastern side of the lane, numbered 1 to 15, facing the row of terrace homes on the western side. A 15-foot drainage reserve runs along the northern boundary, the southern end of the parcel is reserved as open space, and a compact electrical substation sits beside the northernmost pair at the north-east corner.<2/> <3/> Each semi-detached lot measures 63.5 by 63 feet, with the house set on the shared party wall and the remaining land running along the open side, front and rear. The corner homes at the head of the rows, Nos. 1 and 13, and the end lot at No. 15 have additional frontage, with No. 1 on a lot roughly 71 feet wide. The car porch and driveway face the lane, the utility room and kitchen sit at the rear, and fencing is a combination of cement wall, steel fence and chain-link.<4/> <5/> This is a small, open street neighbourhood rather than a gated scheme.": "Lot 4767 是 Pulau Indah 的 Kampung Perigi Nenas 一块永久地契马来保留地，获 KPKT 准证 13520-5 批准兴建 30 间单层住宅：其中 8 间半独立式洋房即本项目，另有 22 间排屋另行上架。它与 PT 151310 相邻，集团旗下姐妹公司正在该地段兴建另外 26 间排屋，两块地合起来形成 Jalan Imam Yusof 旁一个共 56 间住宅的社区。<0/> <1/> 一条新建的尽头小路 Lorong Imam Yusof 37/KS13 由北向南贯穿地段中央。8 间半独立式洋房分成 4 对，排列在小路东侧，门牌 1 至 15 号，对面是西侧的一排排屋。北面边界有一条 15 尺宽的排水保留地，地段南端划为休闲空地，东北角最北一对洋房旁设有一座小型变电站。<2/> <3/> 每个半独立式地段为 63.5 x 63 尺，房子靠共用墙而建，其余土地分布在开放的一侧及前后。排头的角头单位（1 号和 13 号）以及末端的 15 号门面更宽，其中 1 号的地段宽约 71 尺。车棚和车道面向小路，杂物间和厨房位于后方，围篱由水泥墙、铁栏和铁丝网组合而成。<4/> <5/> 这是一个小巧开放的街区，而不是封闭式门禁社区。",
