"Prima Vistaria Development Sdn. Bhd. (201001033177) is the licensed developer of Lot 4767, Taman Perigi Nenas, and a member of the Prima Impian group of Bandar Bukit Raja, Klang. It holds a current housing developer's licence from the Ministry of Housing and Local Government, and this phase is sold under advertising and sale permit 13520-5 with a JPN-approved brochure. The group focuses on modest landed neighbourhoods across Klang district and has built repeatedly on Pulau Indah.": "Prima Vistaria Development Sdn. Bhd.（201001033177）是 Taman Perigi Nenas 所在地段 Lot 4767 的持牌发展商，隶属巴生 Bandar Bukit Raja 的 Prima Impian 集团。公司持有地方政府发展部发出的有效房屋发展商执照，本期以广告与销售准证 13520-5 出售，售楼手册已获国家房屋局（JPN）批准。集团专注于在巴生县发展规模适中的有地住宅社区，并多次在 Pulau Indah 建房。",
"The company's record on the national TEDUH registry shows four completed schemes, all with certificates of completion: Taman Dataran Abadi in Sepang (42 terrace homes, 2016), Taman Desa Bukit Permata in Klang (56 terrace and semi-detached homes, 2020), 30 double-storey semi-detached homes at Jalan Tanjung Gelang, Klang (2022) and Taman Teluk Nipah on Pulau Indah (30 single-storey semi-detached homes, completed February 2024). Taman Perigi Nenas follows the same single-storey semi-detached format the company delivered at Teluk Nipah, on the same island, two years earlier.": "根据国家 TEDUH 注册系统的记录，公司已完成 4 个项目，全部取得完工证书：雪邦的 Taman Dataran Abadi（42 间排屋，2016 年）、巴生的 Taman Desa Bukit Permata（56 间排屋及半独立式洋房，2020 年）、巴生 Jalan Tanjung Gelang 的 30 间双层半独立式洋房（2022 年），以及 Pulau Indah 的 Taman Teluk Nipah（30 间单层半独立式洋房，2024年2月完工）。Taman Perigi Nenas 沿用公司两年前在同一岛上 Teluk Nipah 交付的单层半独立式设计。",
