"About Taman Perigi Nenas (Terraced House)": "关于 Taman Perigi Nenas (Terraced House)",
"Taman Perigi Nenas is a new neighbourhood of single-storey terrace homes in Kampung Perigi Nenas on Pulau Indah, Klang, developed by the Prima Impian group. It brings together 48 freehold terrace homes on two adjoining parcels reached from Jalan Imam Yusof, a short drive from the Pulau Indah Expressway, Westports and the Port Klang Free Zone. The land is Malay Reserve, so the homes are offered to eligible Malay buyers, with prices from RM335,000 to RM390,000.": "Taman Perigi Nenas 是巴生 Pulau Indah 的 Kampung Perigi Nenas 全新单层排屋社区，由 Prima Impian 集团发展。项目共有 48 间永久地契排屋，坐落在两块相邻地段上，由 Jalan Imam Yusof 进出，开车不久即可抵达 Pulau Indah 大道、Westports 和巴生港口自由区（PKFZ）。这里是马来保留地，因此开放给符合资格的马来买家购买，售价 RM335,000 至 RM390,000。",
"Every home is a single-storey terrace with three bedrooms and two bathrooms on a practical family layout: a living room at the front, a master bedroom with its own bathroom, two further bedrooms, a dining area that opens to the kitchen, and a second bathroom serving the household. Three lot sizes are available. Type A sits on a 22-foot by 70-foot lot with a built-up of 880 sq ft, Type B on a 20-foot by 70-foot lot with 800 sq ft, and Type C on a 20-foot by 64-foot lot, also 800 sq ft. Each house has a covered car porch with its own driveway, a turfed strip at the rear, tiled floors throughout, aluminium-framed windows and sliding door, and single-phase wiring with an air-conditioning point already provided. Corner and end lots come with extra side land.": "每间都是单层排屋，3 房 2 浴，格局实用适合家庭：前面是客厅，主卧附独立浴室，另有两间卧室，饭厅与厨房相通，还有第二间浴室供全家使用。共有 3 种地段面积：A 型地段 22 x 70 尺，建筑面积 880 平方尺；B 型地段 20 x 70 尺，800 平方尺；C 型地段 20 x 64 尺，同样 800 平方尺。每间都有带顶棚的车棚和独立车道、后方草地、全屋瓷砖地板、铝框窗户和推拉门，以及已配好冷气插座的单相电线。角头和末端单位另有额外侧地。",
"Daily needs are close at hand. SK Pulau Indah and a 99 Speedmart on Persiaran Masjid Sultan Abdul Aziz are about a kilometre away, SMK Pulau Indah is around a 12-minute drive, and the expressway is roughly eight minutes away, linking the island to Port Klang, the Shah Alam Expressway and the wider Klang Valley. For residents who work in the port and logistics zone, Port Klang Free Zone is about ten minutes away and the Westports area about fifteen. Bigger shopping trips and the district hospital are on the mainland at Bandar Bukit Tinggi and Klang town, around 25 minutes by car.": "日常所需近在咫尺。SK Pulau Indah 和 Persiaran Masjid Sultan Abdul Aziz 的 99 Speedmart 约 1 公里远，SMK Pulau Indah 约 12 分钟车程，大道约 8 分钟，连接巴生港口、莎阿南大道和整个巴生谷。在港口和物流区工作的居民，到巴生港口自由区约 10 分钟，到 Westports 一带约 15 分钟。若要大采购或看县医院，就要到岛外的 Bandar Bukit Tinggi 和巴生市区，车程约 25 分钟。",
"Construction is under way on both parcels, with completion expected in November 2027 for the Lot 4767 homes and December 2027 for the PT 151310 homes under the developer's Schedule G sale and purchase agreement. The homes suit first-time buyers and young families looking for a landed home with a private porch and garden strip at a landed-terrace price, as well as buyers with roots on Pulau Indah who want to stay close to family, the mosque and the local schools.": "两块地段均已动工，根据发展商的 Schedule G 买卖合约，Lot 4767 的住宅预计 2027年11月竣工，PT 151310 的住宅预计 2027年12月竣工。这些房子适合首次购屋者和年轻家庭，以排屋的价格拥有附私人车棚和小花园的有地住宅；也适合在 Pulau Indah 土生土长、想住得离家人、清真寺和本地学校近一些的买家。",
"Taman Perigi Nenas occupies two adjoining freehold parcels on Malay Reserve land in Kampung Perigi Nenas, Pulau Indah, on the south side of Jalan Imam Yusof. Lot 4767 is approved for 30 homes under KPKT permit 13520-5 and PT 151310 for 26 homes under permit 14168-2, giving a neighbourhood of 56 single-storey homes, of which 48 are terraces offered in this listing and 8 are semi-detached homes listed separately.<0/> <1/> Each parcel is laid out along its own new cul-de-sac lane off Jalan Imam Yusof. On Lot 4767, Lorong Imam Yusof 37/KS13 runs down the middle of the site with the terraces in a single row on the western side, the 12 Type A homes (Nos. 2 to 24) at the northern end and the 10 Type B homes (Nos. 26 to 44) to the south, facing the eight semi-detached homes across the lane. The southern end of the parcel is reserved as open space, and a 15-foot drainage reserve runs along the northern boundary. On PT 151310, Lorong Imam Yusof 37A/KS13 serves two rows of 13 Type C homes, Nos. 1 to 25 and Nos. 27 to 51, with the same drainage reserve on the north side.<2/> <3/> The homes follow one plan family. The house itself is 40 feet deep with the car porch and driveway in front and a turfed strip behind; Type A is 22 feet wide and Type B and Type C are 20 feet wide, with Type C on a shorter 64-foot lot. Corner lots at the head of each row and end lots at the tail have additional side land, in some cases more than 20 feet on the corner homes. Fencing is a combination of cement wall, steel fence and chain-link, and each house is supplied with single-phase power; a compact electrical substation sits at the north-east corner of Lot 4767.<4/> <5/> The layout is a simple, low-rise street neighbourhood rather than a gated scheme: no shared facilities are provided, and the appeal lies in individual freehold title, a private porch and garden strip, and a location minutes from the island's schools, the expressway and the port employment zones. Both parcels are under construction, with completion expected in November 2027 for Lot 4767 and December 2027 for PT 151310.": "Taman Perigi Nenas 坐落在 Pulau Indah 的 Kampung Perigi Nenas，位于 Jalan Imam Yusof 南侧，由两块相邻的永久地契马来保留地组成。Lot 4767 获 KPKT 准证 13520-5 批准兴建 30 间住宅，PT 151310 获准证 14168-2 批准兴建 26 间，合共形成 56 间单层住宅的社区，其中 48 间排屋属本项目，另外 8 间半独立式洋房另行上架。<0/> <1/> 每块地段都沿着各自新建的尽头小路规划，由 Jalan Imam Yusof 进出。在 Lot 4767，Lorong Imam Yusof 37/KS13 贯穿地段中央，排屋在西侧排成一排：北端是 12 间 A 型（2 至 24 号），南边是 10 间 B 型（26 至 44 号），隔着小路与 8 间半独立式洋房相对。地段南端划为休闲空地，北面边界有一条 15 尺宽的排水保留地。在 PT 151310，Lorong Imam Yusof 37A/KS13 两旁是两排各 13 间的 C 型排屋，分别是 1 至 25 号和 27 至 51 号，北面同样有排水保留地。<2/> <3/> 所有住宅采用同一系列的平面设计。房子本身深 40 尺，前面是车棚和车道，后面是草地；A 型宽 22 尺，B 型和 C 型宽 20 尺，其中 C 型的地段较短，为 64 尺。每排排头的角头单位和排尾的末端单位都有额外侧地，部分角头单位多出 20 尺以上。围篱由水泥墙、铁栏和铁丝网组合而成，每间都供应单相电；Lot 4767 东北角设有一座小型变电站。<4/> <5/> 这是简单的低层街区，而不是封闭式门禁社区：没有公共设施，卖点在于独立永久地契、私人车棚和小花园，以及距离岛上学校、大道和港口就业区只需几分钟。两块地段均在建筑中，Lot 4767 预计 2027年11月竣工，PT 151310 预计 2027年12月竣工。",
