"Taman Perigi Nenas is developed by two companies under the Prima Impian group of Bandar Bukit Raja, Klang. Prima Vistaria Development Sdn. Bhd. develops Lot 4767, comprising Type A and B terraces, while Prima View Development Sdn. Bhd. develops the adjoining PT 151310 with Type C terraces. Both hold valid housing developer licences and separate advertising and sale permits.": "Taman Perigi Nenas 由巴生 Bandar Bukit Raja 的 Prima Impian 集团旗下两家公司发展。Prima Vistaria Development Sdn. Bhd. 负责 Lot 4767，包括 A 型和 B 型排屋；Prima View Development Sdn. Bhd. 负责相邻的 PT 151310，即 C 型排屋。两家公司均持有有效的房屋发展商执照，以及各自的广告与销售准证。",
"The group focuses on small landed developments in Klang and Pulau Indah, with completed projects including Taman Teluk Nipah, Taman Desa Bukit Permata, Jalan Tanjung Gelang and Desa Baiduri. Taman Perigi Nenas continues this track record of modest, approved landed residential schemes.": "集团专注于在巴生和 Pulau Indah 发展小型有地住宅，已完成的项目包括 Taman Teluk Nipah、Taman Desa Bukit Permata、Jalan Tanjung Gelang 和 Desa Baiduri。Taman Perigi Nenas 延续了集团一贯规模适中、手续齐全的有地住宅项目记录。",
