"Modern Single-Storey Terrace Homes in Pulau Indah, Klang | Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8": "巴生 Pulau Indah 现代单层排屋 | Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8",
"Discover affordable, modern living at Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8, strategically located in the growing hub of Pulau Indah, Klang. Designed with practical open-plan layouts and practical space utilization, these single-storey terrace houses offer an ideal entry point for first-time home buyers, families, and investors seeking long-term value in Selangor.<0/> Key Highlights:": "在 Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 享受实惠的现代生活，项目位于蓬勃发展中的巴生 Pulau Indah，地点优越。单层排屋采用实用的开放式格局，空间利用得当，是首次购屋者、家庭以及在雪兰莪寻求长期价值的投资者的理想入门之选。<0/> 主要亮点：",
"Tenure: Freehold / Malay Reserve (<0>Kekal - Rezab Melayu</0>)": "地契：永久地契 / 马来保留地（<0>Kekal - Rezab Melayu</0>）",
