"‬‭‬‭‬‭Layout: 3 bedroom + 2 bathroom": "格局：3 房 + 2 浴",
"Price From: RM 335,000 - RM 377,000": "售价：RM 335,000 - RM 377,000",
"Target Completion: 2027": "预计竣工：2027 年",
"Developer: Impian Lestari Development Sdn. Bhd.": "发展商：Impian Lestari Development Sdn. Bhd.",
"Why Choose Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8?": "为什么选择 Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8？",
"<0>Functional Layout</0>: Features an expansive living area, dedicated dining space, modern wet/dry kitchen setup, and a private car porch accommodating your vehicles.": "<0>实用格局</0>：宽敞的客厅、独立饭厅、现代干湿厨房，以及可停放您车辆的私人车棚。",
"<0>Quality Specifications</0>: Fully tiled living room and bedrooms with premium homogeneous tiles for kitchen and bathrooms. Comes with durable aluminum sliding doors and modern finishes throughout.": "<0>优质规格</0>：客厅和卧室全铺瓷砖，厨房和浴室采用优质均质砖。配备耐用的铝制推拉门，全屋现代装修。",
"<0>Strategic Accessibility</0>: Positioned with seamless connectivity to key routes—Lebuhraya Pulau Indah and Persiaran Masjid Sultan—offering quick access to Westports, Bandar Bukit Tinggi, Shah Alam, USJ, KLIA, and Kuala Lumpur.": "<0>交通便利</0>：衔接 Lebuhraya Pulau Indah 和 Persiaran Masjid Sultan 等主要道路，快速通往 Westports、Bandar Bukit Tinggi、莎阿南、USJ、KLIA 和吉隆坡。",
"<0>Nearby Amenities</0>: Close to local schools, Masjid Sultan Abdul Aziz, community centers, and local eateries along Pantai Aceh.": "<0>周边设施</0>：邻近本地学校、Masjid Sultan Abdul Aziz、社区中心，以及 Pantai Aceh 沿岸的本地食肆。",
"Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 occupies a freehold Malay Reserve site in the southwest of Pulau Indah, the island township at Port Klang, within the established grid of roads off Persiaran Masjid Sultan and Jalan Imam Yusof. The development is being delivered as three concurrent phases under separate sale permits, together bringing 72 new homes to the neighbourhood.<0/> <1/> The composition is deliberately uniform: every unit is a single-storey terrace house of 800 sq ft with three bedrooms and two bathrooms. Two phases, totalling 42 homes, sit on 20 ft by 64 ft lots, while the 30-home third phase uses deeper 20 ft by 66.5 ft lots; corner lots across the scheme carry wider gardens. Homes are arranged in conventional terrace rows fronting the local road grid, each with its own gated compound, covered car porch and cement-and-steel perimeter fencing.<2/> <3/> The approved layout places the rows alongside the neighbourhood's existing daily anchors: a mosque, the Sekolah Agama Rakyat Perigi Nenas religious school and a row of food stalls, with the Pantai Acheh shoreline to the west. Access runs through the island's internal roads to the Pulau Indah Expressway a few minutes north, which connects to Westports in one direction and the mainland highway network in the other.<4/> <5/> Sales opened from late 2025 across the three permits, each under Schedule G agreements with 24-month delivery obligations, giving contractual handover deadlines of December 2027 for the first two phases and March 2028 for the third. The developer's own target completion is December 2027, and reported construction progress ranged from 38 to 50 percent as at August 2026.": "Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 坐落在 Pulau Indah 西南部的一块永久地契马来保留地上。Pulau Indah 是巴生港口的岛屿城镇，项目位于 Persiaran Masjid Sultan 和 Jalan Imam Yusof 一带成熟的道路网内。项目分三期同步推出，各自持有销售准证，合共为社区带来 72 间新住宅。<0/> <1/> 设计刻意统一：每个单位都是 800 平方尺的单层排屋，3 房 2 浴。其中两期共 42 间，地段为 20 x 64 尺；第三期 30 间，采用较深的 20 x 66.5 尺地段；全区的角头单位都有较大的花园。住宅以传统排屋形式面向本地道路排列，每间都有独立的围篱庭院、带顶棚的车棚，以及水泥加铁栏的外围围篱。<2/> <3/> 获批的规划让排屋紧邻社区现有的日常生活点：一座清真寺、Sekolah Agama Rakyat Perigi Nenas 宗教学校和一排小食档，西边是 Pantai Acheh 海岸。经岛内道路往北几分钟即可上 Pulau Indah 大道，一头通往 Westports，另一头接上岛外的大道网络。<4/> <5/> 三份准证下的单位从 2025 年底起陆续开售，均采用 Schedule G 合约，交屋期限为 24 个月，因此合约规定前两期须在 2027年12月前交屋，第三期则在 2028年3月前。发展商自定的竣工目标是 2027年12月，截至 2026年8月，各期的建筑进度介于 38% 至 50%。",
