"Impian Lestari Development Sdn. Bhd. (201501031075 / 1156399-P) is a Klang-based housing developer within the Prima Impian group of companies, operating from Bandar Bukit Raja. The company holds a current housing developer's licence valid until September 2027, and all three phases of Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 are sold under advertisement and sale permits approved by the National Housing Department, with building plans approved by Majlis Bandaraya Diraja Klang.": "Impian Lestari Development Sdn. Bhd.（201501031075 / 1156399-P）是一家以巴生为基地的房屋发展商，隶属 Prima Impian 集团，办公地点在 Bandar Bukit Raja。公司持有有效期至 2027年9月的房屋发展商执照，Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 的三期均以国家房屋局批准的广告与销售准证出售，建筑图则已获巴生皇城市政厅批准。",
"The company's delivery record on the national TEDUH registry is entirely within Klang district and entirely completed: Taman Meru Jaya, a 24-unit double-storey semi-detached scheme handed over in 2020; Desa Bukit Permata, 22 single-storey terrace homes completed in 2021; and Taman Teluk Nipah, a 30-unit terrace and semi-detached scheme completed with CCC in 2023. Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 continues this pattern of small, focused landed phases, backed by the wider Prima Impian group, which is concurrently developing landed schemes across Klang through its sister companies.": "根据国家 TEDUH 注册系统，公司的交付记录全部位于巴生县，而且全部已完成：Taman Meru Jaya，24 个单位的双层半独立式洋房项目，2020 年交屋；Desa Bukit Permata，22 间单层排屋，2021 年完工；以及 Taman Teluk Nipah，30 个单位的排屋和半独立式洋房项目，2023 年完工并取得 CCC。Taman Persiaran Masjid Sultan 8 延续这种小规模、专注的有地住宅分期开发模式，背后有 Prima Impian 集团支持；集团也正通过旗下姐妹公司在巴生各地同步发展有地住宅项目。",
