"Four bedrooms, two bathrooms and your own freehold land from RM385,000 — <0><1>Taman Tok Muda Mulia</1></0> gives a growing family the single-storey terrace home that Kapar has been short of. Each house sits on a 20' × 64' lot with 820 sq ft of living space arranged entirely on one level: a living room off the covered car porch, a master bedroom beside it, two bathrooms, a dining area that flows into the kitchen, and three further bedrooms for children, parents or a home office. No stairs, no shared walls above or below, and a private porch and driveway at the front.": "4 房 2 浴，加上自家永久地契土地，RM385,000 起 — <0><1>Taman Tok Muda Mulia</1></0> 为成长中的家庭带来加埔一直缺少的单层排屋。每间坐落在 20' × 64' 地段上，820 平方尺的居住空间全在同一层：客厅紧连带顶棚的车棚，旁边是主卧，两间浴室，饭厅连着厨房，另有 3 间卧室可给孩子、父母住或当家庭办公室。不用爬楼梯，楼上楼下没有邻居，前面还有私人车棚和车道。",
"The homes come ready to move into rather than ready to renovate. Ceramic tiles run through every room including the kitchen and bathrooms, the windows and rear sliding door are aluminium-framed, and the wiring is already in place for daily life — ten power points, eleven lighting points, an air-conditioning point, TV, phone and two ceiling fans. The block-end homes add a wide strip of side land, with the corner lot on the brochure more than twice the width of an intermediate home: room for a garden, an extension or a second car.": "房子交屋即可入住，不必先装修。包括厨房和浴室在内，每个空间都铺上瓷砖；窗户和后方推拉门为铝框；电线也已为日常生活配好 — 10 个电源插座、11 个灯位、冷气插座、电视、电话插座和 2 把吊扇。每排尽头的住宅附有一大片侧地，手册上的角头单位宽度更超过中间单位的两倍：可以种花园、扩建或多停一辆车。",
"Location is the second reason to choose here. Sekolah Kebangsaan Tok Muda is about a kilometre from the door, and Kapar town, with its market, government clinic, police station, supermarkets and mosque, is around ten minutes away. The Kapar interchange of the West Coast Expressway is roughly 13 minutes out, putting Setia Alam, Shah Alam and the Klang hospitals within a 22- to 26-minute drive while the neighbourhood itself stays quiet: one lane, two rows of houses, and a playground reserved at the end of the street.": "地点是选择这里的第二个理由。Sekolah Kebangsaan Tok Muda 离家约 1 公里，加埔市区约 10 分钟车程，那里有巴刹、政府诊所、警察局、超市和清真寺。西海岸大道的加埔交流道约 13 分钟，开车 22 至 26 分钟即可到实达阿南、莎阿南和巴生的医院，而社区本身依然宁静：一条小路、两排房子，街尾还规划了儿童游乐场。",
"The land is freehold Malay Reserve, so the homes are offered to eligible Malay buyers with no leasehold clock and full individual title. The developer, Prima Inspirasi Development Sdn. Bhd. of the Prima Impian group, handed over Taman Merbah in 2025 and Taman Desa Kencana in 2026 with certificates of completion, and its group built Taman Tok Muda Permai in this very neighbourhood in 2020. Construction has started under a Schedule G agreement with completion expected in August 2028 — enquire now to be walked through the plan, the lots and the price for each home.": "这里是永久地契马来保留地，因此开放给符合资格的马来买家购买，没有租约年限递减的顾虑，并拥有完整的独立地契。发展商 Prima Inspirasi Development Sdn. Bhd. 隶属 Prima Impian 集团，已于 2025 年交付 Taman Merbah、2026 年交付 Taman Desa Kencana，两者均取得完工证书；集团也在 2020 年于同一社区建成 Taman Tok Muda Permai。项目已根据 Schedule G 合约动工，预计 2028年8月竣工 — 现在就咨询，了解每间房子的规划、地段和价格。",
"≈ 3.7–4 Acres": "≈ 3.7–4 英亩",
"Taman Tok Muda Mulia occupies Lot 3996, a long freehold parcel of Malay Reserve land in Tok Muda, Kapar, approved by Majlis Bandaraya Diraja Klang for 64 single-storey terrace houses under KPKT permit 30091-4. The parcel is entered from Jalan Benteng Kanan at its southern end, and a new spine road, Jalan Ruyong 9/KU14, runs the length of the site with the homes arranged in two facing rows on either side.<0/> <1/> Each row is divided into two blocks of sixteen houses by a cross gap midway along the lane. The western row carries the odd-numbered homes, Nos. 1 to 31 in the southern block and Nos. 33 to 63 in the northern block; the eastern row carries the even numbers, Nos. 2 to 32 and Nos. 34 to 64. Every lot measures 20 feet by 64 feet, with the homes at the ends of each block enjoying additional side land, and the brochure's floor plan shows a corner lot more than twice the width of an intermediate home.<2/> <3/> The northern end of the parcel is reserved for the neighbourhood's own playground and open space, with the sewage treatment plant, its buffer zone and the electrical substation set beyond the last homes, and drainage reserves run along the northern and southern boundaries. Fencing is a combination of cement wall, steel fence and chain-link, and each house has a single-phase supply and a covered car porch.<4/> <5/> This is a straightforward street neighbourhood rather than a gated scheme: no clubhouse or shared facilities are provided beyond the playground, and the appeal lies in individual freehold title, four bedrooms on one level and a location minutes from Kapar town and the West Coast Expressway. Construction has started, with completion expected in August 2028.": "Taman Tok Muda Mulia 坐落在加埔 Tok Muda 的 Lot 3996，是一块狭长的永久地契马来保留地，获巴生皇城市政厅批准，以 KPKT 准证 30091-4 兴建 64 间单层排屋。地段南端由 Jalan Benteng Kanan 进出，一条新建主干道 Jalan Ruyong 9/KU14 贯穿整个地段，住宅分成两排，在道路两旁相对而立。<0/> <1/> 每排在小路中段有一个横向间隔，分成两个区块，每块 16 间。西排是单号门牌，南区块 1 至 31 号，北区块 33 至 63 号；东排是双号，2 至 32 号和 34 至 64 号。每个地段为 20 x 64 尺，每个区块尽头的住宅都有额外侧地，手册的平面图显示角头单位的宽度是中间单位的两倍以上。<2/> <3/> 地段北端划为社区专属的儿童游乐场和休闲空地，污水处理厂及其缓冲区和变电站则设在最后一间住宅之外，南北边界设有排水保留地。围篱由水泥墙、铁栏和铁丝网组合而成，每间都有单相电供应和带顶棚的车棚。<4/> <5/> 这是一个朴实的街区，而不是封闭式门禁社区：除了游乐场外没有会所或公共设施，卖点在于独立永久地契、单层 4 房，以及距离加埔市区和西海岸大道只需几分钟。项目已动工，预计 2028年8月竣工。",
