"Taman Tok Muda Mulia is developed by Prima Inspirasi Development Sdn. Bhd. (202101036862), a member of the Prima Impian group of Bandar Bukit Raja, Klang. The company holds a current housing developer's licence from the Ministry of Housing and Local Government (30091/06-2027/0090(A)) and sells this phase under advertising and sale permit 30091-4 with a JPN-approved brochure. Licensed in 2022, it has already completed two landed schemes with certificates of completion: Taman Merbah in Kuala Langat, 51 single-storey terrace homes handed over in September 2025, and Taman Desa Kencana in Klang, 30 single-storey terrace homes completed in May 2026. Its third scheme, Taman Dato' Harun 1 in Klang, is more than 70 per cent built.": "Taman Tok Muda Mulia 由 Prima Inspirasi Development Sdn. Bhd.（202101036862）发展，该公司隶属巴生 Bandar Bukit Raja 的 Prima Impian 集团。公司持有地方政府发展部发出的有效房屋发展商执照（30091/06-2027/0090(A)），本期以广告与销售准证 30091-4 出售，售楼手册已获国家房屋局（JPN）批准。公司于 2022 年获得执照，至今已完成两个有地住宅项目并取得完工证书：瓜拉冷岳的 Taman Merbah，51 间单层排屋，2025年9月交屋；以及巴生的 Taman Desa Kencana，30 间单层排屋，2026年5月完工。第三个项目是巴生的 Taman Dato' Harun 1，建筑工程已完成超过 70%。",
"The wider Prima Impian group has been building modest landed neighbourhoods across Klang district for over a decade and already knows Tok Muda: its parent company completed Taman Tok Muda Permai, 18 single-storey semi-detached homes in the same area, in 2020, alongside Taman Desa Permai, Taman Desa Baiduri and Taman Bentara. Taman Tok Muda Mulia follows the same pattern of fully approved, single-storey phases delivered by a group with a local track record.": "Prima Impian 集团十多年来一直在巴生县各地兴建规模适中的有地住宅社区，对 Tok Muda 并不陌生：母公司于 2020 年在同一地区完成了 Taman Tok Muda Permai（18 间单层半独立式洋房），此外还有 Taman Desa Permai、Taman Desa Baiduri 和 Taman Bentara。Taman Tok Muda Mulia 沿用同样的模式：手续齐全的单层分期项目，由在本地有实绩的集团交付。",
