"Here at TuJu, the vibrant pulse of urban living seamlessly blend with a sense of calm and tranquility. Welcome to your new coveted address in town, where the strands of community, opulence and convenience are woven into a tapestry of unparalleled blended living.": "在 TuJu，都市生活的活力脉动与宁静祥和完美交融。欢迎来到您在市区梦寐以求的新地址，在这里，社区、奢华与便利交织成无与伦比的综合生活。",
"TuJu, stands as a mixed-development masterpiece, offering a harmonious blend of diverse living spaces to choose from. With an impressive assortment of lifestyle facilities and the added luxury of on-site retail, TuJu ensures everything you need is within your grasp, all in a single, captivating address.": "TuJu 是综合发展项目的杰作，提供多元和谐的居住空间任您选择。丰富的生活设施，加上项目内的零售商铺，让您所需的一切触手可及，尽在同一个迷人地址。",
"Nestled in the heart of Jalan Kuching, you'll relish the convenience that great connectivity provides, whether to nearby MITEC, KL Metropolis, KLCC or further afield. Here, your life takes centre stage, in a home where every element resonates with your unique lifestyle.": "坐落于 Jalan Kuching 中心地带，交通四通八达，无论是前往邻近的 MITEC、KL Metropolis、KLCC 还是更远的地方都十分方便。在这里，生活以您为中心，家中每个细节都与您独特的生活方式相呼应。",
