"TuJu Retail is the rare shop lot that comes with its customers already built in. Its 38 strata retail lots sit in the podium of TuJu Residences, with two 41-storey towers of 932 homes rising above, on Persiaran Arfah off Jalan Kuching. Thirty-four have already been taken up; the last four, all on the first floor of the north row, are now open for e-Enquiry.": "TuJu Retail 是难得一见、自带客源的店铺单位。38 个分层零售单位位于 TuJu Residences 的裙楼，楼上是两座 41 层高、共 932 户的住宅大楼，地址在 Jalan Kuching 旁的 Persiaran Arfah。其中 34 个已被认购；最后 4 个都位于北排第 1 层，现已开放 e-⁠Enquiry。",
"Each of the four is sized for real trade: 1,249 to 1,410 sq ft of floor area with an 8.4 m or 6.5 m frontage and a 17.85 m depth, plus a 205 sq ft accessory parcel or alfresco area that comes with the lot. That suits a clinic, tuition centre, salon, café, office or showroom serving the residents upstairs and the neighbourhood around them.": "这 4 个单位的面积都适合真正做生意：楼面面积 1,249 至 1,410 平方尺，门面宽 8.4 米或 6.5 米，深 17.85 米，另附 205 平方尺的附属地段或户外空间。适合开设诊所、补习中心、美发沙龙、咖啡馆、办公室或展示厅，服务楼上住户和周边社区。",
"The location does the rest of the work. The DUKE expressway passes just north of the site, KTM Segambut is about 3.0 km away and the MRT Jalan Ipoh station about 3.7 km, so staff and customers arrive easily from Mont Kiara, Sentul, Kepong and the city. The bigger malls — Publika, Solaris Mont Kiara, Sunway Putra — are a seven- to eight-minute drive, close enough to draw from but far enough that TuJu's row is the everyday stop for the homes around it.": "其余的，就交给地点。DUKE 大道就在项目北面经过，KTM Segambut 约 3.0 km，MRT Jalan Ipoh 站约 3.7 km，员工和顾客可轻松从满家乐、冼都、甲洞和市中心前来。较大的购物中心 — Publika、Solaris Mont Kiara、Sunway Putra — 车程 7 至 8 分钟，近得可以带来人流，又远得让 TuJu 这排店铺成为周边住户每天光顾的地方。",
"Above the shops, TuJu is being built by Distinctive World Sdn. Bhd., a joint venture of Eccaz and the Distinctive Group, with more than 50 resident facilities and construction on track towards a 2028 completion. Owning one of the last four lots means owning a strata retail unit in a community that will be occupied from the day residents move in, whether you trade from it yourself or hold it for rental income. Make an e-Enquiry and the developer’s sales representative will walk you through the remaining lots.": "店铺楼上的 TuJu 由 Distinctive World Sdn. Bhd. 兴建，这是 Eccaz 与 Distinctive Group 的联营公司，拥有超过 50 项住户设施，工程进度顺利，预计 2028 年竣工。拥有最后 4 个单位之一，就等于在一个住户一搬进来就有人气的社区里拥有一个分层零售单位，无论您自己经营还是收租投资都合适。提交 e-⁠Enquiry，发展商的销售代表会为您介绍余下的单位。",
