"<0>Persiaran Sepang, Cyberjaya, Selangor</0> · 3-Storey Link Villa": "<0>Persiaran Sepang, 赛城, 雪兰莪</0> · 3 层联排别墅",
"RM1,595,000": "RM1,595,000",
"3-Storey Link Villa": "3 层联排别墅",
"RM 1,595,000 – RM 2,604,000": "RM 1,595,000 – RM 2,604,000",
"2,628 – 3,847 sq ft": "2,628 – 3,847 平方尺",
"209 units": "209 个单位",
"WINDSOR HOMES SDN. BHD.": "WINDSOR HOMES SDN. BHD.",
"About Windsor Villa (Phase 1)": "关于 Windsor Villa (Phase 1)",
"<0>Windsor Villa</0> is a freehold development of three-storey link villas in Cyber 10, on the south-western edge of Cyberjaya, developed by Windsor Homes Sdn Bhd, a subsidiary of Hong Kong-listed Multifield International Holdings. It is the first phase of a 55-acre masterplan and one of the few new landed launches in a township that has grown almost entirely upward, offering 209 homes in a gated and guarded enclave with expected completion in August 2029.": "<0>Windsor Villa</0> 是位于赛城西南边缘 Cyber 10 的永久地契 3 层联排别墅项目，由香港上市公司 Multifield International Holdings 的子公司 Windsor Homes Sdn Bhd 发展。项目是 55 英亩总规划的第一期，也是这个几乎全往高处发展的城镇里少数的新有地住宅项目之一，在门禁保安社区内提供 209 间住宅，预计 2029年8月竣工。",
"The homes come in three layouts. The Ambrosia sits on a 20 by 50 foot lot with 2,628 to 2,890 sq ft over three floors, three or four bedrooms and four bathrooms, plus a study on the second floor. The Brooklyn stretches the lot to 60 feet for 2,883 to 3,173 sq ft, with four bedrooms, a utility room and five bathrooms. The Centurion, on a 70-foot lot, reaches 3,495 to 3,847 sq ft with five bedrooms and five bathrooms, a ground-floor guest room, a walk-in wardrobe and a second-floor family hall. Every layout has a full-width open-plan living and dining hall, en-suite bedrooms, a free-standing bathtub in the master bath, balconies, a roof terrace, a two-car porch with driveway and a dedicated EV charging point. Corner lots widen to 22 feet with a side garden.": "住宅有三种格局。Ambrosia 坐落在 20 x 50 尺地段，3 层楼面积 2,628 至 2,890 平方尺，3 或 4 房、4 浴，二楼另有书房。Brooklyn 地段加长至 60 尺，面积 2,883 至 3,173 平方尺，4 房、杂物间和 5 浴。Centurion 地段 70 尺，面积达 3,495 至 3,847 平方尺，5 房 5 浴，设有底楼客房、步入式衣帽间和二楼家庭厅。每种格局都有贯通全宽的开放式客厅与饭厅、套房式卧室、主浴室独立式浴缸、阳台、屋顶露台、可停两辆车的车棚及车道，以及专属 EV 充电位。角头单位宽至 22 尺，附侧花园。",
"Daily life stays close to home. Tamarind Square, DPulze and the Cyberjaya City Centre precinct cover dining and shopping within a few minutes' drive, Hospital Cyberjaya is about 4 km away, and Multimedia University, the University of Cyberjaya and elc International School are all within 5 to 6 km. The Putrajaya–Cyberjaya Expressway connects to the ELITE and MEX highways, with Putrajaya Sentral's ERL and MRT interchange roughly 10 km away for the KLIA and Kuala Lumpur rail links.": "日常生活就在家附近。Tamarind Square、DPulze 和 Cyberjaya City Centre 一带几分钟车程即可满足饮食和购物需求，Hospital Cyberjaya 约 4 km，Multimedia University、University of Cyberjaya 和 elc International School 都在 5 至 6 km 内。布城–赛城大道连接 ELITE 和 MEX 大道，约 10 km 外的 Putrajaya Sentral 是 ERL 和 MRT 转换站，可乘火车前往 KLIA 和吉隆坡。",
"Inside the gates, the Windsor Clubhouse anchors the community with a gym, multipurpose hall, function room and co-working space beside the swimming pool, kids' pool, playground and tennis court, while a 2.5 km green trail runs the perimeter of the site for morning runs and evening walks. Selling prices approved by the National Housing Department run from RM1,595,000 to RM2,604,000, with a 7% Bumiputera discount, making Windsor Villa a fit for growing families who want a landed home with room to spare, and for buyers who want to be early in a masterplan that still has most of its land ahead of it.": "门禁内，Windsor Clubhouse 是社区的核心，设有健身房、多功能厅、活动室和共享办公空间，旁边是游泳池、儿童池、游乐场和网球场；一条 2.5 km 的绿色步道环绕整个地段，适合晨跑和傍晚散步。国家房屋局批准的售价介于 RM1,595,000 至 RM2,604,000，土著买家享有 7% 折扣。Windsor Villa 适合想要宽敞有地住宅的成长中家庭，也适合想及早进驻、而总规划大部分土地仍有待开发的买家。",
"54.95 Acres": "54.95 英亩",
"Windsor Villa occupies a 54.95-acre freehold parcel in Cyber 10, bounded by Persiaran Sepang to the north and Persiaran Aspirasi to the south-west, acquired by Windsor Homes from Cyberjaya's master developer, Setia Haruman, in January 2024. The land is zoned residential and approved by Majlis Perbandaran Sepang for up to 967 homes comprising landed linked houses, a condominium and clubhouse facilities, to be delivered in phases.<0/> <1/> Phase 1 is the first of those phases: 209 three-storey link villas laid out in parallel rows around a central boulevard, with the Ambrosia, Brooklyn and Centurion layouts distributed across 50, 60 and 70-foot lots on a north–south orientation. Later phases will add further rows of landed homes to the west and east of Phase 1 along with the condominium component; their unit counts, layouts and timing have not yet been announced.<2/> <3/> Residents enter through a single grand guard house on Persiaran Sepang, past a guest-registration car park, into a tree-lined central boulevard that runs the length of the site with a landscaped middle lane. The Windsor Clubhouse sits at the head of the boulevard beside the swimming pool, kids' pool, playground, garden pavilion and forest garden, with a tennis court and residents' parking alongside. A jogging track traces the full perimeter, forming the 2.5 km green trail, and pocket gardens are spaced between the rows. A second entrance on Persiaran Aspirasi, together with a BBQ and glamping area, a half-court basketball and futsal court, an outdoor fitness zone and several themed gardens, is planned for a future phase.<4/> <5/> The plan keeps every home within a short walk of the clubhouse and the trail while the single controlled entrance holds through-traffic out of the residential rows. Expected completion of Phase 1 is August 2029.": "Windsor Villa 坐落在 Cyber 10 一块 54.95 英亩的永久地契土地上，北临 Persiaran Sepang，西南接 Persiaran Aspirasi，Windsor Homes 于 2024年1月向赛城的总发展商 Setia Haruman 购得此地。土地属住宅用途，已获雪邦市议会批准兴建最多 967 个住宅单位，包括有地联排住宅、一座公寓和会所设施，将分期推出。<0/> <1/> 第 1 期是首个阶段：209 间 3 层联排别墅围绕中央林荫大道平行排列，Ambrosia、Brooklyn 和 Centurion 三种格局分布在 50、60 和 70 尺的地段上，呈南北走向。后续各期将在第 1 期东西两侧增加更多有地住宅，以及公寓部分；单位数量、格局和推出时间尚未公布。<2/> <3/> 住户从 Persiaran Sepang 唯一的气派保安亭进入，经过访客登记停车场，驶入贯穿整个地段、绿树成荫、中间设有景观带的中央林荫大道。Windsor Clubhouse 位于大道起点，旁边是游泳池、儿童池、游乐场、花园凉亭和森林花园，另有网球场和住户停车场。慢跑道环绕整个地段，形成 2.5 km 的绿色步道，各排住宅之间还有小型口袋花园。Persiaran Aspirasi 的第二个入口，以及烧烤与豪华露营区、半场篮球及五人足球场、户外健身区和多个主题花园，将在未来阶段推出。<4/> <5/> 规划让每间住宅都只需步行一小段路就能到会所和步道，而唯一的管控入口也把过境车辆挡在住宅区外。第 1 期预计 2029年8月竣工。",
