"Windsor Homes Sdn. Bhd. is an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Multifield International Holdings Limited, a Hong Kong property group founded in the early 1980s and listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange since 1998, with offices in Hong Kong, Shanghai, Zhuhai and Kuala Lumpur. The group develops, invests in and manages residential and commercial property, and has operated in Malaysia since 2018 under the Windsor Land and Windsor Collection brands.": "Windsor Homes Sdn. Bhd. 是 Multifield International Holdings Limited 间接全资拥有的子公司。Multifield 是一家香港产业集团，创立于 1980 年代初，自 1998 年起在香港交易所上市，在香港、上海、珠海和吉隆坡设有办事处。集团从事住宅和商业产业的发展、投资与管理，自 2018 年起以 Windsor Land 和 Windsor Collection 品牌在马来西亚经营。",
"The Windsor name is carried by the group's completed residential projects in Shanghai, including Windsor Court and Windsor Place, and in Malaysia by ALAIA Titiwangsa, a serviced residence in Kuala Lumpur due for completion in late 2026. Windsor Villa is the group's first landed development and its flagship in Malaysia, on a 55-acre freehold parcel in Cyberjaya acquired in 2024.": "集团在上海已完成的住宅项目，包括 Windsor Court 和 Windsor Place，都以 Windsor 为名；在马来西亚则有吉隆坡的服务式住宅 ALAIA Titiwangsa，预计 2026 年底竣工。Windsor Villa 是集团首个有地住宅项目，也是其在马来西亚的旗舰项目，坐落在赛城一块 2024 年购得、55 英亩的永久地契土地上。",
