"Five reasons to start your e-Enquiry online — easy, fast, free, reliable.": "线上 e-⁠Enquiry 的五大理由：简单、快速、免费、可靠。",
"e-Enquire Anytime, Anywhere": "随时随地 e-⁠Enquiry",
"<0/>Choose and enquire about your preferred unit online.": "<0/>在线挑选心仪单位，直接咨询。",
"<0/>Smooth, guided and fully digital.": "<0/>流程顺畅、步骤清楚、全程线上。",
"<0/>Browse complete project details before enquiring—including prices, location, tenure, incentives and more.": "<0/>咨询前先看清完整项目资料：价格、地点、地契、奖励等。",
"Constantly updated unit availability": "单位状态持续更新",
