"Reliable platform": "可靠的平台",
"<0/>Enquire on official projects from reputable, established developers.": "<0/>只上架信誉良好、经验丰富的发展商的正式项目。",
"<0/>A transparent process with honest information — no hidden fees, no pressure.": "<0/>流程透明、资料真实 — 没有隐藏收费，也不会给您压力。",
