"Browse the right project for you and compare full project details, pricing, layouts, e-Enquiry incentives, and more.": "找到适合您的项目，比较项目详情、价格、格局、e-⁠Enquiry 奖励等。",
"Enquire on the exact unit you want, or speak with the developer’s sales representative first if you still have questions.": "直接咨询您想要的单位；如果还有疑问，也可以先和发展商的销售代表聊聊。",
"Booking": "预订",
"Your e-Enquiry reaches the developer’s sales representative for availability confirmation, booking guidance, and show-unit viewing.": "您的 e-⁠Enquiry 会直接送到发展商的销售代表，由他们确认单位、协助预订并安排参观样板房。",
