"5 out of 5 stars": "5 星满分",
"At first, I honestly thought the rewards sounded too good to be true. I decided to submit an e-Enquiry anyway, and the sales representative contacted me and guided me through the whole process. After completing my purchase, I actually received the e-Enquiry reward as promised!": "一开始，我真的觉得这些奖励好得不像真的。但我还是试着提交了 e-⁠Enquiry，销售代表随后联系我，从头到尾都很细心地带我走完流程。买好之后，我真的如期收到了 e-⁠Enquiry 奖励！",
"I was just browsing at first and wasn’t planning to enquire yet. After looking through the project details and available units, I found one that matched what I was looking for. I submitted an e-Enquiry and the sales representative contacted me to explain the next steps.": "一开始我只是随便看看，还没打算咨询。看完项目资料和还有的单位后，我找到了一个正合我意的单位。提交 e-⁠Enquiry 后，销售代表很快就联系我，说明接下来该怎么做。",
"I originally used iNewProject to check the available units. After completing my purchase, I also received the e-Enquiry reward attached to my eligible platform purchase!.": "我原本只是用 iNewProject 查看还有哪些单位。买好之后，我还收到了这次合格购买附带的 e-⁠Enquiry 奖励！",
"Being able to compare the floor plan, unit availability and project information before speaking to anyone saved me a lot of time. I already knew which unit I wanted when I submitted my e-Enquiry.": "还没跟任何人谈之前，就能先比较平面图、可选单位和项目资料，帮我省了很多时间。提交 e-⁠Enquiry 时，我已经很清楚自己要哪个单位。",
"I found the unit I wanted on iNewProject and submitted an e-Enquiry directly for it. The sales representative contacted me afterward and explained the pricing, promotions and next steps clearly.": "我在 iNewProject 找到想要的单位，就直接提交了 e-⁠Enquiry。之后销售代表联系我，把价格、优惠和接下来的步骤都讲得很清楚。",
"<0>Home</0> / About Us": "<0>首页</0> / 关于我们",
"About iNewProject": "关于 iNewProject",
"About iNewProject summary": "iNewProject 简介",
"iNewProject mobile platform mockup": "iNewProject 手机版界面",
"Enquire on the exact unit you want — not just the project.": "直接咨询您看中的单位，而不只是整个项目。",
"iNewProject is a Malaysian new-launch property platform that helps buyers explore developer projects, review available unit information, and submit a free e-Enquiry for the specific unit they are interested in.": "iNewProject 是马来西亚的新楼盘平台，帮助买家浏览各发展商的项目、查看还有哪些单位，并为看中的单位免费提交 e-⁠Enquiry。",
"Selected projects may include promotional benefits or e-Enquiry rewards, subject to confirmation. After e-Enquiry submission, the developer sales representative will guide the next steps.": "部分项目可能附带优惠或 e-⁠Enquiry 奖励，以最终确认为准。提交 e-⁠Enquiry 后，发展商的销售代表会带您进行下一步。",
"Project discovery is only the first step. The real decision often starts when a buyer is ready to ask about a specific unit.": "找到项目只是第一步。真正的决定，往往是从买家开始问某一个单位时才开始。",
"Why this exists": "为什么会有 iNewProject",
"Most property searches begin with the project. But the real decision usually happens at the unit level — the layout, floor, view, pricing, availability, and timing.": "大多数人找房都是从项目开始。但真正让人下决定的，通常是单位本身：格局、楼层、景观、价格、还有没有，以及时机。",
"iNewProject helps buyers move from project browsing to a unit-level e-Enquiry. Review unit information, submit an e-Enquiry, and continue with a sales representative who can confirm the latest details.": "iNewProject 帮助买家从“看项目”进一步到“问单位”：先查看单位资料，再提交 e-⁠Enquiry，接着由销售代表为您确认最新详情。",
"What makes iNewProject different": "iNewProject 有什么不同",
"Unit-Level e-Enquiry": "精准到单位的 e-⁠Enquiry",
"iNewProject allows interested buyers to submit an e-Enquiry for a specific available unit by providing basic contact details.": "有兴趣的买家只需留下基本联系资料，就能为某个还有的单位提交 e-⁠Enquiry。",
"Updated Project Information": "最新项目资料",
"Review project details, layouts, pricing guidance, and unit availability where provided.": "查看项目详情、格局、参考价格和单位状态（如有提供）。",
"Guided Next Steps": "下一步有人带",
"Continue with a developer sales representative who can confirm the latest details and guide the purchase process of your preferred unit.": "由发展商的销售代表为您确认最新详情，并协助您完成心仪单位的购买。",
"How it works": "运作方式",
"1. Browse new launch projects": "1. 浏览新楼盘",
"Start with selected developer projects and compare the options that fit your location, budget, and property needs.": "从精选的发展商项目开始，比较符合您地点、预算和需求的选择。",
"2. Review project and unit details": "2. 查看项目和单位详情",
"Check available project information, layouts, pricing guidance, and unit details where provided.": "查看项目资料、格局、参考价格和单位详情（如有提供）。",
"3. Submit an e-Enquiry": "3. 提交 e-⁠Enquiry",
"Send a free e-Enquiry for the specific unit you are interested in.": "为您看中的单位免费提交 e-⁠Enquiry。",
"4. Get guided by the sales representative": "4. 销售代表跟进",
"The relevant developer sales representative follows up with the latest details and next steps.": "发展商的销售代表会联系您，提供最新详情和下一步安排。",
"5. Not ready to submit an e-Enquiry?": "5. 还没准备好提交 e-⁠Enquiry？",
"If you are not ready to choose a unit yet, iNewProject can help you speak with the developer sales representative first, so you can ask questions before submitting an e-Enquiry.": "如果还没决定要哪个单位，iNewProject 可以先帮您联系发展商的销售代表，让您先把问题问清楚，再提交 e-⁠Enquiry。",
"Company note": "我们的话",
"As property discovery moves further online, buyers need more than general project listings. They need clear information, unit-level availability where provided, a proper path to the right sales representative, and access to selected rewards where applicable.": "越来越多人上网找房，单看一般的项目列表已经不够。买家需要清楚的资料、每个单位的状态（如有提供）、找到对的销售代表的正确途径，以及适用的精选奖励。",
"iNewProject was built for this shift — helping buyers explore new launch projects digitally, submit e-Enquiries on specific units, get guided through the next step, and unlock eligible e-Enquiry rewards subject to confirmation.": "iNewProject 正是为此而生：让买家在线浏览新楼盘、针对具体单位提交 e-⁠Enquiry、获得下一步的协助，并在确认后领取符合资格的 e-⁠Enquiry 奖励。",
